window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4401,"title":"Chapter 4401: Too Exciting And Ruthless","paragraphs":["\"What are you doing? The people in the middle, what are you doing? Do you want water? If you want water, dunk your heads into the water!\"","T6 continued shouting. His fierce voice was heard through the loudspeaker. Xia Jinyuan, G3, and Z7 heard it.","\"T6 is getting more and more unyielding. He doesn’t look like the soldier he was when he first came.\" G3 weighed the watermelon in his hand and interrupted, \"It’s not ripe, right? This watermelon.\"","\"It’s ripe. The cooking team picked eight and specially chose this big and red one for me.\" Han Zheng looked at the soldiers training in the mud pit in front and sighed. \"In the blink of an eye, I’ve become a veteran.\"","\"You’re already old, yet you’re still dreaming.\" G3 took out his combat dagger and split the watermelon into two. A clear cracking sound was heard, and the red watermelon flesh was revealed. Fresh and red watermelon juice flowed out. \"Not bad, it looks sweet!\"","One melon was cut into five pieces. T6 and V8, who were staring at the training, were left with one piece.","Xia Jinyuan took the largest slice and narrowed his eyes. He said to Han Zheng, \"Send the fruit over and eat them in front of them.\"","Han Zheng took a bite of the melon in his mouth and swallowed it. He was too anxious and even choked a few times. \"This stimulation is too strong.\"","The 30 people were soaking in the mud and shouting. The veterans stood outside the mud pit and ate watermelon as if they were watching a show. That was f*cking exciting!","Xia Jinyuan didn’t say anything more. He sat on the seat that was half a meter taller than the mountain car and moved his long legs. He lowered his eyes slightly and glanced at Han Zheng with a faint smile. He didn’t say anything, but it was enough to make Han Zheng’s heart jump. He placed the piece of watermelon in his hand aside and picked up the other two pieces before rushing over.","G3 smiled and didn’t say anything.","If they couldn’t even handle such a small matter, they would still be a long way from becoming a special forces soldier of the Xueyu unit.","Humans were very strange.","They were usually very tolerant when it came to big matters, but they were intolerant when it came to small matters.","When other people hit them a few times, they would be able to endure it when they saw how powerful the other party was.","When other people scolded them, they would retaliate on the spot. Then, the two parties would use their strength to fight. At worst, they would use their weapons.","They were angry for a moment and couldn’t tolerate it. In the end, small matters turned into big matters... It was common.","Q King was good at capturing the other party’s weakness, especially when the other party’s willpower was the weakest. He would grab it instantly and then deal with the problem. He never missed.","Back then, Q King dealt with the veterans who didn’t respect him.","They were all defeated by him one by one and finally accepted him wholeheartedly.","Even though G3 had joined the Xueyu unit two years earlier than Xia Jinyuan, he was still convinced by Xia Jinyuan.","In front, T6 and V8 took the watermelon from Z7 and took a bite. They praised it for being sweet. When the special forces soldiers in the mud saw this, their red eyes were about to flare up.","One of the special forces soldiers only relaxed his grip a little and was immediately discovered by T6, who was watching the show. T6, who was still chewing, immediately had a dark expression. He picked up the loudspeaker on the ground and shouted, \"You’re shameless! Pack your things and go home!\"","G3 clicked his tongue and said to Xia Jinyuan, \"They’re still too soft. It’ll be more intimidating if we tell them to pack their things and scram.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who had been sitting on the seat for a long time, felt uncomfortable. He placed one hand on the car door and jumped down from the car like a cheetah. He stood outside the car and stared ahead with interest in his hawk-like eyes. It was obvious that he was waiting for them to kick up a fuss."]},{"number":4402,"title":"Chapter 4402: The Scary Lieutenant Colonel Xia","paragraphs":["It was good to kick up a fuss. After kicking up a fuss a few times, they would be dealt with a few times. Slowly, their edges would smoothen and their bloodthirstiness would settle. When they encountered trouble on the battlefield, they would be calm... Slowly, they would become qualified special forces soldiers.","When they came to the Xueyu unit, they were all young men with healthy limbs and high spirits. He hoped that when they retired from the army, they would still be the same young men with healthy limbs and high spirits.","They joined the army alive, so they had to be discharged alive.","There were enough names in the martyr memorial park. He wished no more would be added.","Xia Jinyuan’s eyes turned dark bit by bit. Even the pressure around him gradually became low. He pursed his thin lips and said calmly, \"I’ve added enough boosters. Let’s see who will be the first to resist. Jot down their names.","\"There are a few guys with potential who need to be taught a lesson. A few days ago, I heard them muttering that they would put a gunnysack over my head. They haven’t done anything until now. They have ulterior motives but don’t have the guts. How boring.\"","G3 laughed. \"You’re the only one who wants to be put in a gunnysack.\" G3 raised his eyebrows and smiled again. \"If that day really comes, it’s hard to say who will take care of who.\"","Xia Jinyuan said, \"If they really have the ability to deal with me, heh, I’d be happy even if they beat me up. After being here for two years and training here for two years... it’s time for them to go for a mission.\"","\"The boss said that?\" G3 asked.","Xia Jinyuan, who was chewing a piece of grass, nodded. \"Yes, in the second half of the year.\"","On the second day after returning from Libya, Xia Jinyuan received a call from Major General Yang. He mentioned that the soldiers who hadn’t gone out to carry out missions after entering the Xueyu unit for two years would complete a border mission in the second half of the year.","They would start with the border mission before leaving the country.","G3 was silent for a moment before replying, \"So fast. In the blink of an eye, two years have passed.\"","\"Let White Crane lead the team to train us tomorrow. At the beginning of July, we’ll release an actual combat exercise in the southern wilderness...\" Xia Jinyuan didn’t finish his sentence. He thought for a moment before continuing, \"When Azure Bird has her summer vacation, we have to pull her in.\"","\"Will she play the enemy?\"","\"We’ll see. I’m more inclined to have her be with these soldiers.\"","\"It’s feasible. Since you have the intention to nurture her, she has to lead troops to fight in advance.\" G3 nodded. He was also inclined to arrange for Azure Bird to be in the team of soldiers who were about to carry out the mission in the second half of the year.","Although the soldiers who were training had been in the Xueyu unit for two years, they had never carried out any missions. They couldn’t be considered a real special forces soldier of the Xueyu unit.","The two captains talked about the training arrangements. The special forces soldiers who were training in the mud pit in front were on the verge of exploding.","The veterans who were observing their emotions in the dark recorded everything and quickly reported it to Xia Jinyuan, who had finished eating the watermelon and continued to enjoy the cool weather.","In the base, no one was watching the special forces soldiers who had yet to carry out their mission. Besides going to the toilet to shower, their every move was exposed to the veterans. Then, everything was presented in front of Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Jinyuan, who had left the team for a year and a half for Cobra, only needed three days to get all their information when he returned to the base. It had to be said that... it was terrifying.","The scary Lieutenant Colonel Xia didn’t know that his record at the National Science University had been broken by his girlfriend. Far away in Xiang City, Ye Jian stared at her boyfriend’s 400-meter obstacle course report and smiled foolishly.","She was very happy!","She was four seconds faster than Captain Xia!","The next time they met, she had to tell him that the best record for the 400-meter obstacle course in the school was hers. She would wait for her juniors to challenge her."]},{"number":4403,"title":"Chapter 4403: Happy","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was smiling, returned the transcript to the dean. The ink had faded, and there was a little yellow at the edge of the paper. She couldn’t hide the smile in her eyes.","The director and officer smiled at each other. They could understand why she was so happy.","\"Little Ye, there’s still a year left. You can work harder and graduate with better comprehensive results for the future students to use as a reference. Even if you’ve already graduated, the results you leave behind can continue to motivate them.\"","The dean laughed as he spoke. He was very happy too. Xia Jinyuan was once a student under his guidance. Now, Ye Jian, who broke the record, was a student under his command. How could he not be happy?","As for the two students from Manchester, he would deal with them however he wanted. It wouldn’t affect his good mood.","When Ye Jian returned to the dormitory, she was still secretly happy from time to time. When Xu Wen and He Jing saw her, they were shocked. Why was this woman so strange?","When she broke the record for the 400-meter obstacle course... She didn’t seem very excited at that time. Why was she so happy when she came back from the director’s office?","Xu Wen couldn’t help but ask her. The reply made Xu Wen’s and Jian’s hearts ache.","\"Senior Xia is my boyfriend. You’ve met him before. I broke his record, so I’m very happy.\"","Damn it!","Xu Wen, who was instantly heartbroken, leaned on He Jing’s shoulder and said weakly, \"I’m such a big mouth. Why did I ask? Why did I hear such a heart-wrenching answer? Did you consider the feelings of single people like us?\"","He Jing patted Xu Wen’s shoulder with heartache. \"You’re not the only one who’s hurting. I’m right here with you.\"","Ye Jian had secretly taken down Senior Xia, who was still a legend, and turned him into her boyfriend.","Hence, the two of them would be legends in the National Science University in the future.","If the juniors in the future knew about Senior Xia and Senior Ye’s true relationship, a lot of hearts would probably be broken.","Senior Xia had already graduated, but he had left behind legendary stories about himself. More than that, he was Ye Jian’s boyfriend!","The heart was feeling stifled!","\"Hurry up and tell me how you got to know Senior Xia and how you took him down! Hurry up and tell me!\" Xu Wen pounced on Ye Jian with a ferocious expression and tried to force a confession out of her.","Ye Jian laughed as she dodged. The corners of her eyes were filled with gentleness. It was for Xia Jinyuan, who was far away in a base in the north.","As for Brieth and Cartright, Ye Jian forgot about them after the competition ended.","Breith didn’t see Cartright. He wanted to ask around, but all he got was the same answer. They weren’t sure. Even the instructor gave the same answer.","As for the other four students from Manchester, they didn’t want to entertain him at all.","Manchester, which was five hours slower than the Chinese military, received the news. They found out that the two students they sent to the Chinese military school had made mistakes time and time again, and warnings didn’t change their behavior. They even tried to take revenge on the Chinese students with blank cartridges because they lost a match to them. When the news came, the Manchester military was shocked.","Right on the heels of that, a video was sent over. It made the Manchester military feel even more ashamed. Even the military school that sent Brieth and Cartright felt ashamed.","In less than a day, the procedures for sending them back to Manchester were completed. Brieth and Cartright, who had been locked up, left the National Science University overnight and were sent back to Manchester.","What awaited them was not the West Point of the United States. Instead, they would be expelled from school and sentenced to half a year in prison.","Ye Jian didn’t know that Brieth and Cartright had been sent back to their country until the end of June."]},{"number":4404,"title":"Chapter 4404: Time","paragraphs":["The third-year students entered the university entrance examination while the fourth-year students entered the graduation season. This was the third class of graduates that Ye Jian had seen off after three years in school.","The third and fourth-year seniors who trained her batch in their first year had already spread to every corner of the country. Now, they had to send off their first-year seniors.","\"Others will look at their salary after graduation. We’ll look at our motherland’s map after graduation.\"","As the graduation season approached, the seniors spent the most time looking at the map of their country. This was because there would be places they were going to. They carried their luggage and went their separate ways before they could even say goodbye.","From now on, the National Science University would become a memory of their military career. The sweat and tears that flowed on the training ground would also become memories. They didn’t know when they would be able to reunite. Some people might never meet again.","At this moment, the seniors in their fourth year wanted to relive the four years of their schooling life before they left the campus. They wanted to expel all the remaining strength in them.","The most typical thing was that during training, they would be ten times louder than the first-year and second-year students who were training next door. This stimulated the first-year and second-year instructors. They were just short of holding small leather whips to encourage the first-year and second-year students to move forward and work harder.","The third-year students were far away from this stimulation. There were only three days left until the joint exam. Five kilometers of running, 400-meter obstacle course, rifle precision shooting, formation, and other subjects were all completed in one go. If they wanted to achieve good results, they had to do their best and devote all their time and energy to practicing.","The seniors in their fourth year wanted to relive their four years in the military school while they were still in school. In that case, the third-year students would train harder. They would withstand the heat and tempering and finally take the joint exam.","Three days before the joint exam, Xiang City turned into a furnace. The temperature outside was already 37 degrees Celsius. Every time they finished training, the sweat on their bodies would wet their training clothes. They would take off their jackets and wring them again and again. It was as if they had been fished out of water.","There was no need to mention their military boots. They were soaked in sweat, and their toes were festering. Their heels and insteps were rubbed until they were badly mutilated. Once the socks were taken off, their faces turned pale as if they would stop breathing in the next second.","On the last day before the joint exam, the school showed a rare gesture of ’kindness’. That night, all the departments actually organized an outdoor movie. Moreover, it was a romance movie. The main story was that the emperor and his sister felt bored living in the palace. They sneaked to Jiangnan to relax. In the end, they both found love.","It was time for the afternoon training at 5:00 pm when they announced that they would be watching a movie outdoors. The whistle blew, and everyone gathered. The students stood at ease and looked at the side in a straight line. They endured the scorching heat under the hot sun. The sweat under their training caps gathered and turned into a stream that flowed past their cheeks and chins into their training clothes...","Sweat dripped down from their fingers like rain. Their sweat pooled in their military boots again. Their eyes were like steel as they stood up straight. No matter how tough or tired they were, they gritted their teeth and persevered. They never retreated.","Ye Jian, who had finished assembling the team, clasped her arms tightly and jogged to the front of the team in a rhythmic manner. She said in a clear and cold voice, \"Report, there should be 45 people in the third row. There are 45 people. Arrangements are complete. Please give your instructions!\"","It was sonorous and powerful. There was no fatigue.","The instructor returned the salute and asked Ye Jian to return to the team. When Ye Jian returned, the instructor standing at the front of the students took a few steps forward easily.","The eyes of the students below lit up."]},{"number":4405,"title":"Chapter 4405: Life Like Water","paragraphs":["The instructor had taught them for so long, so everyone picked up on some small habits. For instance, when the instructor was angry, he would go on stage and laugh coldly. The students in the line would know that a storm was coming and would prepare themselves.","If the instructor was happy, he would cough three times and say, \"You look like soldiers today.\" The students would then know that they could leave the training in advance and return to their dormitories to rest.","If the instructor glanced back at at the students’ faces from time to time while walking up ahead, he was deliberately delaying the announcement because he knew that there was good news. At first, he was able to scare the students, thinking that they would be punished again. After interacting with him for a long time, however, they figured it out.","After taking a few steps, the instructor stood still with his hands behind his back and coughed a few more times. Some students, like Xu Wen, couldn’t help but smile.","This was good!","It was very likely that they wouldn’t be training tonight!","Tomorrow was the joint exam. Next, the fourth-year students would be having a graduation party. The school would definitely want the third-year students to relax with the fourth-year students!","Xu Wen thought about how she could lie on the bed and sleep early tonight. She wouldn’t have to be woken up by the whistle in the middle of the night. She did not have to gather within three minutes. She almost laughed out loud.","\"The third-year students will take the joint exam tomorrow. On account of your hard work for the past few months, the school has decided to organize...\" The instructor was about to publicize the good news, but he deliberately paused. No matter how calm the students were, they were still led along by the instructor.","What did the school organize?","Xu Wen widened her eyes in anxiety.","\"Xu Wen, what are you thinking about? Your eyes are as big as an ox’s. Stop staring. No matter how much you stare, it won’t change anything.\" Xu Wen choked on her breath when the instructor suddenly called out her name. She quickly ’reported’ what she was thinking. Sweat flowed down her eyes, and it stung.","The instructor smiled at her. He didn’t believe her.","Not far away, a row of people who were training suddenly erupted in surprise. Right on the heels of that, another row of people exclaimed in surprise. It was obvious that their instructors had announced the good news.","Ye Jian saw a trace of awkwardness on the instructor’s face. He wanted to speak first, but the other platoons’ instructors snatched the chance from him.","\"On the account that you’ve been working hard for the past few months, the school decided to organize an outdoor movie tonight. After the movie ends, we’ll gather back in the dormitory.\"","Finally, the instructor stopped deliberately delaying and announced the good news tonight.","The class erupted in an instant!","This was such good news!","There was a movie to watch. After watching the movie, they could go back to their dormitory to rest and prepare for the joint exam tomorrow.","The third and fourth-year students were happily preparing to watch a movie tonight. As for what movie would be played tonight, they had never thought of asking.","Documentary films and anti-war films were mainly played during outdoor movie nights. There was no need to think about other films or ask what film would be played.","Watching a movie was secondary. The main thing was to have a good rest tonight!","The entire training ground was in an uproar. The fourth and third-year students could watch a movie tonight. As for the first and second-year students, they could watch it too, but they still had to run 3,000 meters after watching the movie. Even so, they were still excited.","\"Instructor, what movie are we watching? An action movie? A resistance film? A documentary?\" The freshmen didn’t understand the rules and lost their basic judgment as they asked loudly.","\"As long as it’s a movie, I’ll watch it. I’m not picky!\"","Some students hurriedly opened their mouths. They were afraid that the instructors would be unhappy and ask them to train with a wave of their hand."]},{"number":4406,"title":"Chapter 4406: An Uneasy Heart","paragraphs":["They had already mentioned a few genres. They only left out romance and horror. Horror films would produce some inappropriate scenes, so they wouldn’t be shown. As for romance, they hadn’t watched those movies in the military school for the past three years!","Not to mention the third-year students, even the fourth-year students had not seen it!","The third and fourth-year students didn’t ask at all. The first-year students asked excitedly while the second-year students surrounded them.","Ye Jian’s class was the first to know what movie they were watching tonight.","\"Romance movie? Is it really a romance movie? No way! Instructor, are you sure you want to watch a romance movie tonight? Are you lying to us?\"","\"I’m in my third year of military school. I’m so lucky to be able to watch a romance movie in school. I’m satisfied!\"","\"It used to be impossible, but it’s happening now. We’re watching a romance movie in school. This can be recorded in our class’ history books.\"","\"Thank you to our school, thank you to the leaders, thank you to the cadres, thank you to the instructors, thank you to the students... Thank you for letting us watch a romance movie.\"","That night, the third and fourth-year students cheered energetically. They took their small stools and entered the outdoor venue.","There were too many students. One open-air square was not enough. Hence, they were divided into two groups. The first and second-year students were in one group and watched from another training ground.","The third and fourth-year students were in the same group.","\"Prepare to place the stools... Put them down! Sit!\" As the cadres gave the order, groups of students sat down with a whoosh.","The freshman sat upright with their backs straight and their hands on their knees. They were sitting like they were in a meeting, waiting for the movie to start.","The second-year students seemed to be slightly better. They could do what they liked until the movie ended.","The third-year students were better than the second-year students. As soon as they sat down, they sat in the standard posture of the first-year students. When the movie started, they would immediately adjust to their preferred posture. They could also change their sitting posture midway. They could do whatever they wanted.","The older students like the seniors in the fourth year, especially the ’single’ seniors, were a little presumptuous. They entered the venue in advance and sat down. They looked at the other students’ standard sitting posture, but in fact, they would glance over from time to time...","What were they looking at?","Of course, they were looking at the female students.","As for the seniors who had a partner, they could often secretly swap positions at this time. The couples would end up sitting side by side. When the lights dimmed, the couples could pull some tricks.","It wasn’t easy to have a secret relationship, especially in the military school. It wasn’t easy to have a secret relationship. They couldn’t even think of holding hands on campus!","Holding hands outside the school had been their dream from the start of their relationship until the graduation season.","It was always that one party wouldn’t have the time. It wasn’t easy for them to go out for half a day on Saturday and Sunday. Either one of them would need to train. Thus, they kept on missing out on each other. The number of times they could hold hands could be counted on one hand. They could only look at each other across the class and the crowd.","They couldn’t look for too long. The inspectors and the instructors would keep an eye on them. If they weren’t careful, the couples would get into trouble together.","Hence, they had to pretend that they were not familiar with each other. They were only classmates and comrades. There was really no love between them!","Ye Jian found three pairs of lovers secretly holding hands. She thought of her boyfriend, whom she had never heard from for a long time. Was he in the country? Abroad? Training? She didn’t know anything.","There was no news, no letters, no electricity... She didn’t know if she could continue training at the Xueyu unit base during the summer vacation."]},{"number":4407,"title":"Chapter 4407: Pairs","paragraphs":["If she could go, he would be there too. They would be able to meet every day.","Also...","Her gaze landed on a pair of lovers, who were so frightened by the appearance of the officer on duty that the guy immediately let go. Ye Jian couldn’t help but purse her lips and smile.","Compared to these secret lovers in school, her relationship with Captain Xia was very free.","They could go shopping and hold hands. They could tiptoe and kiss. They even... slept on the same bed. She believed that the three couples she found here hadn’t done what she had done with Captain Xia.","She wondered if he missed her now. He probably did... As Ye Jian thought about it, her thoughts drifted away.","Before the movie even started, the mosquitoes attacked in a grandiose manner. Their arms and faces became a disaster area. Those who were unlucky were even attacked on their buttocks.","After dealing with the three mosquitoes, Ye Jian whispered to He Jing, \"The ones who are happy tonight aren’t us but the mosquitoes. I’ve already been bitten a few times.\"","\"I’ve been bitten on the outside of my thigh a few times. It’s extremely itchy. I hope the romance movie can make up for it.\"","He Jing scratched the itch lightly and wiped the sweat off her face. It was very hot in Xiang City at night. There was no wind at all. The weather forecast said that there would be rain tonight.","The hot and stuffy weather and the mosquito bites didn’t stop the students from watching the romance movie.","The movie started playing. Everyone became focused. The actors were all capable. Their acting skills were great and captured the students’ attention. They didn’t even notice that they were being bitten by mosquitoes.","It was not a pure romance movie. It was composed of kinship, friendship, and love. In the end, a few ’sensitive’ scenes appeared. The students, who were originally quiet, made all kinds of exclamations.","The on-screen couple kissed.","The male students rubbed their hands secretly when they saw this. The female students felt a little awkward when they saw this. Ye Jian’s eyes flickered and she looked away silently.","Thousands of people were watching a ’kiss scene’, and they were all students. She couldn’t take it.","Xu Wen’s small and warm voice was heard right on the heels of that. \"Have you kissed Senior Xia?\"","...","Ye Jian flicked her pinky lightly. A handsome face appeared in her mind. He had slender eyebrows and handsome facial features. When he smiled, he looked like a ruffian. He was as sharp as an arrow.","Yes, he had kissed her before.","Ye Jian didn’t answer. She just nodded lightly.","Xu Wen immediately laughed sneakily. \"How did it feel? Did Senior Xia have that?\"","Have what?","Ye Jian, who didn’t understand, turned her head and glanced at Xu Wen. The two of them were very close to each other. The night was very dark. They could only vaguely see the outline of each other’s faces. Xu Wen’s expression couldn’t be seen clearly.","Although her expression couldn’t be seen clearly, Xu Wen’s low voice was too sneaky. It was as if she had stolen the most precious treasure and couldn’t help but want to show it off.","Show off?","Huh?","Ye Jian seemed to have thought of something and couldn’t help but narrow her eyes. Could it be that... the two of them had already become a couple?","Ye Jian narrowed her eyes and asked calmly, \"How did it feel for you?\"","Xu Wen replied, \"I experienced it two days ago. Song Zhiqiu bit the tip of my tongue.\"","Just like this, Ye Jian managed to dodge the question easily.","Song Zhiqiu had some tricks up his sleeve. Last time, during the competition, he said that he wanted to find an opportunity to confess to Xu Wen. In less than a month, their relationship was confirmed. They even... kissed secretly.","Ye Jian was convinced by their speed. She knew Captain Xia when she was in the eighth grade and only confirmed their relationship when she was in grade 12. It took her four and a half years!","Xu Wen and Song Zhiqiu took less than a month to get together. They were as fast as the speed of light!"]},{"number":4408,"title":"Chapter 4408: Our Future","paragraphs":["It was a good thing to be fast and efficient. As their comrade, she was happy for the two of them. However, she was also worried because of their speed.","\"You guys sure are bold enough. If they catch you kissing in school, you’ll suffer.\" Ye Jian reminded her gently and persuaded her, \"Even if you can’t help yourself, you have to control yourself. It’ll be summer vacation soon. Bear with it.\"","The seniors who were about to leave didn’t dare to be so presumptuous. Xu Wen and Song Zhiqiu were too bold. Ye Jian had to persuade them.","\"We didn’t dare to be bold, so it was just a quick one. He bit my tongue, and I bit the skin of his mouth. It felt good, but the time was too short.\"","Thinking of the secret kiss a few days ago, Xu Wen felt that she hadn’t had enough. When she heard Ye Jian’s words, she rubbed her forehead, afraid that something would happen.","\"Control, you have to control yourself. Do you understand?\"","\"Song Zhiqiu can control himself, but I can’t... I have to learn from you!\"","Ye Jian was speechless. She couldn’t teach this child anymore!","Shouldn’t the males be the ones unable to control themselves rather than the females?","Why was it the other way around?","The movie came to an end. In the end, the lovers finally got together. The fourth-year students who were about to graduate and start a new military brigade in their country watched the only romance movie they had watched in their four years of military school. As they left in a line, tonight had become a memory.","The third-year students watched as the fourth-year students left first. Perhaps they were reflecting on themselves, but there was a hint of melancholy in their eyes.","\"It should be our turn next year...\" He Jing, who was lying on the bed, said sadly, \"I saw the fourth-year seniors leave just now. I didn’t feel good. I also saw two couples leaving with each other. Wen, do you think they’ll be assigned to the same unit?\"","Xu Wen’s heart sank. She suppressed the corners of her mouth and didn’t answer for a long time.","Would she and Song Zhiqiu be assigned to the same unit after graduating next year?","The probability was basically zero.","After washing up, Ye Jian pushed the door open and entered. She felt that the atmosphere in the dormitory was a little sad. He Jing heard the commotion and asked Ye Jian, \"Jian, which unit will you go to after graduation? Senior Xia’s unit?\"","Xu Wen, who was in a bad mood, sighed softly. \"It’s very difficult. I don’t really want to talk about this topic. Anyway, it’s unlikely that Song Zhiqiu and I will be assigned to the same unit.\"","Right then, He Jing hugged her head and gasped.","She, who didn’t know anything, was frightened by Xu Wen’s sudden revelation of her relationship. Her head was still hurting so much that it was twitching. She shouted sternly, \"Wen, you’re crazy! You’re still dating at a time like this! In the future, you’ll have to go your separate ways. How are you going to settle down?","\"Why do you have to make yourself sad when we’ll be graduating in a year?\"","She wasn’t concerned about whether Xu Wen’s relationship would be discovered. She was concerned that they wouldn’t be able to get together in the future. Wouldn’t Xu Wen be sad if that happened?","Ye Jian put down the washing basin and sat on the small stool to dry her hair. She replied to He Jing’s question, \"I’ve been working hard to get close to Senior Xia... Whether I can be assigned to Senior Xia’s unit or not depends on myself.\"","\"Which military unit is Senior Xia from?\" Xu Wen asked.","\"Field military unit. You know that my goal has always been the field military unit. Hence, the possibility of us splitting up is still very high.\"","Ye Jian didn’t hide anything and told the truth.","He Jing heaved a sigh of relief. \"There’s still a chance. Little Jian, you might be luckier than Wen.\"","\"That’s right. Jian, you’ll be luckier than me.\" Xu Wen nodded. She lacked courage after entering the field military unit, so she could only take things one step at a time.","Whether they could be allocated together depended on the graduation season next year.","Because the fourth-year students had left, the three girls in the dormitory were a little sad. They hurriedly said good night and went to sleep."]},{"number":4409,"title":"Chapter 4409: Exciting","paragraphs":["For the past few days, deafening roars could be heard on the training grounds of the National Science University’s campus. It was unknown if it was because of the romance movie that night, but it was raining heavily. All the students seemed to be on steroids. They were ready to risk their lives to participate in the university entrance examination.","The third-year joint exam was to test the results of the three years of military school training. Through this joint exam, they would know if there were any shortcomings and which areas they needed to improve. It could be said that the third-year exam was all in preparation for the ultimate fourth-year exam.","The fourth-year students had already started the final rehearsal of the graduation performance. After the juniors finished their university entrance examination, it would be their graduation performance. After the graduation performance ended, they would go their separate ways. From then on, the students who interacted with each other would have to go their separate ways. It would be difficult for them to meet again.","On the first day, Ye Jian completed her university entrance examination. She used her results to stimulate the students who hadn’t completed the university entrance examination. The students in her class were fine. They were stimulated by Ye Jian every day and worked hard every day. When the results of the university entrance examination came out, the instructor smiled and nodded. The cadres smiled and nodded too. Then, the results were sent to the department, where the leaders smiled and nodded.","Not bad. Their class had Ye Jian as their pillar of support. No matter how bad their results were, they were still better than the worst students in the other classes.","As Ye Jian was about to be in her fourth year, the cadres of the team applied to the department many times to see if they could let Ye Jian stay in school. If not, they wanted to see if they could let her graduate with a PhD. This way, it would motivate countless students to work hard.","The cadre had good intentions. The department also wanted Ye Jian to stay in school. However, even the principal couldn’t decide if Ye Jian would stay in school. Hence, when the cadre brought it up again, it was always once more.","\"Old Yao, take a break. Ye Jian won’t stay in school even if you mention it a hundred times. Take a break.\"","The leader of the department saw that the cadre was talking about the same thing again, and his facial expression was rather agitated. He sighed and said helplessly, \"I want her to stay in school too, but this matter... Let me tell you directly. The higher-ups have already made arrangements. Ye Jian really can’t stay in school.\"","\"Why can’t she stay? With her talent, she’ll definitely shine no matter where she goes. If she stays in school, she can continue to nurture talents for the country. She can also achieve a big career. Why can’t she stay in school?","\"Her comprehensive qualities are quite good. Even a few professors in the school said that as long as she really develops into a professional, with her memory and comprehension, she can choose several technological specializations. The two command information system projects she participated in have achieved good results. Our school should really try to keep such a talent.","\"She’ll be in her fourth year soon. We need to fight for her! We need to fight for the school’s future!\"","The cadre wanted Ye Jian to stay in school too much. He, who had failed a few times, was a little agitated now. The results of Ye Jian’s university entrance examination in his hand were thrown down.","When the leader saw this, he didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. \"Don’t be agitated. Calm down, Old Yao. Don’t get agitated every time Ye Jian produces good results and ask her to stay in school.","\"The school has already done many things to keep Ye Jian in school. However, it’s useless. Old Yao, look at Ye Jian’s results. Take a good look and think about it. You should understand Ye Jian’s future path as a soldier.\"","...","Ye Jian knew the path she should take and the direction she should go in the future. Hence, when the officers came to chat with her in the afternoon and asked her about her future plans, Ye Jian didn’t keep her guard up at all. She thought that it was just an ordinary chat.","After all, the officers of the team would often have heart-to-heart conversations with the students. As for her, she had three of such conversations this time."]},{"number":4410,"title":"Chapter 4410: Clear Goal","paragraphs":["Just like the previous two times, Ye Jian smiled and said, \"I really want to go to the field military unit. I’ve always been working hard to go to the field military unit. I’ve never given up on that goal.\"","...","The cadre received an unexpected answer, which confirmed the answer he got after looking at Ye Jian’s physical performance for the past three years.","He only wanted to retain the good students in the school, but Ye Jian had never thought about staying in school. Her goal was the field military unit.","Looking at the student who had firm eyes and had never wavered, the cadre was both gratified and reluctant.","Although he was reluctant, he respected the student’s choice.","\"The field military unit is not bad. Although it’s very tough, with your comprehensive qualities, all hardships will be overcome. Nothing will stump you. That’s good, that’s good...\"","The cadre didn’t reveal his intention. He just wanted to confirm if his guess was correct. Now, Ye Jian’s answer had been given. With her determination, it was impossible to change her mind.","\"Study hard. There’s still one year left. Try to go to a field military unit that can give you more space to develop. Hurry up and go back to your dormitory to rest. You still have to help the instructors with the entrance examination in the afternoon. Work hard.\"","\"Yes!\"","Ye Jian watched as the cadre strode away. She didn’t return to the dormitory until she was out of sight.","From then on, until Ye Jian graduated in her fourth year, no leader or instructor suggested that Ye Jian stay in school. As for Ye Jian, she didn’t know that the school had applied to the military for her to stay in school several times and had made many efforts.","Fortunately, Commander Xia and Major General Yang stepped in. If not, with the efforts of the military school, Ye Jian would definitely be demoted.","Later, Xia Jinyuan found out and said to Major General Yang in private, \"Fortunately, the higher-ups intervened. If not, my wife would have run away.\"","Ye Jian didn’t know that she almost stayed in school. After helping the instructor, she finally passed the toughest period in the military school that was the university entrance examination. The fourth-year graduation performance was about to start.","On the night of the end of the university entrance examination, Ye Jian and a few students were going to the laboratory. Along the way, they met a few waves of seniors. When they saw Ye Jian, they all asked her to leave a message on their graduation book.","In 2002, leaving messages in graduation books was very popular. The fourth-year students’ graduation book was a notebook distributed by the school. The front had a camouflage pattern. Ye Jian was quite frightened when she saw several books.","Ye Jian took the books respectfully and wrote her message seriously. Then, she looked at the request for her MSN username. Ye Jian recalled her username on the application that she hadn’t used for three years and wrote it down.","[The martial world has not ended. See you again.]","This was the message Ye Jian left for her seniors. She felt that she shouldn’t be the one saying words of encouragement. That would seem too arrogant of her.","The martial world had not ended, and they would meet again in the future. It was a suitable message.","When she was about to reach the laboratory, she met a few handsome fourth-year seniors in formal attire walking toward her.","When they saw Ye Jian, two seniors suddenly nudged one of the handsome seniors who was holding a book and said in a low voice, \"Quick, time waits for no man. Hurry up and grab the opportunity!\"","The footsteps of the senior who was pushed out were a little reserved at first. When Ye Jian got closer and closer to him, the senior, whose facial expressions were slightly restrained, covered his fist and coughed softly. Then, he walked toward Ye Jian.","His goal was clear. One look and one could tell who he was here for. Moreover, from the way he looked at Ye Jian, one could tell that it was different this time."]},{"number":4411,"title":"Chapter 4411: Confession","paragraphs":["The students in the class pursed their lips and smiled. They whispered, \"They’re looking for you to leave a message again. There are five people in total. After you sign, come to the laboratory directly. We’ll leave first.\"","\"Don’t. Wait for me.\" Ye Jian wasn’t willing to let the students leave first. It was awkward for her to talk to her seniors who she didn’t know!","Just like when she took the graduation books from the batch of seniors earlier, if it weren’t for the fact that her classmates were standing beside her and chatting with her seniors, she might have pretended not to see them and fled.","Now that she had met another group of seniors, in order to avoid awkwardness and discomfort, she was unwilling to let her classmates leave.","\"This is different. Please believe that our departure will be better for you.\"","A male student said seriously and looked meaningfully at the handsome senior who was walking closer. Tsk, tsk, tsk. This senior’s looks would definitely be on par with the most handsome boys in the National Science University. He was extremely handsome!","\"You guys...\"","Ye Jian tried her best to persuade them to stay, but she couldn’t stop the students from leaving anxiously. Ye Jian was left alone to face her senior... who was walking toward her.","This time, it was indeed different.","Ye Jian was going to be confessed to.","Confession...","During her three years at the National Science University, she had received love letters before. However, she hadn’t met anyone who wanted to confess to her. For a moment, Ye Jian was at a loss.","In just a few seconds, Ye Jian quickly stabilized herself. She smiled apologetically and said, \"I’m sorry, Senior. You’ve chosen the wrong person. I still have an experiment to do. I’m sorry.","\"I wish you a bright future.\"","After that, Ye Jian bowed slightly and left.","At the crossroads, a slender figure stood behind a tree. He narrowed his eyes as he watched the confession and swift rejection.","The senior, who was the most handsome guy in school, stood rooted to the ground with the love letter that was handed out but not received. He didn’t come back to his senses for a long time.","The other seniors took turns patting his shoulder silently and sighed. \"You guys aren’t meant to be, so just give up. You’ll only end up hurting yourself more otherwise.\"","\"That’s right, that’s right. Now that you’ve confessed, you don’t have any regrets, right? At least you’ve let Ye Jian know that you like her. It’s just that she doesn’t like you back.\"","\"Think about the other guys who have a crush on Junior Ye Jian. They don’t even have the chance to confess to her. You should be content.\"","The handsome senior was originally very sad, but he didn’t know whether to laugh or cry when he was ’snubbed’ by his buddies. \"Alright, alright. It seems I’m the lucky one, eh? You guys are so heartless.\"","You’re calling us heartless?! How’s that possible? Didn’t we encourage you last night and find an opportunity to confess to Junior Ye Jian? Otherwise, you’d be stuck having a crush on her.\"","\"Should I thank you, then?\"","\"Of course. I bet you’re the first to confess to her. Be content, buddy. She’ll definitely remember you!\"","\"Shoo, shoo, shoo. What’s the use of just remembering? She didn’t accept me! But Junior Ye Jian is quite funny. She said that I chose the wrong person... Don’t you think she’s cute?\"","\"F*ck, love is blind! But she is quite cute. I always thought that she would be very serious like an ice mountain, but I didn’t expect her to be quite cute. Oh my... Damn, why did you hit me?\"","The senior who had failed in his confession taught his buddy a lesson and warned him, \"I’m warning you not to have any evil thoughts.\"","\"Hahaha, are you going to make us laugh to death? You didn’t even get close to her and you’re still protecting her. Why are you jealous? Your confession failed. You’ve completed the last important thing before leaving school. You can graduate in peace now!\""]},{"number":4412,"title":"Chapter 4412: Sad, Caught","paragraphs":["The senior, who was rejected by Ye Jian, took a few steps and looked back. In the faint twilight, a slender and graceful figure flashed past at the end of the tree and disappeared without leaving any traces...","His buddies were wrong about one thing. Even if he was the first to stop her and confess to her, she would never remember him.","To her, he was just a stranger. He was just a leaf that accidentally blew past her. Even if it stained her clothes and she took a second look at it, that was all there was to it.","That year, she held a longsword in her hand, and her clothes fluttered in the wind. Sometimes, the sword moved like a dragon; sometimes, it was graceful; sometimes, it was fierce; and sometimes, it was sad... Just like that, the brightest light in his world was suddenly lit up by her. He fell in love with her at first sight without any warning.","He had graduated, and his crush ended just like that...","Although he didn’t succeed, at least he worked hard and didn’t leave with his greatest regret. Well, his buddies were right. He should be satisfied.","\"Don’t tell anyone what happened just now. If anyone dares to mention anything, they’ll be punished.\"","\"Oh my, oh my, oh my, do you find it embarrassing? It’s not impossible for us to keep our mouths shut. You just have to pay a price.\"","\"All my allowance has been extorted by you brats. Do you still want me to pay up?\"","\"Hahaha, you haven’t tried paying with your body. Do you want to try?\"","\"Damn it, you...\"","The young students, who were about to be conferred military ranks in the military unit and become real officers, were about to leave behind the familiar campus for the last time.","Here, they had their laughter, their bitterness, and their sorrow. Here, they found their direction through sweat and tears and trained themselves from a weak scholar to a qualified military school student. Here, they had no regrets in their youth.","The love letter, which contained five pages of confession paper, ended up in a trash can. If nothing went wrong, it would be cleaned up with the trash.","However, something unexpected happened.","The young students who were about to walk to every corner of the country left. A pair of leather shoes that were polished until the tips were reflective appeared beside the trash can...","The owner of the leather shoes had a pair of slender legs. They were straight and contained incredible strength. When he stood beside the trash can, the inconspicuous trash actually looked more like a cannon.","As for the love letter that had not been delivered, it had already been taken out of the trash can.","The envelope was very clean. It was spotless. However, the corner of the envelope was a little wrinkled. It was obvious how hard the person had gripped the love letter.","\"I met you once when you were in grade 12 and again when you were in year three.\"","The slightly thick pages were casually flipped through between the man’s slender fingers. He had a cold smile on his face as the evening wind blew gently.","Ye Jian, who walked into the laboratory, received a few winks from her classmates. In an instant, she knew that they must have realized that the situation was different, so they left first.","Ye Jian smiled and glared at them. Amidst the laughter, Ye Jian shook her head resignedly. She unlocked the door with her fingerprint and verified her pupils. Then, she walked into the laboratory that had a few layers of bulletproof glass.","If everything went well tonight, they would probably be able to complete the modeling assignment before midnight. If not, they would have to stay up late.","Ye Jian, who walked into the laboratory, had already forgotten about the admirer she met on the way. She was completely unaffected. With a serious expression, she focused on her studies."]},{"number":4413,"title":"Chapter 4413: Bad Intentions","paragraphs":["In the office building of the National Science University, the dean of the department widened his eyes and expressed his surprise at the fellow who knocked on the door. \"What brings you here? Are you back at your alma mater to give a speech to your graduating juniors?\"","If not, why did he run back to school?","Xia Jinyuan, who was familiar with the office, refilled the teacup that the director had finished drinking. The director, who was still in shock, said, \"Hot water, hot water. My stomach hasn’t been doing well recently. I can’t drink anything cold.\"","Xia Jinyuan replied, \"Okay.\" He picked up the hot kettle and pulled out the soft stopper. He refilled the empty teacup and placed it on the desk. He didn’t forget to show concern for the instructor who used to train him. Now, he was Ye Jian’s dean. \"You have to recuperate well. Don’t take it lightly.\"","\"Major Xia...?\" The director looked at Xia Jinyuan’s epaulet, and his surprise turned into shock. \"Lieutenant Colonel, you’ve actually been promoted to lieutenant colonel. It looks like the chief above you is kind.\"","At that time, Xia Jinyuan was still a student, and the dean was still an instructor. Xia Jinyuan was the student that gave the instructor the most headache... There was no other student like him. He challenged the instructor’s fragile nerves all the time. The instructor was afraid that one day, he would strangle Xia Jinyuan to death.","The director took a sip of the hot tea. He nodded secretly at his restraint back then. Fortunately, he controlled himself back then. If not, they would have lost another lieutenant colonel.","\"Drink slowly. Don’t scald yourself. There’s still hot water in the pot. If it’s not enough, I’ll go to the pantry and fill it up for you.\"","Xia Jinyuan sat down and reminded him. He looked like a merit student who was concerned about his teacher’s health.","It would have been better if he hadn’t said anything. Now that he did, the director scalded his mouth.","Putting the teacup on the desk, the director sized up the fellow who had been promoted a few times in the military and said vigilantly, \"You’re unaccountably solicitous. You must be up to no good. I won’t feel at ease drinking your tea.\"","Every time this happened, there sure was trouble!","The director adjusted his sitting position as if he was facing a great enemy. \"Tell me, what’s the matter?\"","\"You know me well. You know Ye Jian too. Can you give her to me for a month during the summer vacation this year?\"","As expected, nothing good would happen!","\"No, she’s having training outside the school this year. She doesn’t have time! What do you think you’re scheming? You want to whip her for a month during the 45-day holiday? What do you want to do?","\"Huh, that’s not right. Something’s wrong. Why do you always come back to look for Little Ye?\"","The dean seemed to have thought of a possibility. As he spoke, he slammed the table and shouted, \"Tell me honestly. Are you up to no good?\"","It was really possible!","This kid was good-looking from head to toe. He might have used a honey trap to lead the outstanding student, Ye Jian, astray!","\"Your stomach isn’t good. Don’t get so agitated!\"","\"Bullshit. My stomach is already affected! Tell me, what’s your real motive? Xia Jinyuan, if you don’t make things clear to me today, I’ll contact the commander-in-chief immediately!\"","He wasn’t bluffing. He was serious.","Xia Jinyuan was very relaxed. \"Don’t be angry. Do you think I’d kidnap a young lady? What kind of person do you think I am? Am I that bad?\"","Was there a need to kidnap her? He and the little fox were clearly in love with each other.","Receiving the director’s suspicious look, Lieutenant Colonel Xia heaved a long sigh. \"I’m just in charge of bringing her for training. If one month won’t do, then 20 days. I can’t go any lower.","\"It’s a thankless task to train students outside of school. If it can be avoided, it should be avoided. When it comes to training, isn’t it easier to train students in school?\""]},{"number":4414,"title":"Chapter 4414: Husband And Wife Return Home","paragraphs":["Training outside the school had always been a thankless task. There would always be a few troublemakers who would jump out and cause trouble. Based on his little fox’s personality, she would probably turn a blind eye to the trouble once or twice. But if it happened for the third time, she would teach them a lesson.","She had always been someone who was either casual or ruthless. There were many rules and restrictions outside the school. It was not easy to control the punishment.","It was much more convenient to train in school. What needed to be cleaned up had to be cleaned up. The purpose of the military training before enrollment was to temper one’s personality and remove one’s edges. One had to obey orders and strictly abide by discipline. One had to understand the biggest difference between oneself and ordinary university students.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t want Ye Jian to suffer outside.","When the students suffered grievances outside, sometimes, because of the military uniform on them, they couldn’t take revenge. They could only suppress their anger.","The dean of the department didn’t think too much about it. He thought that Xia Jinyuan had the idea of transferring the off-campus training to on-campus. When the time came, he would find a student to replace Ye Jian and free up Ye Jian’s vacation.","Hearing this, the dean sneered and said, \"The training outside the school lasts for 45 days. I won’t give you even a day.\"","He didn’t ask Xia Jinyuan where he would bring Ye Jian for training mainly because he trusted Xia Jinyuan.","He didn’t suspect that Xia Jinyuan had other motives. Although the fellow in front of her was a little shameless, he was reliable and wouldn’t talk nonsense.","When he said that he would bring Ye Jian out for training, he meant it.","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows and gave the same roguish smile that gave the dean the most headache in the past. \"Then we might as well skip the training. I’ll find someone else to take over. 45 days later, Ye Jian will report back to school on time.\"","The dean got angry again. He slammed the table and shouted, \"Bullshit. If you don’t want to train her, then don’t. Can you make a decision for her?\"","He could really make decisions for her. He also knew that based on his understanding of Ye Jian, she definitely didn’t want to be trained outside the school where there would be trouble. However, he couldn’t say this directly to the dean.","Before he could speak, the dean’s voice was cold. \"Xia Jinyuan, don’t ruin Ye Jian’s future. Outstanding students have training evaluations. Out-of-school training can show her ability. She must have experience outside of school.\"","Xia Jinyuan was stunned for a moment before asking, \"When did such a rule exist? This wasn’t around back in my time.\"","\"Just how many years older are you than Ye Jian? Let’s talk about you, then. Why didn’t you mention how you messed around in the past?\" The dean glared at him angrily. He picked up the teacup and took a few more sips of the gradually warming tea.","This kid had graduated for many years. Even if he was a lieutenant colonel, he could still anger him.","Xia Jinyuan knew that Ye Jian’s syllabus couldn’t be changed, so he could only accept it.","However, he still had to fight for time.","In the end, Ye Jian could train for two weeks. She also needed to go to the school one day in advance to understand the situation. Hence, she could take 15 days.","After deducting 15 days from the 45-day holiday, there was still one month. It was good enough!","Ye Jian, who was still in the laboratory, didn’t know that her 45 days of vacation had been divided up just like that. However, she had no objections to this.","Previously, she wanted to go to the Xueyu unit for training. Now that she could really go over, it was just what she wanted.","Just as Xia Jinyuan was waiting for Ye Jian to come out of the laboratory, a middle-aged man in a police uniform with a briefcase in his hand got out of a taxi and jogged to the sentry post outside the school to explain his purpose.","He came to the National Science University to look for Ye Jian and show the sentinel his valid identification document."]},{"number":4415,"title":"Chapter 4415: Sudden Rain","paragraphs":["The sentinel took his valid identification document. The director of Tongzhou City Police Station... He had some background.","The sentinel saluted and returned the valid document. He said, \"Please wait a moment.\"","This man had a powerful background, so the sentinel couldn’t let him in casually. He needed to confirm it.","\"Okay, okay. Please pass the message to Little Ye. You must say my name. Thank you.\" Commissioner Cai, who hurriedly took a plane to Xiang City, nodded to express his understanding.","The National Science University was a military school. It was fully militarized. How could people enter and leave so easily?","The sentinel contacted the duty room through the intercom. Commissioner Cai took out a handkerchief and wiped the sweat off his forehead and neck. After about five minutes, the sentinel replied.","\"She can’t come out for the time being? When will she come out? Does she know that I have something urgent to talk to her about?\"","He rushed to Xiang City in a hurry because he couldn’t contact Little Ye through the phone this morning. Even when he rushed to the National Science University, he still couldn’t see her. Commissioner Cai thought of what had happened in the past few days and couldn’t help but feel a little anxious.","The sentinel couldn’t answer Commissioner Cai’s question. Seeing that he was so anxious, the sentinel used the intercom to contact the duty room to see if he could look for the instructor.","If he could find the instructor, he could find Ye Jian. Commissioner Cai stopped sweating slightly.","About ten minutes later, an instructor with the military rank of a senior colonel walked out. This was the instructor who had been in charge of Ye Jian’s class since the start of the new year. He was equivalent to the head teacher.","After knowing that Commissioner Cai was Ye Jian’s mother’s comrade when she was alive, the instructor asked for his personal information. After registering, Commissioner Cai finally entered the National Science University at 10:00 pm. He also found out why Ye Jian couldn’t be contacted.","In the laboratory, Ye Jian and a few students had reached the last step. It was also the most crucial step. Everyone carefully completed the final bridge of the modeling assignment. If they failed, they would have to start from scratch.","The instructor brought Commissioner Cai to sit outside the laboratory building. They sat in a resting pavilion where the students usually relaxed or discussed. He smiled and explained, \"It’s the most critical moment. We have no choice but to wait for her to come out first. We can wait for Ye Jian to come out around midnight.\"","\"It’s good that I’ll be able to see her. One or two hours won’t make a difference.\" Commissioner Cai looked at the time. It was 10.15 pm. It wouldn’t be long before 12:00 am. He would wait. Then, he would ask Ye Jian how she was doing in school.","The instructor liked Ye Jian very much. Commissioner Cai’s eyes turned red when he heard Ye Jian’s praises.","This child had inherited Red Plum’s talent, but she was more outstanding than her!","\"Her mother was also quite outstanding. She was a famous sharpshooter in our military unit. She surpassed her teacher.\"","At the mention of Red Plum, a hint of gentleness lingered in Commissioner Cai’s lowered eyes. This gentleness had never faded because of the departure of an old friend. It had never disappeared even after more than 20 years.","The instructor didn’t know much about Ye Jian’s mother. He only knew that she was a soldier who was sacrificed for the country. When he suddenly knew that she was also a sharpshooter, he couldn’t help but sigh. \"She inherited her mother’s job. Her mother has a successor now.\"","The conversation revolved around Ye Jian. After nearly 20 minutes of chatting, the instructor’s vigilance towards Commissioner Cai decreased a little.","The trees around the pavilion were hidden, and there were more mosquitoes. Commissioner Cai slapped the mosquitoes that were sucking blood from his arm. Right on the heels of that, footsteps sounded from another direction.","Under the light of the street lamps, the instructor saw the dean of the department walking toward the resting pavilion with another person accompanying him.","The instructor stood up and walked over. He spoke to the director in a low voice. When Xia Jinyuan heard the words ’Commissioner Cai’, his gaze darkened."]},{"number":4416,"title":"Chapter 4416: Night Walk","paragraphs":["Commissioner Cai...","Xia Jinyuan knew Commissioner Cai, but Commissioner Cai didn’t.","Commissioner Cai actually came to look for... Ye Jian in the middle of the night? Did something happen? His gaze was a little serious.","Xia Jinyuan knew everything about Ye Jian. Hence, he instantly felt that things weren’t simple now that Commissioner Cai had appeared.","After a short introduction, Commissioner Cai found out that as it turned out, the young lieutenant colonel who came with the dean of the department was also here to look for Ye Jian. Xia Jinyuan took the initiative to reach out and reveal his personal information. \"Hello, Commissioner Cai. I’m Xia Jinyuan. I heard Ye Jian and Uncle Chen mention you before.\"","They didn’t just mention him once but several times.","He also knew that Commissioner Cai had never given up on finding the real reason why Martyr Sun Xueqing died. He had been looking for the reason all these years, but he hadn’t succeeded.","Xia Jinyuan’s words made Commissioner Cai’s eyes darken. Ye Jian and Uncle Chen had mentioned him in front of Lieutenant Colonel Xia...","In the blink of an eye, Commissioner Cai thought of something. He reached out his hand and held Xia Jinyuan’s. \"Hello, nice to meet you.\"","Commissioner Cai exerted a little strength and received Xia Jinyuan’s secret response. He smiled and retracted his hand.","The four of them chatted for about ten minutes before Xia Jinyuan said to the director, \"Go back and rest first. I’ll wait for her to come out. With the instructor and Commissioner Cai around, you can rest assured.\"","He wanted to talk to Commissioner Cai alone. He needed to ask the director to leave first.","Commissioner Cai understood and smiled at the instructor. \"Thank you for your hard work tonight. Since this lieutenant colonel is also looking for Little Ye, I’ll wait with him. You still have lessons tomorrow, so I won’t disturb you.\"","During the conversation, the director also understood some basic information about Commissioner Cai. He was Ye Jian’s mother’s comrade in the military unit before. He had been in contact with Ye Jian all these years. He happened to be in Xiang City on a business trip, so he came to visit Ye Jian.","Why did he come so late at night? The reason was simple. He only had time tonight.","One was the director of a police station and Ye Jian’s elder while the other was a lieutenant colonel sent by the military to talk to Ye Jian. In addition, Ye Jian would be able to come out in an hour or so. After persuading both sides, the instructor and the director left together.","As soon as the instructor and the dean left, the atmosphere in the resting pavilion suddenly became a little tense. Xia Jinyuan looked around and lowered his voice. He didn’t beat about the bush and asked the main point. \"Commissioner Cai, did anything happen outside for you to come over so late at night?\"","There was a deeper meaning behind his words. Xia Jinyuan brought up that he had heard about Commissioner Cai before and now asked if anything had happened outside. Commissioner Cai, who was calm, immediately understood that Lieutenant Colonel Xia knew a lot about Ye Jian.","No, he didn’t just know a lot of about Ye Jian. He knew everything there was about her.","Commissioner Cai’s expression changed slightly as he looked at Xia Jinyuan. He sized him up. If he really knew everything about Little Ye, who was he... to Little Ye?","The lights in the rest pavilion weren’t bright. They were all illuminated by the refraction of the street lamps outside. If they were sitting, one wouldn’t be able to see them clearly. If they were standing, just like now, their upper bodies would remain in the shadows. Their facial expressions were blurred. It was difficult to tell what they were thinking from their faces.","As a special forces soldier, Xia Jinyuan’s five senses were sharp. He noticed that Commissioner Cai was probing him. As Ye Jian’s boyfriend, he only wanted to know why Commissioner Cai was here. He said, \"Uncle Chen and Grandpa Gen personally entrusted Ye Jian to me. Since I know you, you can rest assured. Sorry to trouble you to personally come to the National Science University from Tongzhou. I think you must be here for something extraordinary.\""]},{"number":4417,"title":"Chapter 4417: Who Are You?","paragraphs":["The only contact between Commissioner Cai and Ye Jian was Martyr Sun Xueqing. Now that the real cause of Martyr Sun Xueqing’s death had been investigated, Commissioner Cai, who was her comrade, should know about it too. Since the matter had been resolved, why was he here?","From the moment he recognized Commissioner Cai, Xia Jinyuan had been guessing why Commissioner Cai was here.","It wasn’t that he didn’t think positively, but Commissioner Cai’s facial expression was anxious as he waited. He spoke a little quickly and would look at the laboratory from time to time. Xia Jinyuan understood that he was very anxious to find Ye Jian. He had something important to tell Ye Jian.","Now, he had revealed enough information. It was up to Commissioner Cai to believe him.","Commissioner Cai didn’t believe him.","He now knew that Lieutenant Colonel Xia had an extraordinary relationship with Ye Jian. He also knew that Ye Jian trusted him very much. However, what he wanted to tell Ye Jian was very important. Even if Old Chen personally entrusted Ye Jian to Xia Jinyuan, he wouldn’t trust him completely.","The human heart was the hardest to understand!","\"There’s no hurry. Little Ye should be out soon. Let’s wait for her to come out,\" Commissioner Cai replied with a smile. He invited Xia Jinyuan to sit down with him. \"Have a seat. Let’s have a chat when Little Ye comes out.\"","Hearing this, Xia Jinyuan took a deep breath and had no choice but to speak again. \"The reason why the military knows about the sacrifice of Martyr Sun Xueqing is because I reported it to the military. If you don’t trust me or have any doubts, you can ask me. I’ll definitely answer all your questions.","\"Ye Jian is the most important person in my life. I want to know everything about her. If she has any difficulties, I want to help her solve them. Commissioner Cai, please tell me why you’re here.\"","As expected of his mother-in-law’s comrade. Xia Jinyuan admired Commissioner Cai’s prudence as an old soldier.","Commissioner Cai’s expression changed. \"Who are you to Little Ye?\"","It was good that he was asking this.","Xia Jinyuan replied calmly, \"Someone she’ll spend the rest of her life with—lover, friend, comrade...\"","Lover, friend, comrade... That meant he was Little Ye’s boyfriend.","\"Your surname is Xia, but you’re a lieutenant colonel. And you can report matters directly to the military...\" Commissioner Cai sized up the young lieutenant colonel again. Xia... Xia... He investigated Red Plum’s sacrifice. Commander Xia, the highest-ranking general in the military, had personally met Commissioner Cai and contacted him many times on the phone. Both of them had the surname ’Xia’...","\"Xia Xinhui, Commander Xia, is my father.\"","Commissioner Cai’s body trembled. He relaxed instantly. \"A group of people came to find me and asked about Red Plum’s deeds when she was alive. We probed and found out that they were actually here for Ye Jian.\"","Without hiding anything, Commissioner Cai explained it to Xia Jinyuan.","\"Not only did they find me, but they also found a few of our old comrades. They were all asked if Red Plum had any descendants. Li Chuhai was executed, and Red Plum’s innocence was cleared. Why would anyone ask about Red Plum’s deeds back when she was alive? Why would they ask if Red Plum had any descendants?","\"Who are these people and why are they investigating? We have to understand these things.\"","The atmosphere in the pavilion became oppressive again. It was even more solemn.","The night wind in the middle of the night was a little cool. After the rain, the heat in Xiang City still hadn’t dissipated. Frogs could be heard all around. The summer night wasn’t quiet. Even the chirping of the insects seemed a little restless.","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan’s expression was murderous. His handsome and noble facial features were as cold as frost. Even his breathing was frosty.","After a moment of silence, he said, \"Someone knows why Li Chuhai was executed. They’re trying all means to find out who took Li Chuhai’s life."]},{"number":4418,"title":"Chapter 4418: Lawless","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan’s words shocked Commissioner Cai so much that he jumped up. His facial expressions changed drastically as he blurted out, \"Impossible!\"","Li Chuhai deserved it. There was actually someone who would avenge him?","Xia Jinyuan smiled coldly. There was an indescribable sarcasm in his voice. \"Why is it impossible? Li Chuhai deserved it, but some people don’t think so. Otherwise, why could Li Chuhai immediately fly to other countries and not return to his country for nearly 20 years?","\"Back then, someone didn’t want him to die. It’s the same now.\"","\"How did it become like this? He clearly deserved it, but there’s actually someone who wants to take revenge for him. No, it’s not revenge. Someone wants to commit a crime! Arrogant! Too arrogant!\"","Commissioner Cai, who was shocked, muttered in a low voice. The information Xia Jinyuan provided was too big. He couldn’t digest it and accept it for a while.","One had to know that Li Chuhai was executed by the military. If someone wanted to take revenge for Li Chuhai, wouldn’t they be... making an enemy of the entire military?","If this were a commoner who was ignorant of the law and swayed by ignorant thoughts of retaliation, he, as the director of the police station, would still be able to accept it.","After all, he had encountered similar cases before.","However, Li Chuhai wasn’t killed. The military was the one who executed him. Who was so bold as to seek revenge?","Also, who leaked the news?","Who wanted to take revenge for Li Chuhai?","Commissioner Cai held the stone platform in the pavilion with one hand and sat down again. His gaze was locked on the young lieutenant colonel who provided the information that shocked him. He enunciated every word and asked, \"Have you found out who it is? Has the military taken action? They’ve already found me. It’s only a matter of time before Little Ye gets exposed!","\"Back then, someone sold the information to Li Chuhai and lied to us that Little Ye drowned. As long as they find this person... Little Ye will be known!\"","His hand, which was placed on the stone platform, trembled slightly.","Red Plum had passed away. Back then, he didn’t protect her. Was he going to watch her daughter suffer the same fate?","No!!!","No!","Little Ye wasn’t alone like Red Plum in the past. Little Ye had the military behind her and a boyfriend with a powerful family background. She wasn’t fighting alone. She wouldn’t be like her mother in the past!","Commissioner Cai’s chaotic breathing gradually calmed down. He only stared at the young lieutenant colonel who provided the information. Next, he needed to talk to him.","Lightning flashed across the sky, indicating that heavy rain was coming. The wind started to get stronger, rustling the leaves. The entire city was about to be filled with wind and rain.","The wind was cool, but Commissioner Cai felt extremely agitated. Even the swaying trees had become monsters baring their fangs and brandishing their claws. They seemed to be approaching with invisible danger...","Xia Jinyuan, on the other hand, was much calmer. He wanted the Li family to take action.","Old Master Li abdicated ever since Li Chuhai left the country years ago. It had been more than 20 years since he retired. Even if they knew that he was the one who wanted to take revenge for Li Chuhai, as long as he didn’t do anything, there was no reason for them to touch an old man who had retired for more than 20 years.","If they really made a move, the public opinion would definitely lean toward the Li family.","Only by waiting for the Li family to take action and leave behind evidence of their crimes could the matter be completely resolved!","Now that Old Master Li’s people had found Commissioner Cai, Xia Jinyuan could reveal some things so that Commissioner Cai would have an idea.","The sound of leaves rustling in the wind kept entering their ears. It was so noisy that Commissioner Cai was even more frustrated. In such an environment that made people unable to calm down, Commissioner Cai could still hear every word the young lieutenant colonel said clearly."]},{"number":4419,"title":"Chapter 4419: Take Its Own Course","paragraphs":["This was a soldier whose emotions wouldn’t be easily controlled. He was as stable as a mountain and would eventually achieve great things.","Commissioner Cai commented in his heart.","Amidst the commotion, Xia Jinyuan remained calm and said slowly, \"Li Chuhai’s crimes back then were too clean. Instead, the people who wanted to avenge him couldn’t find any traces. From the moment he was executed until now, the other party hasn’t given up. He even found you. From the looks of it, they know of Ye Jian’s existence. However, they’re not too sure. They need to verify it.","\"Once they verify it...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, Commissioner Cai finished it for Xia Jinyuan. \"Once they verify it, they’ll definitely find Ye Jian and harm her!\"","\"That’s right!\" Xia Jinyuan nodded. \"They’re targeting Ye Jian. They just don’t know Ye Jian’s existence.\"","\"No, no. We can’t sit still and wait for death. We have to think of a way. Back then, Li Chuhai committed a heinous crime, but he was still able to escape overseas safely. This shows that someone was protecting him...\"","Before he could finish speaking, Commissioner Cai, who had been thinking non-stop, suddenly thought of something. His words were stuck for a few seconds. When he opened his mouth again, his voice sounded heavy. \"Li Chuhai’s... family background is extraordinary too, right?","\"That’s why his family easily protected him back then and sent him overseas. Now that Li Chuhai is dead, his family wants to take revenge for him?\"","\"That’s right.\"","An extremely crisp sound of someone hitting the table was heard. Although it was a stone platform, Commissioner Cai, who was burning with anger, still slapped it. It could be seen how much force he used.","\"No wonder he was so lawless!\"","As the director of the police station, Commissioner Cai was already used to some darkness. The unspoken rules weren’t something he could touch alone. He knew about the existence of certain darkness and how hateful and infuriating it was.","Now, he was furious again.","That slap was so heavy that even his palm hurt. Only pain could make him bear with his anger.","\"It’s time to clear things up. It’s really time to clear things up. Otherwise, where will the justice go?\" Commissioner Cai said in a low voice. All his emotions were contained in the slap. Now, there was only calmness left.","Xia Jinyuan smiled faintly. His slender fingers casually brushed past the edge of the stone platform. The edge of the marble platform was smooth. It looked perfect and stable, just like the Li family. It looked like this stone platform that could stand no matter the wind or rain.","However, when the storm turned into a tsunami, no matter how stable the stone platform was, it would collapse.","The Li family had made a move. In that case, they were not far from the tsunami.","A few minutes past midnight, the modeling assignment was finally completed. Ye Jian and the rest closed the heavy doors of the laboratory and walked out energetically. There was no tiredness on their faces.","\"I can finally hand in the research topic. At that time, I was really worried that once the research topic ended, I would be tortured badly.\"","\"You’re thinking too much. It was exactly because we wanted avoid that kind of torture that we had to hurry up and complete it. At least if we failed, we’d have a chance to start all over again.\"","\"That’s right. Now, everything is fine. I can hand in my papers tomorrow. I passed the exam and completed the most difficult experimental topic. I’ll sleep until tomorrow morning without any pressure!\"","\"If there’s no exercise tomorrow, I can sleep in.\"","Amidst the conversation, the group of people pushed open the laboratory door and walked out. A few boys suggested sending Ye Jian to the female dormitory first. Ye Jian smiled and rejected them. \"Everyone, rest early. The female dormitory isn’t far.\""]},{"number":4420,"title":"Chapter 4420: Excited","paragraphs":["The male students didn’t have to worry about Ye Jian’s safety on the campus of the National Science University even if it was 2:00 am or 3:00 am. However, they weren’t worried about Ye Jian’s safety. They were worried that they would be afraid if they walked alone at night.","Ye Jian wasn’t afraid of walking alone at night. A special forces soldier who could enter the primeval forest of Yunnan could walk alone at night.","The male students knew that Ye Jian had made up her mind, so they didn’t insist. In addition, there was a strong wind. The tips of the treetops were pressed down by the strong wind. A few male students smiled and said a few more words. Just as they were about to bid farewell to each other, they saw two figures approaching from the path on the left of the laboratory.","They didn’t pay much attention to them. They came to the laboratory building in the middle of the night as well. These figures must either be students who were staying up late to do experiments or roaming patrols.","\"Little Ye...\"","A gentle voice was heard. Ye Jian, who had her back facing the man, immediately turned around and raised her voice hesitantly. \"Uncle Cai?\"","\"Sigh, why did your class only end now?\" Commissioner Cai replied. He strode over with Xia Jinyuan.","However, Ye Jian obviously didn’t notice her boyfriend. Perhaps Commissioner Cai’s appearance surprised her, so she didn’t pay much attention to him.","She turned her head and said to the male students, \"My uncle is here to look for me. Go back to the dormitory quickly.\"","Since he was Ye Jian’s uncle, it was inconvenient for them to stay.","He even waited in the middle of the night. It had to be something urgent.","After bidding farewell, the male students left together. Xia Jinyuan was a little emotional.","His girlfriend didn’t notice him?","His girlfriend didn’t recognize him?","His girlfriend recognized Commissioner Cai’s voice but didn’t recognize her boyfriend walking over?","His girlfriend...","Xia Jinyuan felt that he needed to have a good chat with his girlfriend.","However, in the next second, Lieutenant Colonel Xia was elated because his girlfriend recognized him.","\"Captain Xia?\"","Compared to Commissioner Cai’s hesitation, Ye Jian was pleasantly surprised to see her boyfriend. Her eyes were instantly as bright as stars. \"Why are you here? Why are you with Uncle Cai?\"","\"I came to see you. I didn’t expect to meet Uncle Cai. He came to look for you because of an urgent matter.\" His small emotions disappeared instantly with Ye Jian’s unconcealed surprise. Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but smile. \"We didn’t think you’d be experimenting.\"","Commissioner Cai, who was walking closer, sighed and said, \"Little Ye, time is important, but you have to strike a balance between work and rest. You can’t tire yourself out. Let’s go. It’s been a tiring day. Let’s go back to my room and talk.\"","Although Commissioner Cai hadn’t met Ye Jian many times, it didn’t affect his concern for her. They were friends. If Ye Jian were an ordinary senior high student, Commissioner Cai would definitely bring her to Tongzhou and take care of her.","Xia Jinyuan made a hand gesture to invite Commissioner Cai to walk in front. He and Ye Jian politely followed half a step behind. Together, they headed to the guest house specially hosted by the National Science University.","Every time Xia Jinyuan came over, he would stay in the guest house. Commissioner Cai was staying there tonight too.","On the way, Xia Jinyuan was quite well-behaved. Besides occasionally making eye contact with Ye Jian during their conversation, he didn’t do anything else. Elegant, upright, calm, and composed were Commissioner Cai’s evaluations when he first met Xia Jinyuan.","The room wasn’t big and was simple. Ye Jian sat on the wooden couch and listened to Commissioner Cai quietly.","They actually came to Commissioner Cai to ask about her mother’s past deeds. They even asked if her mother had children. It seemed like the Li family had received some news."]},{"number":4421,"title":"Chapter 4421: Deep Love","paragraphs":["\"The only fortunate thing now is that the other party doesn’t know your mother’s real name. They only know her codename, Red Plum. If they knew your mother’s real name, they would know of your existence.","Commissioner Cai finished speaking in one breath. His tense voice was cold. \"Once they know of your existence, they’ll definitely harm you. Little Ye, you have to be mentally prepared. However, you don’t have to be afraid. No matter how powerful the Li family is, they won’t be able to do anything!\"","After Commissioner Cai finished speaking, Xia Jinyuan looked at Ye Jian, who was sitting beside him. There was even a faint smile in his eyes. He was relaxed, which was a stark contrast to Commissioner Cai, who was worried.","Although Commissioner Cai was very concerned about the little fox, he still lacked understanding of her.","His little fox had gone through all kinds of hardships. She relied on herself to carve out a broad path. She had been injured, tired, and cried... Yet, she had never been afraid, worried, or given up. How could the little fox be afraid?","With a smile in his eyes, Xia Jinyuan adjusted his sitting position slightly and started leaning lazily against the back of the couch. He waited calmly for Ye Jian’s reply.","Xia Jinyuan understood Ye Jian. She wouldn’t give up even if the Li family pestered her.","After her rebirth, she had always known that her surroundings were not peaceful. Now, she heard that once the Li family knew of her existence, they would harm her. At this moment, Ye Jian was quite calm.","She was already used to being schemed against. She just needed to face it. Why should she be afraid?","Hearing this, Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Uncle Cai, don’t worry. I’m not a little girl who will be manipulated by others. No matter how powerful they are, they can’t blatantly harm me.","\"Even if they want to harm me, they have to have a chance. I won’t give them a chance to harm me.\"","There was still a year before graduation. If the Li family dared to reach into the National Science University, the military would definitely take action immediately. They would see how many tricks Old Master Li had up his sleeve after retiring for so many years!","Commissioner Cai didn’t expect Ye Jian to not take his concern for her seriously. She didn’t even have any reaction. Just like Lieutenant Colonel Xia, she was quite calm.","Instantly, Commissioner Cai didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. \"Your relationship, I... Alas, I really believe that it’s a boyfriend-girlfriend relationship. I’m the only one who’s worried while the two of you don’t think much of it.\"","Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but laugh. The two of them, who were sitting on the three-person wooden couch, looked at each other telepathically. Their eyes were filled with affection that made Commissioner Cai’s face turn red.","Amazing, amazing. These young people... were really amazing.","\"Okay, okay. Young man, I’m still here. Be careful, be careful.\"","Commissioner Cai couldn’t help but laugh. He looked at the couple sitting together and felt gratified. Then, he thought of the deceased martyr, Sun Xueqing. Unknowingly, Commissioner Cai’s eyes became a little moist.","It was good, it was good. It was good to be young.","’Red Plum, you can rest assured in the netherworld... You can rest assured. Ye Jian has grown up to be slender and elegant. She’s a dragon among men. Her abilities are valued by the military. Compared to you in the past, your daughter is much better than you.","’It’s good to be very strong. It’s precisely because she’s strong that she has her achievements today. If she were weak, she would’ve been eaten by those jackals until not even her bones were left.","’The boyfriend she found is also very good. He’s a good-looking person who knows when to advance and when to retreat. Most importantly, he can support Ye Jian and shelter her from the wind and rain. He can also give Ye Jian a stable family.’"]},{"number":4422,"title":"Chapter 4422: Electrified","paragraphs":["’The two of them are very compatible. There are no other pair of lovers as compatible as them.","’Don’t worry, don’t worry...’","The corners of Commissioner Cai’s eyes were wet. He took a deep breath and suppressed the urge to cry.","\"Since the two of you know what to do, I’m relieved. Little Ye, it’s getting late. Let Lieutenant Colonel Xia send you back to the dormitory.","\"Although it’s safe in school, it’s better to have someone accompany you.\"","This was to let the couple, who had been apart for a while, be alone.","Xia Jinyuan agreed readily and said to Ye Jian, \"I have something to tell you. Let’s go. We’ll talk as we walk.\"","Then, he said politely to Commissioner Cai, \"Rest early. Good night.\"","\"Good night, Commissioner Cai. I’ll come and see you tomorrow.\" Ye Jian stood up. She planned to come over early tomorrow to accompany this uncle whom she had only met a few times but cared about her because of her mother.","The Li family’s people found him in the morning, and he rushed to the National Science University at night. It could be seen how anxious he was at that time.","As she left, Ye Jian said, \"Don’t worry. The Li family can’t do anything to me.\"","She had already shown her face in front of Old Master Li and was even remembered by him. Did the Li family want to harm her? Bring it on, then! They would see who would win!","The current Ye Jian was very confident and could resist any snowstorm more than before. As long as she didn’t fall, no demons could defeat her.","Commissioner Cai smiled and nodded. He personally sent the two of them to the door. \"You guys are very competent. I’m very at ease. Go back and rest. See you tomorrow.\"","Commissioner Cai smiled as he watched the couple walk through the corridor before returning to his room.","The moment the door closed, Commissioner Cai raised his hand to wipe the corners of his eyes. After a long time, a long sigh filled with nostalgia came from the room. There was even a soft murmur that disappeared before one could hear it clearly.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had always been well-behaved, reached out his hand before he walked out of the guest house. He held Ye Jian’s hand naturally and sighed with satisfaction. \"We’re finally holding hands. Just now, I had to pinch my palm to barely control myself. I endured for nearly an hour. I’m more tolerant than ever.\"","He held her tightly, afraid that Ye Jian would break free. After saying a string of words, he said to Ye Jian, \"Don’t break free.\"","Ye Jian smiled until her eyes curved into crescents. \"I never thought of breaking free. You’re thinking too much. It’s been hard on you. You endured it for an hour.\"","After she finished speaking, she suddenly tiptoed and kissed his chin.","Comrade Xia Jinyuan was even more satisfied.","In the end, he felt sad for how easily satisfied he was. \"How pitiful. A kiss can make me happy. There’s no boyfriend more pitiful than me.\"","They had already walked out of the guest house and turned into the path that was shaded by trees. Amidst the rustling leaves, Ye Jian, who was smiling, suddenly said, \"Captain Xia, lower your head...\"","Captain Xia, who was used to agreeing to her requests, lowered his head.","\"One isn’t enough, so how about two?\"","She hooked one hand around the back of his neck and kissed him softly. She exhaled and said, \"If two is not enough, how about a deep kiss?\"","Her voice was so soft that it was seductive. It struck Xia Jinyuan’s heart like an electric current. Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was not prepared for his girlfriend to seduce him, shuddered.","Being electrocuted by the person he loved... As it turned out, it wasn’t a figment of his imagination. It really existed!"]},{"number":4423,"title":"Chapter 4423: Born Wild","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan, who had always been calm, felt dizzy for the first time. She even took the initiative to kiss him deeply. \"Open your mouth, my Captain Xia...\"","She captured Xia Jinyuan’s heart so easily and turned him into a marionette. He would do whatever she asked him to do.","The darkness in the early morning probably gave Ye Jian a lot of courage. This was the first time she was so proactive in seducing the young lieutenant colonel.","She liked him...","The tip of her tongue slid in deftly, inviting the man she liked to dance with her. Her hand, which he was holding, wrapped around the back of his neck. He lowered his head, and she hugged the back of his neck and tried her best to tiptoe, kissing him until the end.","Although Ye Jian was extremely bold now, in fact... her calves, which were wrapped in her straight military pants, were trembling. It was exciting and shocking.","She was actually so bold in school... She took the initiative to kiss Captain Xia.","She even deliberately seduced Captain Xia again and again. What surprised her even more was that the wise and mighty Captain Xia, who was known for his calmness, was easily bewitched by her.","Deep down, Ye Jian was very proud.","Her man was so powerful that he could deal with any danger calmly. He always controlled everything in his hands and devised strategies. When he smiled, he revealed his ferocity and instantly crushed his enemies.","This kind of man was in a daze because of her. Besides feeling proud, Ye Jian also felt a sense of accomplishment and conquest.","Men liked to conquer women. Similarly, women liked to conquer men too. They were born wild, and this wild streak never disappeared from ancient times.","Ye Jian liked the refreshing aura on Xia Jinyuan’s body. Every time he approached, she would be mesmerized. She liked to bury her head in his broad chest and rub her head against it. She always felt safe and protected.","She was in love with him. Even her kiss was sincere.","Xia Jinyuan, who had been dizzy for at least two minutes, finally came back to his senses.","The man, who had come back to his senses, narrowed his black eyes slightly. Danger gradually filled the depths of his unfathomable pupils. Not bad. His woman was already so affectionate that she knew how to take the initiative.","Very good, he liked it very much!","Since she had sovereignty for so long, it was time for him to take the lead.","As he sobered up, the scale of sovereignty was completely controlled by Xia Jinyuan. He ended the deep kiss that Ye Jian had sovereignty over. As he smiled, his sexy voice came slowly. It was like the wind blowing past the lake in her heart. Ye Jian’s heart was already rippling.","\"Do you like kissing me? I like it too...\"","He wasn’t an expert at flirting. He wasn’t even good at saying sweet nothings. However, when he was facing Ye Jian, he would say sweet nothings. Every sentence made Ye Jian blush.","If she didn’t know that he had never been in a relationship before he met her, with his flirting methods, he would really look like a prodigal who had been with hundreds of women.","\"It looks like you haven’t had his fill. Then... shall we continue?\"","She even raised her eyebrows provocatively. Then... Xia Jinyuan’s lower abdomen tightened. It was killing him!","Ye Jian tiptoed and raised her head. Her gaze was slightly drunk as if she had drunk strong wine. She looked at him without blinking. He was already ruthless enough, but she still dared to provoke him!","He had to accept the challenge!","Even if it meant taking his life, he would do it without any hesitation.","His long arms instantly wrapped around Ye Jian’s slender waist. \"You dare to challenge me? You didn’t gain weight, but you’ve gained courage. Since I accepted your challenge, baby, you have to accompany me to fight... until the end.\""]},{"number":4424,"title":"Chapter 4424: So Good","paragraphs":["The battle... ended with them separating on purpose. The redness of Ye Jian’s ears spread to her neck at a speed visible to the naked eye.","Without giving her much time to think, Xia Jinyuan kissed her lips accurately with a predatory aura. His back, which was like a pine tree, bent slightly because of her so that their deep kiss could be more comfortable.","Their lips touched, and they danced and sang together. Even the strong wind became their accompaniment.","\"Hmm? Do you dare to fight with me until the end? Do you want to be bolder? Do you want to fulfill my wish as soon as possible?\" he asked in a low voice. His hoarse voice made Ye Jian’s ears go numb. \"Let’s go back to my room. The first floor is very close by. We can reach in 50 steps.\"","As they spoke, the kiss landed on Ye Jian’s lips. The temperature of their lips was a little high. It was hot and scorching. There was an inexplicable ambiguity in it. There was also... the urge of a young man and woman.","Ye Jian’s legs were a little weak. She leaned against him. Her body was as soft as noodles... She was still breathing heavily.","The kiss was too deep. She was out of oxygen.","Ye Jian, who was lacking oxygen, was lost in Xia Jinyuan’s sexy voice. She seemed to have heard what he said, but she didn’t seem to have heard it clearly either. She placed her hands on his neck and nodded as she panted. Her red lips were slightly open. From the shape of her mouth, she was obviously saying ’Okay’.","A few strong lights suddenly flashed past. The orderly footsteps got closer. Xia Jinyuan was the first to see the strong lights. A few words floated past his ears.","This was bad...","A second ago, Ye Jian was gritting her teeth as he thought about what would happen next. A second later, Ye Jian’s hands left his neck. Oxygen filled her brain. She finally became the calm and reserved Ye Jian again.","Ten minutes ago, Ye Jian, who dared to stare at her boyfriend and seduce him, hid again. Only her watery eyes could be seen.","\"Who is it?\"","The strong light shone straight over. The sentinel patrolling asked sternly.","\"Command Class 987, Ye Jian.\"","She turned around swiftly and straightened her back as she walked toward the sentinel. After the sentinel finished saluting, Ye Jian had already picked out her identification document and handed it to the sentinel for inspection. \"I was ordered to come to the guest house to entertain Lieutenant Colonel Xia from the military. I have something to settle and can’t go to bed for the time being.\"","Ye Jian had already adjusted her expression. As a man, Lieutenant Colonel Xia could adjust his expression immediately. However, it was difficult to adjust his physiological changes for a while. He tilted his body slightly and took deep breaths to calm his physiological changes while the sentinel was checking Ye Jian’s student ID.","The sentinel took Ye Jian’s identification document and checked it carefully. After handing it back to Ye Jian, he walked in front of Xia Jinyuan and saluted. He said calmly, \"Hello, Chief. Please show your identification document!\"","Although Xia Jinyuan was a lieutenant colonel, his military rank was higher than the sentinel. Also, Ye Jian told the sentinel that he was from the military just now, so the sentinel naturally called Xia Jinyuan ’Chief’.","He handed over his military ID and cooperated with the sentinel. After the sentinel left, the passion between the two of them had already disappeared.","After keeping his identification document, Xia Jinyuan hugged Ye Jian’s waist from behind and placed his chin on her shoulder. He said pitifully, \"It’s uncomfortable. I really want to bring you out to sleep in a hotel.\"","\"Be good. Let’s talk about serious matters.\"","Ye Jian smiled and rubbed Xia Jinyuan’s head. \"Commissioner Cai came to look for me because the Li family found him. What about you? Why did you look for me? You came to look for me before the summer vacation... Are you here to bring me to the team for training?\""]},{"number":4425,"title":"Chapter 4425: The Jealous Lieutenant Colonel","paragraphs":["The storm came after the strong wind. The rain fell quickly and fiercely. Before Xia Jinyuan could answer Ye Jian, the rain had already hit his face. He immediately held Ye Jian’s hand and ran back to the guest house.","It took less than a minute to run 50 steps. Even so, their shoulders were already wet.","Wiping the rainwater off his face, Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows slightly and smiled. \"Even the heavens are on my side. How are you going to return to the dormitory when the storm comes?\"","The main reason was that they were still a distance away from the dormitory. The rain was too heavy. Even with an umbrella, it couldn’t block the heavy rain.","Ye Jian smiled too. She was a beauty under the light. Her eyebrows were elegant. She smiled slightly, and it was like blooming flowers. \"No matter how heavy the rain is, I have to go back to the dormitory. Captain Xia, let’s talk about normal things.\"","The kiss just now was a little intense. Her lips were red like cherry blossoms waiting to be plucked. When the rainwater stained her lips, they became more and more seductive. The eyes of the man standing opposite her gradually darkened again.","He looked at her lips that were red from his kiss. His eyes were filled with possessiveness as if he was staring at his prey. His slender fingers curled up lightly in the dark. He couldn’t suppress the restlessness in the depths of his heart.","Instead, the more he pressed down, the greater the rebound. The urges spread to his limbs and rushed to his brain.","This was really dangerous!","Xia Jinyuan exhaled heavily. At this moment, even the turbid air he exhaled was hot. \"During the summer vacation, you’ll follow us to the border for live ammunition training. You’ll be in the same team as the male soldiers who haven’t carried out any missions in the past two years. The veterans will be in a team. The two opposing parties will complete live ammunition training together.\"","As expected!","\"That’s great! I was wondering if I could train with my comrades in the team again. I was afraid that I wouldn’t be able to participate because of the training outside the school.\" Ye Jian’s eyes lit up. Under the light, Xia Jinyuan’s figure could be seen clearly in her bright eyes.","\"Then I don’t have to go out of school to train. That’ll solve my biggest headache now.\"","She was so happy that she forgot to ask how long it would take to complete the training together.","\"Originally, I wanted you to return to the unit for the entire 45 days of your summer vacation. The dean rejected me...\"","The moment he opened his mouth, the brightness in Ye Jian’s eyes immediately faded. Even the smile on the corner of her lips became less cheerful. Xia Jinyuan couldn’t bear to ruin her mood, but he still said, \"The director rejected, so you still have to complete the out-of-school training. Hence, your time is split into two. You’ll return to the unit for training for 30 days and go for out-of-school for training for 15 days.\"","\"Alas, I knew that I couldn’t skip the out-of-school training. I was still naive enough to think that I could dodge it.\" Ye Jian smiled helplessly. \"I have no choice but to accept it.","\"But I’m still very happy. I can train with you guys for at least 30 days. I haven’t trained with my comrades for a long time. I’m worried that if I don’t catch up, I won’t be able to catch up with my comrades’ footsteps.\"","Even though she completed her training in school every day, she was still worried that she would be left behind by her comrades. After all, the training of a military school student was too different from the training of a special forces soldier.","\"It’s normal for there to be a gap. Practice well and catch up. I believe you can do it.\"","Xia Jinyuan was helpless too. Why did he feel that his charm was not as good as training?","The rain was so fierce that it even fell on the corridor of the company. The ground was instantly wet. Helpless, Lieutenant Colonel Xia pulled her a few steps inside. In the end, he couldn’t help but raise his hand and flick Ye Jian’s forehead. He laughed and said, \"When you mention training, the light in your eyes is brighter than when you see me. I’m about to get jealous.\""]},{"number":4426,"title":"Chapter 4426: Escape Or Pander","paragraphs":["Ye Jian found Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s grievances funny. Sometimes, he was... really narrow-minded, but he was sincere.","Ye Jian pretended to think for a moment. After a few seconds, she said deliberately, \"That seems to be the case. Compared to meeting Captain Xia, I prefer training.\"","’Because that way, I’ll get closer and closer to you.’","As she smiled and spoke, her gaze suddenly slid to his epaulet. Her eyes lit up again. \"You’ve risen. There’s an extra star.\"","The rank of lieutenant colonel was actually the rank of senior colonel externally. It was because he wanted to wait for her to fight side by side.","\"I’ve been promoted. If I didn’t get promoted, I’d feel even more wronged. If both my girlfriend and the military don’t want me, how sad would that be?\" Xia Jinyuan let out a long sigh. He looked like an abandoned husband.","\"I miss you! I miss you so much! I want to go to the unit for training because I want to see you every day.\"","Comrade Xia was still pretending to be aggrieved when Comrade Ye suddenly confessed to him affectionately. Xia Jinyuan, who was pretending to be aggrieved, was stunned.","A few seconds later, he coughed lightly. A smile appeared on his handsome face. \"I miss you too. I want to see you every day too.\"","These words of love... made Commissioner Cai, who was only three steps away, stop in his tracks. If he hadn’t heard it with his own ears, he wouldn’t have believed that such mushy words of love would come from a man with a cold aura.","Now, he couldn’t advance or retreat.","In the end, Commissioner Cai turned around silently and went up the stairs again.","He shouldn’t go out and interrupt the relationship between lovers. They could talk tomorrow.","Fortunately, Commissioner Cai didn’t come out. Otherwise, Ye Jian would have rushed into the heavy rain and escaped.","The two of them, who were not worried about being hit by the rain, stood in the corridor where the raindrops swept over. They looked at each other. The storm could not destroy the love between them.","Ye Jian’s gaze was gentle and affectionate. Xia Jinyuan’s gaze was scorching and intense, with an indescribable urge.","His gaze made Ye Jian’s breathing quicken and her heart beat like a drum. Because of his gaze, even the air became especially hot. She wanted to escape but also wanted to cater to him.","Ye Jian bit her lower lip lightly as her long eyelashes fluttered.","Should she go back to the dormitory tonight?","Was she really going to stay and accompany him?","What if they were discovered?","After all, this was a school. It was not appropriate for her to stay.","However, if she returned to the dormitory just like that, she would feel a little reluctant...","Ye Jian, who was in a dilemma, didn’t know how beautiful she was now. Her eyes were filled with love. She was biting her lower lip slightly. She inadvertently had a charm that made men enchanted. Coupled with her shyness, Xia Jinyuan felt the temperature in his blood soar.","If this continued, she wouldn’t be able to leave.","His sexy Adam’s apple moved slightly. Xia Jinyuan interrupted their gaze.","He took a deep breath and breathed in the damp and rainy air. He said gently to the woman who still dared to look at him like that. \"I’ll go get the umbrella. Wait for me.\"","...","After a while, Ye Jian finally reacted. Right on the heels of that, she gave a monotonous hum. Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows and smiled.","His faint smile made Ye Jian’s face burn even more furiously.","What was with the disappointment in her voice?!","It was as if she was disappointed that he didn’t take the initiative to ask her to stay...","Ye Jian’s face was red. She immediately lowered her head and looked at Xia Jinyuan shyly."]},{"number":4427,"title":"Chapter 4427: Forever","paragraphs":["If they were outside, Xia Jinyuan would definitely tease her and say, ’I think I made a mistake. Actually, I want you to stay and accompany me.’ However, he immediately swallowed his words.","They couldn’t continue like this. If they continued like this, both of them would be playing with fire.","Now... the fire in her heart had been ignited. It was just a little bit away from a huge fire.","He stopped laughing and said softly, \"Silly girl.\" Then, he strode into the room to get an umbrella.","He had to stop. He had to stop. He had to be careful in school. If there were any rumors, he would be fine. But she would be the one at a disadvantage.","Xia Jinyuan turned around and pressed his fist against his chest. He gritted his teeth and closed his eyes for a few seconds. He was very disappointed. He was disappointed and frustrated.","Ye Jian only saw his back view and didn’t see his expression. She heaved a sigh of relief and patted her chest lightly with a frightened expression.","Just now... she almost said that she would stay and accompany him. Fortunately, he stepped on the brakes in time...","She patted her chest and then her burning face. It was really hot. It was as hot as a high fever.","She moved two steps and gathered rainwater in her hands. When the cold rainwater hit her face, there was finally a hint of coldness on her hot cheeks. When the coldness touched her skin, her dazed mind became clearer.","Before Xia Jinyuan could get the umbrella, Ye Jian was already awake.","Right on the heels of that, she narrowed her eyes slightly and thought of a problem.","She didn’t have a holiday until the middle of July. Why was Captain Xia looking for her now? Was he going to stay until she finished her exams before bringing her to the bordering town?","Or was there something else?","She would ask him later. As long as it had nothing to do with a mission, he would tell her.","The rain hit the green military umbrella that was opened. The rainwater gathered into lines and rushed down continuously. The two of them walked into the heavy rain for only a few minutes before their pants were wet.","Ye Jian asked the question she thought of just now. She thought that Xia Jinyuan would answer her quickly and easily.","After she finished asking, the aura of the man beside her turned dark and cold. The coldness spread to Ye Jian and made her heart sink.","\"The day after tomorrow, I’ll go to J5’s hometown to visit the two elders before returning to the capital city to pay my respects to my good buddy...\"","In the heavy rain, his voice was very deep, cold, and firm. It was as dark as rust.","Ye Jian’s heart ached. She pursed her lips.","J5!","Her comrade would always be sleeping in the cold and dark underground. She would never see his smile or hear his voice again...","\"I haven’t talked to him in a long time. I have to go over and chat with him for a while and have a drink with him. He likes to drink home-brewed rice wine. I’ll go to his house to get it first before visiting him.\"","Even though J5 had been sacrificed for almost two years, Xia Jinyuan’s throat was still filled with blood whenever he recalled J5. He would often dream of the times when the two of them fought side by side.","In the blink of an eye, two years had passed. His good buddy and comrade had left them for almost two years.","This time, he had letters that the comrades had written for J5. When he went over, he wanted to burn it for J5. He needed to let J5 know that after he left, his comrades continued to think of him. They would even habitually call him during training.","His bed was also reserved. Every day, they would clean, make the bed, and save his portion of water and food. Only then would they feel that their good buddy had never left and was still in the team.","\"I want to write a letter to J5. When the time comes, help me burn it for him. Also, help me pass a message...\" Ye Jian’s heart was heavy. Even her voice was choked up as she spoke slowly. Every word was extremely difficult.","Xia Jinyuan’s throat moved. \"Okay...\" It was a very soft reply. There was sorrow in it."]},{"number":4428,"title":"Chapter 4428: Letter","paragraphs":["Thinking of J5, the two of them felt gloomy. Xia Jinyuan, who was holding an umbrella, held Ye Jian’s hand at some point in time. The two of them held hands tightly. Even the tips of their fingers were transmitting the same sorrow.","The entire journey was silent. They could only hold hands.","The rain was washing away everything. The entire world turned into a transparent curtain of rain. Ye Jian stepped on the fallen leaves and returned to the dormitory.","\"See you tomorrow, Captain Xia.\" Ye Jian stepped into the corridor on the first floor and waved at the man who was holding an umbrella in the rain. \"Rest early.\"","\"Yes, rest early too. See you tomorrow.\" Xia Jinyuan smiled and waved his hand. \"Hurry up and go back to the dormitory. Sweet dreams.\"","\"Sweet dreams.\"","The raindrops hit the umbrella with loud patters. Under the umbrella, the man’s pants were all wet. Even one side of his shoulders was wet. He didn’t seem to notice it. The umbrella in front of him was raised slightly so that he could see her more clearly.","The fabric of the soldiers’ short-sleeved summer uniform was thinner. It was drenched by the rain and stuck to his skin, outlining the strong muscles of his shoulders and arms. He stood there until Ye Jian walked toward the stairs.","The night was very dark, and the rain was heavy. In the wind and rain, the man holding the umbrella stood tall and straight like an unsheathed sword. After a long time, the young lieutenant colonel walked away.","Ye Jian climbed to the fourth floor and looked down. She only saw a figure walking further and further away in the rain.","J5’s sacrifice was the most painful. As the captain, Captain Xia had once told her that since the captain brought his comrades out, he had the responsibility to bring them back alive.","J5, who went out to fight together, was sacrificed...","Even though two years had passed, J5 was still a scar in Captain Xia’s heart that had never healed. When he mentioned it slightly, the unhealed scar immediately tore apart and became a mess of flesh and blood.","\"Captain Xia...\"","The wind and rain swept Ye Jian away. Her heart was very heavy. Even if she took countless deep breaths, she couldn’t relax. In the end, Ye Jian simply placed her hands on the railing of the corridor and stood alone for at least ten minutes before returning to the dormitory.","When Xia Jinyuan returned to the guest house, his clothes were all wet. Five minutes later, with his short hair still dripping with water, he walked out of the bathroom in a short-sleeved shirt.","Holding a dark green military towel in his hand, he wiped his hair casually and sat by the single bed. After that, he seemed to want to get up and do something, but he felt that he didn’t need to do anything. Holding the damp towel in his hand, he sat like a statue for a long time.","He didn’t even shift his gaze. He kept staring at a certain spot on the ground.","He sat there quietly for a long time before getting up to dry the towel in his hand. When he came back, he didn’t sleep immediately. He sat in front of the desk and opened the drawer. He took out countless letters.","The senders were different, but the recipient was the same person.","\"My brother, J5...\"","They were all written for J5.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t look at the contents of the envelope. He just counted them one by one. After counting, he took out his letter and opened the envelope that wasn’t sealed. He took out the squarish letter and unfolded it.","[Brother, it’s been a year and eight months since you left. I’ve carried out many missions with our comrades. They’re all fine. Besides the occasional old injuries that haven’t healed and new injuries, they didn’t die. They all came back alive.","[You said that we would all live, but in the end, you’re the only one missing. J5, every time we think of you sleeping alone, we, men who wouldn’t even cry after getting shot by bullets, would scream.]"]},{"number":4429,"title":"Chapter 4429: Jealousy","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan’s letter to J5 wasn’t very emotional. He talked about trivial matters in the team. Just like every time he or J5 came back from a mission, the people in the team would talk about the trivial matters in the team.","It could be considered a casual conversation.","[Two days ago, I said that I had to go to Xiang City to bring Azure Bird to the team for training. Then, I’ll go to your house to visit Uncle and Aunt. I’ll also bring wine for you and ask them if they have anything to say to you. In the end, the brothers treated me as a postman. The next day, after the training ended, they lined up to send me letters. I almost thought that all of them had girlfriends they wanted to write to.","[After you receive the letter, you should at least appear in our dreams. Tell them that you’ve received their letters.]","...","There were three pages of the letter in his hand. The words were all handwritten. Xia Jinyuan’s handwriting was beautiful. Every stroke was smooth and elegant. The three pages were filled with words written with a fountain pen. Every word revealed his brotherhood with J5.","[Nothing new has happened in the past two years. Besides G3 getting married and becoming a father, T6 found a girlfriend. The bachelors are still bachelors. They’re still taking care of themselves.","[It wasn’t easy for us to arrange a blind date for the entire team, but in the end, these cowards didn’t dare to talk to the ladies. The political director later asked the boss if the soldiers arranged this time had mouth diseases. He even complained that the boss was too bad at arranging things and wasted a lot of resources.","[That’s why on the first day I came back from my mission, I chased this group of cowards out of their beds and made them run ten kilometers with weights overnight.","[They’re a bunch of cowards who stutter when they see ladies. Brother, you have to bless them to find a partner as soon as possible. Otherwise, they might really become monks...]","He flipped through the letter page by page. At the end, he wrote: [Xia Jinyuan, June 27, 2002.]","After reading the letter, green veins appeared on the back of Xia Jinyuan’s hands that were holding the letter. He used a lot of strength to hold the letter. The papers were already wrinkled.","There was another letter placed quietly by the corner of the desk. Xia Jinyuan’s gaze definitely froze slightly. There was a faint smile on his thin lips. He tilted his upper body and reached out to take the forgotten letter. It wasn’t written to J5 by his comrades. It was a love letter written to Ye Jian by her suitor.","Xia Jinyuan opened the letter and read it. He raised his eyebrows many times and sneered from time to time.","Good lad! He actually had a crush on his girlfriend for so long! He still wanted to be with her for the rest of his life?","Xia Jinyuan would shatter this guy’s hope once and for all!","Tsk, tsk, tsk, tsk... Soar to new heights together? Was he a bird? In that case, that would be easy. Xia Jinyuan would shoot the guy down with a flick of his bow and pluck his feathers. He would fry this ’bird’ with green peppers, red peppers, and garlic. Then, Xia Jinyuan would eat the ’bird’! How would he fly then?","With every sentence in the love letter, Lieutenant Colonel Xia gritted his teeth and retorted. He was... very jealous!","After reading it, he put down the letter and slapped it with one hand. Lieutenant Colonel Xia almost fainted from jealousy.","After tidying up the letters his comrades wrote to J5, he muttered to himself, \"Brother, you’re right. My girlfriend is getting more and more admirers. I caught someone in the act today. This kid has some skills. The love letter he wrote is a little touching...","\"Fortunately, I made the first move and got the beauty early. If not, I’d still be single like those cowards.\""]},{"number":4430,"title":"Chapter 4430: Alarm","paragraphs":["Lieutenant Colonel Xia looked at the love letters again. He thought of the comrades in the team who didn’t even blink when they went to the battlefield. The crueler the environment, the calmer they were. However, they all stuttered and seemed to have ’mouth diseases’ in front of women. He wondered if he should bring this template back so that they could use it as a template.","Returning to the team with a letter from his girlfriend’s admirer to be used as a reference template?","Xia Jinyuan patted his forehead. It seemed like a storm had hit his brain. He was thinking of stupid ideas.","After he came to the National Science University, he went back with a love letter. With the sharpness of the people in the team, how could they not figure out the situation?","Everyone would know that the love letter came from his girlfriend’s admirer.","Fine, he didn’t want to be mocked by those inhumane fellows who didn’t have any sense of ’friendship’ at all. He couldn’t bring the love letter back to the team, not even if he copied it!","The love letter was torn apart by Xia Jinyuan. In the end, he felt that it wasn’t suitable to throw the pieces in the trash can. That couldn’t completely destroy the evidence. Hence, he specially ran to the bathroom and pressed the flush button. Seeing that the pieces of paper were getting washed away, the narrow-minded Lieutenant Colonel Xia nodded in satisfaction.","The lights went out with a click. The jealous man fell asleep.","He would sleep and go on a date with his girlfriend tomorrow.","Tomorrow was the holiday, so they could go out and play for half a day. The day after tomorrow, they would leave to visit their good comrade’s parents. Then, they would return to the base and gather before flying to the bordering town.","Although Xia Jinyuan was lying on the bed with his eyes closed, his mind didn’t rest immediately. He was still thinking about what he needed to do next before falling asleep slowly.","Outside, there was a storm. The water level of the Xiang River that went around Xiang City continued to rise. In some parts of the city, the water accumulated was more than a meter deep because of the drainage port. Several cars got stuck in the water and had to turn off their engines to ask the traffic police for help. There were even places where the trees were pulled down by the strong wind... The storm in Xiang City was destined to cause chaos.","There was heavy rain in Xiang City. Fujun Town, which was located in Anyang City in the Southern Province, was bright and sparse. A crescent moon hung high on the treetops.","A black sedan turned off its headlights and drove into Fujun Town under the moonlight and starlight. The sound of the car alerted the wandering dogs in the town.","The sedan stopped in a dark corner. Then, four figures quickly came down from the car.","\"Back then, I only went to Fujun Town once. I stayed for half a day before leaving. Red Plum’s house seemed to be in the town. I remember that there was a peach forest in front of Red Plum’s house. It wasn’t in the center of the town...\"","A man spoke in a low voice. He walked slightly in front and pointed at an old house that was built in the 1980s. It only had red bricks on the outside and didn’t even have any paint on it. \"This used to be the town’s supply and marketing cooperative. It was the place where I got off the car in the past. There used to be a company down here that received new recruits.","\"That’s all I know. I really don’t know where Red Plum’s home is. Regimental Commander Li didn’t tell me back then.\"","\"Think about it carefully. Besides the peach forest, are there any other buildings near Red Plum’s house? Maybe a village or a group?\"","The other man asked in a low voice. He waved at the other two people who were following closely behind him. They blocked the front and back of the man who was leading the way. This was to prevent the middle-aged man who was forcefully pulled into the car from escaping.","Although this person had never thought of escaping, he was the person who knew most about Red Plum’s residence back when she was alive. Old Master Li suspected that he was lying.","Hence, he had to be on guard."]},{"number":4431,"title":"Chapter 4431: Change Of Weather","paragraphs":["At three in the morning, Fujun Town was very quiet. Every household had turned off their lights, and the villagers had gone to bed. Everyone in the town had fallen asleep. Besides the dogs, no one knew that strangers had entered the town.","The four of them weren’t from Fujun Town so they didn’t know much about the town. Although the middle-aged man was leading the way, he wasn’t familiar with the road.","It had been so long since he came back to Fujun Town. Moreover, he had only walked around the dilapidated and poor town and didn’t go to Red Plum’s house. He could tell them everything he could remember. However, these people obviously didn’t believe him. He had no choice but to cooperate.","\"Let’s go to the reception area for the new recruits first. Then, you can think about if there are any other useful clues.\"","\"Okay, I’ll think about it carefully. Let’s walk this way and see if we can walk over. Back then, I went down from the supply and marketing cooperative and went up the field ladder...\"","The middle-aged man led the way as he spoke. He took the lead and walked down a small path that was only wide enough for one person. Weeds grew on both sides.","The sound of frogs could be heard in the summer night. Their calves swept across the weeds and alerted the frogs hiding in the grass. They jumped away one by one. There were poisonous water snakes hiding in the grass. If they were unlucky, they might be bitten by the water snakes.","The four of them didn’t turn on their flashlights and walked in the dark. They walked under the moonlight and listened to the barking as they walked toward the reception area for the new recruits.","After so many years, the town had changed. Even the fields and soil had changed. The man leading the way recalled the past under the moonlight. After walking for a few times, he finally found the recruit reception center.","So what if he found the reception center for new recruits?","They still couldn’t find a peach forest or where Red Plum lived.","These people had gone to every village where there was a woman named Red Plum. But they didn’t find any peach forests. It wasn’t until they found the middle-aged man who was leading the way the day before yesterday that they knew that ’Red Plum’ wasn’t her real name but her codename.","The day before yesterday, when Old Master Li found out that Red Plum was just a codename, he was so angry that he had a coughing fit.","In other words, all the time they spent previously was in vain. Red Plum wasn’t her real name. Even if they searched all the Red Plums in the neighboring towns, they wouldn’t be able to find the person Old Master Li was looking for.","They immediately changed the direction of her investigation. They were no longer just investigating the names of the people. They were investigating which women were soldiers in Fujun Town 16 years ago and how many female soldiers were buried in the martyr memorial park.","This time, they didn’t come to Fujun Town to look for someone. The soldiers split into two groups. One group entered Fujun Town and the other went to Anyang city and the Southern Province to look for clues.","According to reliable information from the man who was leading the way, back then, Red Plum was sacrificed and conferred the title of martyr. The prime minister personally covered her with the flag and sent her back to her hometown for a burial. As for whether she was buried in the martyr memorial park, it needed to be investigated.","It was destined that they wouldn’t gain anything from exploring Fujun Town tonight. The middle-aged man didn’t manage to find Red Plum’s home. Firstly, too much time had passed. Secondly, he hadn’t been to Red Plum’s house in the past. He had only gone through the motions. How was he supposed to find her?","At five o’clock in the morning, the four of them, who didn’t gain anything, found a hotel in the town where the driver of the supply truck was resting. They went to their rooms to wash up and sleep. They even specially instructed the hotel service staff not to disturb their rest.","When the first ray of sunlight lit up Fujun Town in the morning, the residents of the town started their busy day early. The vendors at the market placed all kinds of fresh vegetables and waited for customers to come. The night had passed, and a new sunny day had arrived.","The strangers who arrived at Fujun Town overnight also started asking around."]},{"number":4432,"title":"Chapter 4432: Good Tricks","paragraphs":["The weather in Fujun Town, which was located in the Southern Province, was bright. As for Xiang City, the heavy rain was still pouring. The students of the National Science University, who could have rested, gathered urgently at 5:00 am. Then, a truck went to every corner of the city to do water-proofing work.","Since Commissioner Cai had already arrived at the National Science University, he might as well watch Ye Jian’s training in the morning before leaving. Who knew that when he found the instructor, he would learn that Ye Jian had gathered at five in the morning to drain the water. He didn’t know when she would return to school.","In that case, Commissioner Cai could only leave regretfully.","\"Ye Jian is very outstanding. She has always been our school’s role model. Previously, we thought that Ye Jian achieved everything through hard work. Last night, when we heard you mention Ye Jian’s mother, we realized that it was hereditary.","\"Only an outstanding mother can have an outstanding daughter. What a pity...\"","What was a pity?","The instructor didn’t say anything, but Commissioner Cai knew what he meant.","Unfortunately, Red Plum passed away too early and couldn’t personally teach Ye Jian. If not, Ye Jian would’ve been even more outstanding.","If it were him, he wouldn’t feel that it was a pity. It was only a pity that Red Plum passed away so early. However, because of Little Ye, Red Plum’s talent wasn’t buried.","On the contrary, Ye Jian was even groomed by a Class A Master Sergeant and the world-class King of Guns. Although the journey was tough, she had already reached a peak that her peers couldn’t reach.","A pity?","It was a pity that Red Plum passed early and left behind Ye Jian, her daughter. She couldn’t enjoy the love of a mother.","It wasn’t a pity just because Ye Jian could’ve improved further with Red Plum by her side.","Commissioner Cai didn’t tell the truth. Instead, he sighed with emotion. \"Fortunately, her genes are strong. That’s why this child didn’t grow crooked. It’s all thanks to you and the military school’s careful education that Little Ye is where she is today. If her mother knew about this in the afterlife, she would definitely be gratified.\"","\"With such an outstanding daughter, any elder in the family will be gratified. Ye Jian was able to get to where she is today because of her own hard work. Her future achievements will be unimaginable. Her future is limitless.\"","The instructor sighed. Ye Jian was the most outstanding student he was satisfied with. He felt that it was a pleasure to chat with the elders of the outstanding student.","They chatted as they walked out of the school. The instructor didn’t turn around and leave until Commissioner Cai got into the taxi.","Far away in the capital city, Old Master Li was so angry that he kept trembling as he held the receiver. He answered the call in the study. Besides him, there was only an old servant guarding the door. The study door was closed, and the old servant didn’t know what was happening inside.","\"I pulled out all the files of the women who joined the military 16 years ago in Fujun Town, including the personnel files. But I couldn’t find Red Plum. The man who provided the information also confirmed that Red Plum wasn’t in any of the files.","\"The latest news from Anyang City’s martyr memorial park is that there are no female soldiers who died 16 years ago there. Last night, they checked the tombstones of the entire memorial park and confirmed that Red Plum isn’t among them. Also...\"","Old Master Li’s hands were trembling so much that he didn’t know that the corners of his mouth were tilted. He was panting heavily. He asked, \"What else...\"","His voice was sinister and cold. It didn’t have the kindness of an old man at all. He was like a venomous snake that had been hiding in the dark and damp. His entire body emitted a dark aura that made people want to vomit.","The person on the other end of the phone lowered his head and didn’t dare to answer.","Old Master Li pressed on. His voice was so deep that the person on the other end of the phone trembled in fear. \"What else? Speak!\""]},{"number":4433,"title":"Chapter 4433: No Action","paragraphs":["\"Also, the news from the Southern Province’s cemetery is... is...\"","\"Speak!\"","It was a simple word, but he roared it out. It could be seen how angry Old Master Li was.","How could he not be angry?","They had been investigating for almost a year, but what happened in the end? In the end, their investigation was all in vain. Her name wasn’t even her real name. It was just a codename!","Now, he finally managed to find some clues, but they kept telling him that they didn’t find anything!","There was no gain!","His son was killed at sea just like that. After shouting, Old Master Li started coughing violently. He coughed until his lungs seemed to give up.","\"Old Master, are you alright?\"","The old servant guarding outside heard him and asked worriedly, \"Do you need me to come in?\"","\"Stand guard!\"","Amidst the heavy coughing, Old Master Li reached out his trembling left hand and picked up the thermos flask on the desk. When the rim of the flask reached his mouth, it trembled non-stop. Even the water in the flask splashed out a little.","Old Master Li, who was burning with anger, didn’t notice anything strange about himself. He suppressed the itchiness in his throat and asked the person on the other end to report immediately.","\"There’s news from the Southern Province. They said that a year ago, a female soldier who met our criteria was suddenly moved back to her family’s ancestral home. It was a tomb from ten to 20 years ago. In the past, no one ever came to pay their respects. The staff member... couldn’t remember the soldier’s information.\"","Of course, he was afraid of answering.","It wasn’t easy for him to find something useful. In the end... they reached a dead end again.","Hearing this, the thermos in Old Master Li’s hand hit the desk with a bang. Then, it rolled a few times before hitting the solid wood floor, where it continued to roll.","The receiver fell from his hand. Old Master Li, whose hands had been trembling, collapsed in anger because of the latest investigation. His body suddenly tilted to the side. Then, he overturned the leather chair...","Bang!","An even louder sound of something heavy hitting the ground came from the study. The old servant’s eyelids twitched a few times when he heard it. At this moment, Second Old Madam Li came up with a nutritious breakfast. The old servant lowered his gaze and quickly went up to her. He said, \"Old Madam, quickly go in and take a look. There was a commotion in the study, but the old master didn’t allow me to go in. Hurry up and take a look... The old master hasn’t been feeling well recently. He was furious just now. We shouldn’t let anything happen.\"","The old servant said a lot of things in one sentence. Second Old Madam Li didn’t say anything either. She passed the breakfast over and pushed open the study room door.","\"Old Master! Old Master!! Someone, someone!\"","A few seconds later, Second Old Madam Li’s scream came from the study. Then, the old servant immediately went in. Soon, the family doctor rushed from the first floor to the second floor...","Old Master Li had fallen unconscious in his study.","Three minutes later, Old Master Li was carried out of the home and onto an ambulance. The ambulance sped all the way to the hospital.","The old servant stood at the entrance of the Li family’s mansion and watched the ambulance leave. He knocked on the heavy door with one hand and said in a low voice, \"Retribution, it’s retribution! Even he can’t avoid retribution. It’s just a matter of time. When the time is ripe, everything has to be repaid.\"","The heavy door closed again. The Li family’s mansion, which had just experienced chaos, regained its peace. It was as if nothing big had happened. It was still bathing in the sunlight in the capital city."]},{"number":4434,"title":"Chapter 4434: Live Well","paragraphs":["Less than an hour after Old Master Li was sent to the hospital, all the famous and powerful families in the capital city knew about it. Their former subordinates, who had also retired in the past, sent them over to take care of him immediately.","Old Master Xia put down the white chess piece between his fingers and sighed at Old Master Fu, who was holding the black chess piece with a slightly serious facial expression. He was serious and focused on not being affected by the outside world. \"It’s time for Old Li to lay low. He has wanted to do something great all his life. Being ambitious is a good thing, but it’s also bad for his ambition.\"","The white chess piece had no regrets, and there was no turning back. Life was like a chess game, and people were chess pieces. If every move was right, they would definitely be the winner. If one mistake was made, everything would be wrong...","The black chess piece in the old man’s hand didn’t land immediately. Instead, he weighed it in his hand and thought about where it should land. He slowly moved the chess piece in his palm and finally placed it on the chessboard.","After placing his chess piece, the old man said slowly, \"Old Li has a strong personality and a strong family background. His personality has always been obstinate, and he can’t tolerate others disobeying him. He’s a warlord from a strong family and is used to dominating the scene. His ambitions have been nurtured since he was young. It’s not wrong to say that he has been making mistakes his entire life.","\"But in his eyes, he’s not wrong.","\"From birth to old age, a person like him will never think that what they’re doing is wrong. I think that such a life is perfect. He can live a life he likes.\"","Old Master Fu, who was open-minded by nature, never evaluated other people’s lives easily. If you had never participated in other people’s lives, what right did you have to evaluate them?","Those who liked to point fingers at other people’s lives and boast about their intelligence were often failures in life. They always summarized other people’s lives. When had they ever been responsible for their own lives?","Without participation, there was no right to speak. Unfortunately, not everyone understood this principle.","Grandpa Xia was silent for a while. Then, he nodded lightly. \"You’re a clear-minded person. My father understood you. The first time you met, he knew that you were open-minded and wouldn’t break easily.\"","Hence, although the old man’s life was bumpy, he still maintained his pure heart and continued to serve the country.","\"There’s only you and me today. Tell me the truth. Do you really have no regrets?\" Grandpa Xia asked his old friend with a serious smile.","Old Master Fu shook his head and laughed loudly. \"Old man, are you trying to trick me? Hahaha, I have no regrets. It’s only been a few decades. Regret is something that needs to be looked back on and remembered. It’s a waste of my precious time.","\"I like to move forward. I don’t like to turn back, and I don’t like to waste time. Regret? What’s there to regret? How many of my peers died young in my generation? How many of my peers lived harder lives than me?","\"I’m still alive, and I have a goal. How could I regret it?\"","\"Old Li was obstinate his entire life and lived his own life. Although he was criticized, he never regretted it.","Indeed, if Old Master Li had regretted it, this wouldn’t have happened.","The two elders stopped discussing other people. The topic returned to the chess game. They thought about the chess game and made their move. Every step was carefully thought out.","The Li family was at the end of their rope. They would see if the pillar of the family could survive. If he was lucky enough to survive, the family could last for a few more years. If they couldn’t, then it was about time.","As for the wife who started out as a mistress, the reputable families in the capital city didn’t think much of her."]},{"number":4435,"title":"Chapter 4435: Different Date","paragraphs":["The Li family was the last warlord family to fall. It had to be said that Old Master Li’s methods were extraordinary.","Far away in the sea in the south, Li Jinnian didn’t know what had happened to the Li family in the capital city. He continued training with the water ghosts in the sea and on land. It was the same day after day, but he didn’t find it boring.","At 10:00 am, the rain in Xiang City became lighter. All the waterlogged areas in the city were cleared through effective channels. All the problems were solved. Although the water level of Xiang River was rising, it was still a distance away from the cordon.","Holding the shovel, Xia Jinyuan shoveled the last piece of trash into the trash truck. He raised his head and looked around. He saw his girlfriend, who had been intentionally moving within his vision.","He looked over, and she seemed to have noticed him. She turned her head and looked back. There were several students in military raincoats between them. The two of them noticed each other immediately.","Holding the shovel with one hand, Xia Jinyuan’s thin lips curled up slightly. He smiled and looked at her intently.","Ye Jian looked around vigilantly like a little mouse. Then, she secretly glanced back with affection.","After the university entrance examination, they could have rested for a day today. Last night, before she went to bed, she wanted to go to the officer’s office to get the admission slip and give him a surprise.","However, the plan couldn’t keep up with the changes. All the students gathered at five in the morning. All the third-year students needed to rush to various places in the city to guard against the flood. The fourth-year students were sent to a few villages around Xiang City that were severely affected by the flood.","When Xia Jinyuan knew that the third-year students needed to go to the city to drain the water, he rushed over and successfully infiltrated the area Ye Jian and the rest were in charge of.","At that time, Ye Jian and Xu Wen were digging out the trash that blocked the exit. In the heavy rain, the most familiar voice suddenly sounded. \"I’ll do it. Go over and push the trash truck here.\"","At that time, the heavy rain was so heavy that it hurt when it hit their bodies. His voice was especially clear and went straight to Ye Jian’s heart.","Only then did she know that her man had taken the initiative to come and drain the water.","The class was in charge of guarding the upper reaches of the Xiang River. They started work at 5:00 am and only completed their mission at 10:00 am.","It wasn’t easy for the two of them to meet, but in the end, they came out together to drain the floodwater... There was nothing else.","Although the two of them were drenched and cold, their hearts were burning. It was because the person they loved the most was always by their side. Even if it was just eye contact, they were satisfied.","After looking at each other for a while, Xia Jinyuan coughed softly. His thin lips moved, and he seemed to have said two words.","Ye Jian, who received the message, looked around. In the end, she was almost done. Her team had already finished cleaning up the place. She no longer stood around. Instead... she walked toward the man who was standing at the same spot.","\"Come here...\"","That was what Xia Jinyuan said just now.","Xia Jinyuan, who was also wearing a company cap and raincoat, successfully infiltrated her class. Xu Wen and He Jing didn’t notice him. Song Zhiqiu and the other boys didn’t notice him either. The moment he wore the raincoat, he straightened his collar. His military rank was very easy to hide. He lowered his company cap a little. The students who were fighting the flood didn’t notice that there was a lieutenant colonel beside them.","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing on the spot, saw the woman walking toward him decisively. His smile was so deep that even the soldier aura around him became exceptionally gentle.","\"Let’s walk in front.\"","When she came over, Xia Jinyuan spoke in a low voice. He had already taken the shovel from Ye Jian’s hand. \"Let’s walk for a few hundred meters before coming back.\""]},{"number":4436,"title":"Chapter 4436: The Sweet Couple","paragraphs":["Although they had entered the final round of cleaning up, they couldn’t leave immediately. They would wait on standby until they received orders from their superiors to return to school.","Xia Jinyuan took this opportunity to walk with Ye Jian.","The two of them walked side by side along the bank of the Xiang River. After walking a little further, Xia Jinyuan suddenly bent down and whispered into her ear, \"We finally look like a couple.\"","Hearing this, Ye Jian couldn’t help but laugh lightly. \"We wear couple’s outfits every day. It’s just that we don’t meet each other.\"","\"That’s right. We wear them every day, but we don’t meet. However, some people can meet you every day and even send you love letters.\"","Xia Jinyuan had been holding back from talking about what happened yesterday until now... Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had already overcome his jealousy, still couldn’t help but say it.","Love letter?","The image of a fourth-year senior handing her a love letter yesterday flashed past her mind. Ye Jian narrowed her eyes slightly and asked Xia Jinyuan, \"As it turned out, you came at that time and even saw the fourth-year senior handing me a love letter. You must have seen me reject him.","\"I’ve already rejected him, but you’re still jealous. Captain Xia, shouldn’t men become more mature as they grow older? Shouldn’t their hearts become broader too? Why are you the opposite? I didn’t realize that you were such a jealous man in the past.\"","Ye Jian didn’t panic after knowing that her boyfriend had seen someone confessing to her.","She had rejected her senior decisively, after all. She didn’t say more than five sentences the entire time. She didn’t speak for more than a minute. So what if she was discovered? She didn’t do anything bad!","It was just that... Cough, she felt a little guilty.","Her boyfriend came all the way here to see her, but he saw another guy confessing to her. Thinking about it from another perspective, she knew Captain Xia was most definitely frustrated. If she were him, she wouldn’t have been as calm as Captain Xia. She wouldn’t be able to pretend that nothing happened and leave silently.","If it were her, she would have rushed up and called out ’my dear’. Then, she would ’kill’ her potential love rival with a domineering gaze!","In the past, she had really fantasized that such a day would happen. Unexpectedly... three years had passed, but she had never acted it out.","She had misunderstood Du Jiayi’s appearance, but that was not the case in the end.","Ye Jian was frank. Xia Jinyuan didn’t notice her guilty conscience. Instead, she said it too frankly. Xia Jinyuan coughed unnaturally.","Did she think that he was magnanimous in the past?","It was all an illusion!","\"I’ve always been like this. That year when you were in grade 12, I saw a boy giving you a love letter. I was so narrow-minded that I immediately wrote a love letter. I even regretted not confessing to you first. I’ve always been like this. Why did you misunderstand that I was magnanimous?\"","Lieutenant Colonel Xia didn’t think that he was magnanimous, especially when he saw someone handing a love letter to his girlfriend. How could he be magnanimous?","How was that possible?","Ye Jian thought about it. It was true.","Whenever she met a guy who expressed interest in her, Captain Xia would be very gentlemanly, especially when there were outsiders present. He would definitely be elegant and calm. But behind her back... he would make sure to settle each score with her.","She felt sweet about this.","Ye Jian, who stepped into Xia Jinyuan’s shoes, immediately coaxed him. She said gently, \"Don’t be jealous. In the future, you’ll supervise the entire unit. You can clear the obstacles that you find annoying from ten kilometers away. What do you think?\""]},{"number":4437,"title":"Chapter 4437: We’re Different","paragraphs":["When it was time to coax him, she would. She didn’t have any experience in love, but she had been in a relationship for three years and had seen Xu Wen and He Jing in their previous relationships. She learned many useful lessons. When the couples interacted, the ladies would give in sometimes. When necessary, they had to be patient and coax their other half. They had to care for each other and be tolerant of each other. Only then could they live a good life for a long time.","Captain Xia would coax her patiently. Similarly, she would coax him too.","In fact, she knew that her Captain Xia wasn’t narrow-minded. However, since he mentioned it and said it, it meant that he was still at ease and unhappy about it. In that case, she was responsible for making him happy.","It didn’t matter if the other party was in a good mood or not.","She hoped that he would be happy every minute and second when he was with her. She didn’t want there to be any misunderstandings because of unimportant people and things.","Besides his identity as a special forces soldier and his identity as the commander of the Xueyu unit, Captain Xia was just an ordinary man. He would get hurt because of love and lose sleep over it. He wasn’t omnipotent. It was just that other people thought that he was as powerful as a shield and often ignored his true feelings.","She was his girlfriend and his lover. The Captain Xia she saw was the real Captain Xia. There were times when he would feel weak, cry, hurt, and smile...","It was all because he was so real in front of her. He was so real that she could deeply feel that this powerful man treated her as an inseparable part of his life.","Hence, she was willing to coax him, accommodate him, and even change for him.","After being coaxed by his girlfriend, Xia Jinyuan didn’t feel any jealousy anymore. His fatigue from the past few months was swept away.","Why was his little fox so likable?","His dark eyes were filled with gentleness. He tilted his head slightly and looked at her dotingly. \"I can’t help it. Who asked my woman to be too outstanding? It’s normal for people to like her. However, this outstanding woman belongs to me alone. Those people can only look at them but can’t beg for them. I’m much luckier than them.\"","His gaze was too gentle. His deep love made Ye Jian’s heart feel sweet. She turned around and looked behind her. Seeing that there was definitely a distance between them, Ye Jian made another bold move... She took the initiative to hold Xia Jinyuan’s hand with the help of her raincoat. In the end, they interlocked their fingers and felt the warmth in each other’s palms...","Although their way of dating was different compared to other couples, they were happy to be able to hold each other’s hands when they were busy.","Ye Jian, who came with the pain of her previous life and never thought that she would find a life partner in this life, was slowly pried open by Xia Jinyuan in the gentlest and firmest way. She finally learned to take the initiative in love and stop running away.","She used her own method to slowly nibble away at Xia Jinyuan’s strong heart so that this proud man only had eyes for her.","After walking for about 500 meters, the two of them retraced their steps. Their interaction was much happier than those couples who quarreled every day and were tired. They were happy for every second they were together. They were bathed in the sunlight and felt the greatest satisfaction between their hearts.","At 10:30 am, Ye Jian and the rest returned to the school. Due to the heavy rain, Ye Jian and the rest canceled their holidays and returned to the school to be on standby. If there was any danger, they would take action immediately.","When Xia Jinyuan left, Ye Jian was fighting for disaster relief outside. Even when saying goodbye, the two of them were still hard at work at the event location."]},{"number":4438,"title":"Chapter 4438: Challenge","paragraphs":["Before Xia Jinyuan left, there was a new round of heavy rain in Xiang City. The water level of the Xiang River rose by three centimeters overnight. At 10:00 am, all the third-year students of the National Science University, where Ye Jian was, received an emergency notice at midnight. Ye Jian and the rest, who were sleeping, gathered urgently and left the National Science University at 12:50 am to fight the flood.","This time, they had to carry sandbags to consolidate a town called ’White Town’ in Xiang City.","The terrain of White Town was low. Once the dam was in danger, the place would definitely be submerged by the Xiang River. There were not enough people. In the end, they asked the National Science University for help. That was why Ye Jian and the rest took action again.","All the third-year students rushed to White Town to carry sandbags with the villagers.","Ye Jian, Xu Wen, and He Jing were no exception. They were all on the A-list and didn’t sit at the back because of their gender.","It wasn’t an easy task to fight against the flood. It was a high-risk mission. In the vehicle heading to the ’White Town’, the officer gave a sheet of paper to Ye Jian. Ye Jian wrote a letter of challenge as the representative. It meant that if they were sacrificed, they would be worthy of their military uniform.","It had been three years in the military school. This flood-resistant mission was the first mission that the third-year students really wanted to carry out. Yesterday’s mission didn’t count. It was just to help.","The atmosphere in the vehicle was a little tense. Xu Wen held He Jing’s hand tightly. She realized that He Jing’s palm was cold. When Xu Wen reached out her hand, He Jing immediately held it tightly. The two of them held each other’s hands tightly. No one dared to speak loudly.","The officer leading the team knew that the students were nervous, so he smiled and said, \"Come, let’s sing the soldier song. I’ll start the tune.\"","The officer started the tune. The soldiers in the vehicle sang loudly. Ye Jian lowered her head and wrote the letter of challenge as the vehicle shook. Her mental fortitude was the best.","After she finished writing, Ye Jian pressed the red ink with her thumb and left her fingerprint on the letter. Then, the paper and ink were passed around in the truck until all the fingerprints of the 45 students were pressed on it. Finally, the paper returned to Ye Jian’s hand.","After getting off the vehicle, Ye Jian would pass it to the officer.","The soldiers sang throughout the journey. In the end, when the tense atmosphere disappeared, they could still joke around.","It wasn’t just Ye Jian’s class. The other classes were the same.","This was their first high-risk mission. How could the young students who were only in their early 20s not be nervous?","Even if they were nervous, they had to go!","Because they were the children of the people!","Xia Jinyuan was in the same car as the director again. When the door closed, the dean, who was sitting in the back row, had a strange expression on his face. Even his gaze was probing.","The director felt that he had discovered... a truth that he didn’t dare to confirm.","When he knew that the third-year students who went to fight the flood and provide disaster relief had placed their thumbprints on the letter of challenge, Xia Jinyuan pursed his thin lips when he got into the vehicle. His handsome face was so cold that the dean, who seemed to have learned of the truth, held back his worry for a while.","The Jeep drove through the rain for about ten minutes. The dean, who was getting more and more suspicious, finally asked.","\"What’s your relationship with her? Tell me the truth!\"","Afraid that the driver in front would hear him, the dean, who had put in a lot of effort, lowered his voice. He stared at the young lieutenant colonel whose face was illuminated by the light outside and said, \"Answer me truthfully!\"","Xia Jinyuan straightened his back and secretly stretched out his curled-up fingers. He turned his head and saw that the dean’s expression was even worse than the weather outside."]},{"number":4439,"title":"Chapter 4439: Soldiers Go On An Expedition","paragraphs":["He said, \"Her talent is rare. The military values her greatly and will focus on nurturing her. Our relationship is that she’s a soldier and I’m a general.\"","She was a soldier, and he was a general... The dean narrowed his eyes as he stared at Xia Jinyuan.","Ye Jian didn’t want to stay in school. She wanted to go to the field military unit the most. She wanted to become a first-tier soldier who had experienced the baptism of gunfire. Now, the young lieutenant colonel told him that she was a soldier and he was a general. He could understand why every time he saw the student he was most proud of coming back, his military might would increase.","As it turned out, Xia Jinyuan was also a soldier on the frontline. He probably carried out all kinds of unknown combats.","The dean took a deep breath. He didn’t ask what high-risk profession his former student was in. Instead, he said, \"Really?\"","\"Really.\"","Xia Jinyuan nodded. His calm and frank expression made the dean relax a little.","Xia Jinyuan, who was from the special forces, didn’t let the dean notice anything amiss. His righteous answer made the dean believe him easily. He believed it too quickly, making Xia Jinyuan feel a little awkward.","In the car, the dean sighed softly. \"I almost thought... I almost thought...\"","Xia Jinyuan knew the words the dean didn’t say out loud. He knew very well that the dean almost thought that he was dating Ye Jian. There was no need to ’think’ about it.","The military school didn’t explicitly prohibit dating. However, some rules existed implicitly. Default existence was also a form of existence.","In the last year, he had to guard it well.","The dean heaved a sigh of relief and said in a low voice, \"She’s indeed a good talent. You must nurture her well. She’ll definitely achieve great things in the future. Although it’s dangerous this time, don’t worry too much. If there’s really big danger, they’ll evacuate immediately.\"","\"There’s no absolute safety. Flood relief is a high-risk mission. Once there’s a danger, even if we evacuate immediately, we can’t guarantee 100% safety. Otherwise, a letter of challenge wouldn’t be needed.\" Xia Jinyuan was like a prophet who had seen through the heavens. He said slowly in a faint and sharp tone, \"When soldiers go on an expedition, life and death are uncertain.\"","When soldiers went on an expedition, their life and death were uncertain...","The words were like bullets that instantly hit the dean’s heart. He looked at the student who used to give him the most headache but was also the most outstanding. After a long time, the dean’s voice turned gloomy as he said softly, \"I’m very happy to see you appear in front of me alive.","\"I hope that Little Ye will be like you in the future. When you have time, go back to your alma mater and see these old faces. Let the instructors who miss you feel at ease.\"","They were relieved to know that their outstanding students were living well.","Xia Jinyuan nodded. His scalp was still tense.","White Town was located downstream of Xiang City. They arrived after an hour and a half of driving in the heavy rain. All the trucks stopped.","\"Quick, get off, get off! Follow closely behind! Don’t touch anything!\"","\"Everyone, gather. Hurry!\"","\"Class squad leaders, take care of your students. Assign tasks and positions. Count the number of people in your class every hour!\"","One by one, the commands were given. All the third-year students alighted within two minutes. Within three minutes, everyone had gathered. They stood in ten rows and waited for the order. They would move immediately.","The heavy rain was frightening. It was so heavy that they couldn’t open their eyes at all. The residents of White Town didn’t sleep. More than ten families near the river moved overnight to prevent anything from happening."]},{"number":4440,"title":"Chapter 4440: Accompany You Through Storms","paragraphs":["As the rain got heavier, the residents around the Xiang River in the distance started to move in the rain. Under the command of the village officials, they got into the trucks that sent the third-year students over.","They went to the safe zone while Ye Jian and the rest went to the dangerous zone.","Xia Jinyuan, who jumped down from the car, quickly found his girlfriend who was in charge of fighting against the flood. With such heavy rain, Xia Jinyuan didn’t spend much time among the students who were wearing raincoats. He rushed over and raised his hand to lift the sandbags on Ye Jian’s shoulder.","Ye Jian, Song Zhiqiu, and a few other outstanding students were the first batch to carry the sandbags. Ye Jian was walking very quickly. Suddenly, she felt the weight lighten. She thought that the sandbags had leaked out and was about to put them down for inspection when a calm voice came from the heavy rain that hurt her face. \"It’s me.\"","’It’s me. I’m with you tonight,’ Xia Jinyuan said the rest in his mind.","Ye Jian felt a lump in her throat. She didn’t look back because the weight of his help was reduced. She walked faster.","Her Captain Xia was here to accompany her again...","With him accompanying her, the storm was nothing!","Ye Jian was carrying sandbags, and Xia Jinyuan was carrying sandbags too. He was covered in mud, so he stood behind Ye Jian. When he saw his girlfriend carrying bags of sandbags, as her boyfriend, his heart ached.","Hence, he followed behind Ye Jian the entire time. Both of them were carrying sandbags. At the same time, he reached out and lifted the sandbags on his girlfriend’s shoulder. He used this method to silently support and protect Ye Jian.","With a lover around, no matter how hard or tiring the work was, she wouldn’t complain. Every time Ye Jian lifted the sandbags and the weight suddenly decreased, she knew that it was her man reaching out his strong arms again and protecting her in his way.","\"Don’t use one shoulder. Take turns to carry the sandbags! Put one hand on your waist and use the strength of your waist to reduce the weight on your shoulder.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was carrying a sandbag, pointed at Ye Jian in a low voice. His hand held the sandbag firmly, and his arm was like a mountain holding up the sky for Ye Jian.","Xia Jinyuan changed into his camouflage uniform and put on his raincoat. He didn’t look out of place when he blended into the command team. There were so many students around him. They were all grabbing their sandbags and didn’t notice the young lieutenant colonel who sneaked in.","Even Xu Wen and He Jing were no exception. The two of them even brushed past them a few times, but they didn’t realize that the tall figure who had been silently helping Ye Jian wasn’t a student of their class.","Under Xia Jinyuan’s influence, the male students in the class followed suit silently. Liu Yang even patted Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder when Xia Jinyuan put down the sandbag. His face was covered in mud. He smiled softly and said, \"Buddy, you’re very wise! Not bad! But why are you always just helping Ye Jian? Do you like Ye Jian too?\"","Ye Jian, who was also putting down sandbags in front, turned around and heard Liu Yang teasing her. She smiled and glared at him. \"Get to work, Comrade Liu! There are more than 10,000 sandbags here that need to be moved and another 5,000 sandbags waiting to be delivered. Do you want to sleep in the Xiang River tonight and listen to the wind, rain, and thunder? You can carry another bag while you’re chatting if you insist on running your mouth.\"","Xia Jinyuan noticed that the male student used the word ’too’. This meant that his girlfriend was very popular in the military school.","Liu Yang didn’t expect Ye Jian to hear him talking so softly. He chuckled and wiped his face with the rainwater. Then, he ran away like a monkey.","Ye Jian smiled and sighed. \"He likes to joke. Don’t listen to his nonsense.\""]},{"number":4441,"title":"Chapter 4441: The Hardest","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan didn’t take Liu Yang’s words to heart. The military school had always had too many boats chasing too few fish. It was normal for several male students to have a good impression of the same female student. It was the restlessness of youth. It might not be love but just a good impression.","The rain was pouring. The puddles of yellow mud flowed everywhere. When he stepped on it, the mud splashed on the students around him. Xia Jinyuan pulled Ye Jian’s cap and sighed with a smile. \"If I listen to everything, I’ll get suffocated.\"","Now was the time to work. Xia Jinyuan, who always wanted to be scrupulous in separating public from private interests, wouldn’t ask Ye Jian to explain just because of Liu Yang’s teasing.","Ye Jian shook off the rainwater on her face and couldn’t help but purse her lips and smile. The two of them ran side by side and continued to rush to the sand-bearing point.","The rain was very heavy, and there were no signs of it getting smaller. Xia Jinyuan frowned slightly. As he ran, he said to Ye Jian in a low voice, \"The terrain of White Town is too low. If the rain continues like now, the dam might break.\"","There was another major hidden danger in White Town. There were many private battlefields, and most of them were close to the tributaries by the river. These places were damaged to the point that the soil was soft. Once the tributaries gathered together and the river sand surged, it would be another disaster.","When they arrived at White Town, Commissar Yue told the students the truth. He didn’t hide the possibility of a disaster.","Ye Jian’s understanding of White Town was not as good as Xia Jinyuan. Hearing that, she replied in a low voice, \"There are a total of 15,000 sandbags. We’re in charge of dealing with the biggest hidden danger first. The village will bring people to clear a few tributaries and try their best to consolidate them in advance.\"","Sandbags were the best solution at the moment.","Hundreds of third-year students from the National Science University ran in the dark and rainy night. Their young and immature faces were not afraid of the danger they faced. They took on the responsibility and faced certain difficulties bravely.","The 15,000 sandbags kept decreasing. The sandbags on the other side of the dam piled higher and higher. No one complained about being tired. Even if their arms and shoulders were scratched by the sandbags, they gritted their teeth and persevered without flinching.","\"Press more this way. It’s not tight! The few of you, step back. Don’t get too close to the dam!\"","Commissar Yue followed them the entire time and patrolled back and forth along the entire embankment that needed to be reinforced. He needed to keep an eye on their students. While observing the danger, he had to take care of their safety!","There was a mortality rate for this mission, and he didn’t want to see it at all!","The dean of the department was tracking and reminding them from another side. He was tense, afraid that an accident would happen.","\"Footsteps, watch your step! Don’t rush blindly! Watch out!\"","\"Those who can’t take it, rest for a while. Don’t force yourself! There are still many opportunities that need you!\"","Holding the hand-held loudspeaker, the dean reminded them again and again. He stared at the students coming and going. Once he realized that some students were not paying attention to the river, the dean immediately widened his eyes and shouted.","This night was destined to be the most unforgettable night in Ye Jian’s military school. Everyone was racing against time and moving forward in the rain.","At 3:27 am, the river in White Town broke through the dam. A large amount of sand rushed into the farmland along with the muddy river water, causing at least 20 acres of farmland to be affected. The dangerous spot was less than 20 meters away from Ye Jian’s mission location...","The anxious-looking village official ran over to borrow people. Commissar Yue and a few officers gritted their teeth and ’lent’ 40 third-year students. Afraid that something would happen to the students, two officers followed the village official to the other side to carry sandbags."]},{"number":4442,"title":"Chapter 4442: Reluctant","paragraphs":["\"Hurry! Hurry! Speed up!\"","\"One, two, three! Up!\"","The rain was so heavy. The young figures were busy in the rain. Their hands and feet had long been soaked by the rain until their skin was wrinkled and white. Their entire bodies were like a walking watering machine.","At five in the morning, the 15,000 sandbags were finally carried over. They guarded the bank tightly. At this moment, all the students were so tired that they didn’t have the energy to take another step.","Ye Jian leaned on Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder. She was so tired that she didn’t want to talk anymore.","The two of them carried many sandbags together tonight. In the end, Ye Jian avoided Xia Jinyuan so that he wouldn’t help her anymore. She was afraid that he would collapse from exhaustion.","The students all sat on the ground and leaned against each other. Under such fatigue, they still remembered that they had to form a formation and not lean against each other.","Commissar Yue and the other political commissars came down from the dam and saw the students sitting in the water. They were so tired that they didn’t even choose a proper place to sit. Their eyes were wet.","They really wanted to give the students a resting place to shelter them from the rain. The surroundings were wide and spacious. Besides the houses, there was no place to rest.","\"Don’t sleep, don’t sleep! You’ll catch a cold if you sleep! Don’t sleep, do you hear me?!\"","Along the way, Commissar Yue and the officer kept shaking the students who were so tired that they were about to fall asleep in the rain. \"Everyone, rest for a while. But don’t sleep, do you hear me?\"","The truck stopped by the side of the road. The students were still two to three kilometers away from the road. They needed to walk over to board the truck. Their bodies were sore, and they couldn’t move. At this moment, they just wanted to rest and catch their breath.","After all, Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan were different. No matter how tired they were, they could still stand up. After resting for five minutes, Xia Jinyuan stood up first. He wanted to return to the military school first, pack his luggage, and rush to the airport.","\"Come, let me carry you to the car to rest.\" He stood up and reached out his hand. He pulled Ye Jian, who was about to get up, together with him. \"Take a nap in the truck. Don’t fall asleep.\"","Ye Jian waved her hand and said, \"We have to gather and leave together. I’ll send you off.\"","When going out on a mission, one was not allowed to leave the team alone. This was a rule.","Xia Jinyuan pursed his lips and looked around. Among all the students, only he and the little fox stood up. He didn’t know how long it would take for the main team to gather...","Ye Jian knew what he was worried about and quickly comforted him, saying, \"Don’t worry about me. In the past, when I passed through the primeval forest in Yun Province alone, it rained heavily for half a month. It’s okay, I can handle it. Come, I’ll send you off. If you stay any longer, you won’t be able to catch the plane.","\"Visiting Uncle and Aunt is important...\" She was talking about J5’s elderly parents.","She insisted on sending him off, but Xia Jinyuan didn’t want her to send him off at all. She was so tired, but she still wanted to send him off. He just wanted her to go back to the truck to rest.","He didn’t want Ye Jian to send him off, but he couldn’t resist her at all. He was at his wit’s end. He could only take a step back and let her send him off a few hundred meters.","The two of them took a step back. Before Commissar Yue and the officers arrived, they left together.","Xia Jinyuan came and went in a hurry. The two of them didn’t have any time to truly belong to each other. The ten minutes of walk they got out of their busy schedule was their date time.","They were too busy to have much time for the two of them.","Xia Jinyuan left in a hurry. Even Xu Wen and He Jing didn’t know that he had been here. Firstly, it was in the middle of the night. Secondly, they were wearing the same raincoat and carrying the same life jacket. It was impossible to tell who was who in the dark.","The dean’s vehicle was already waiting in front. The two of them held hands and walked for about 300 meters before Xia Jinyuan ordered Ye Jian to return. She was not allowed to stand on the spot and watch him leave. He would supervise her and make sure she returned immediately."]},{"number":4443,"title":"Chapter 4443: Brave","paragraphs":["Before parting, Ye Jian tiptoed and kissed Xia Jinyuan’s thin lips again. ’I’m sorry, my lover. I couldn’t accompany you properly.’","Ye Jian apologized silently in her heart.","There were some things that didn’t need to be said. Both of them knew it.","Xia Jinyuan hugged Ye Jian’s waist with one hand and kissed her back fiercely. Under the cover of the dark and rainy night, their kiss was lingering.","’Silly girl, you don’t have to apologize for not being able to accompany me. As your boyfriend, I should apologize. I’m the one who can’t keep accompanying you.’","\"Be good and go back quickly. We’ll meet again in half a month.\" After a kiss mixed with the smell of rain and mud, Xia Jinyuan said passionately, \"I’ll watch you go back. Don’t stand here and send me off. It’s my last rule.\"","\"Okay.\" Ye Jian raised her head from his arms and returned to the main group.","She looked back three times with every step she took. She kept looking back until she couldn’t see the fluorescent strip on the life jacket anymore.","Ye Jian was destined to be very busy for the entire month.","After the rescue mission ended, Ye Jian’s hands and feet were scraped. Especially her feet. They had been soaked in water for the past three days. When she took off her shoes and socks, her delicate feet were soaked until the creases on her skin turned white. There were several blisters on the soles of her feet. She used a needle to pick out the water inside. No matter how delicate her feet were, they were still soaked until they looked tragic.","It was the same for Xu Wen and He Jing. There were blisters on their hands and feet. Xu Wen was even worse. Yesterday, she couldn’t help but secretly break the blisters on her feet. In the end, she was in pain for half the night. When she took off her socks, the fabric stuck to the blisters on her feet. Xu Wen, who was unprepared, screamed in pain on the spot.","\"I told you not to break the blisters. You have to finish the rescue mission first. But you didn’t listen to me. You deserve the pain!\"","He Jing looked at the three oval abrasions on the red flesh under her feet. She frowned as she thought of cleaning and disinfecting the wounds. The water they had been in was all sewage from the city. All kinds of bacteria could be found. They had been soaking in it for the entire day. It would be strange if Xu Wen’s wounds weren’t inflamed.","Ye Jian prepared some medicine for Xu Wen. Seeing that Xu Wen was in so much pain that there were teeth marks on her lower lip, Ye Jian was afraid that she would bite her tongue after applying the medicine. She took out a piece of sterile gauze from her sanitary bag and stuffed it into Xu Wen’s mouth. \"Bite it. It’ll hurt later.\"","Xu Wen, who was already in so much pain that her eyes were filled with tears, wasn’t thinking about how much more pain there would be. She bit the gauze and said in a muffled voice, \"Fortunately, the university entrance examination ended. I... Ah...\"","He Jing took some iodine to disinfect her wound. Before Xu Wen could finish her sentence, she screamed in pain again. \"It hurts, it hurts. Be gentle, be gentle. Jing, show mercy...\"","Due to the gauze in her mouth, she could only mumble.","\"How can I show mercy? There’s black debris embedded in your wound. I have to wash it out! Don’t move. Bear with it.\"","Although she said that, her actions were still a little gentle. However, it wasn’t enough. The debris in the wound was too deep. It was impossible to wash it lightly. He Jing frowned and said in a low voice, \"Bear with it. I’ll try my best to move faster!\"","She exerted strength in her hand. It was so painful that Xu Wen fell back onto the bed and screamed while biting the gauze. Ye Jian pressed her legs to prevent Xu Wen from kicking He Jing away.","This time, He Jing didn’t say that Xu Wen was pretentious and couldn’t suffer anymore because the wounds on her feet were severe. She felt pain for her.","After the officer knew about this, he personally went to the dormitory to visit Xu Wen. Ye Jian received a shock when he arrived. Her intuition told her that with this visit, what welcomed Xu Wen was definitely many times more violent than a storm."]},{"number":4444,"title":"Chapter 4444: Continuous Punishment","paragraphs":["As expected, Xu Wen welcomed a storm in the last semester of her third year. The officer’s anger could be described as a tornado. He roared again and again. Xu Wen was so pitiful.","She straightened her back and stood at attention. She faced the officer’s tornado head-on. Ye Jian and He Jing couldn’t escape either. They were criticized together.","Why were the two of them being criticized at this time?","The reason was simple.","As comrades, they didn’t know how to care about their comrades. They deserved to be scolded and punished. The three of them stood in a row and were scolded until the sounds were heard in the neighboring dormitory.","Xu Wen felt very guilty. Because of her, she implicated her comrades who got scolded as well. She thought that she would be done after a scolding. Unexpectedly, the officer pointed at the dormitory door and said to Ye Jian and He Jing, \"Xu Wen was injured because of your neglect. Now, go out and run three rounds. Report to me after you’re done!\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Yes!\"","Ye Jian and He Jing replied in unison. The corners of Xu Wen’s eyes turned red. She said firmly, \"Officer, it’s my fault. I’ll run with them.\"","\"Have a good rest and reflect on your actions!\"","The officer didn’t criticize her. He used the most unacceptable method to let Xu Wen understand the consequences of disobeying orders.","Xu Wen’s heart was about to explode. She wanted to say something, but He Jing reminded her, \"Rest well. We’ll run and then come back.\"","Ye Jian pursed her lips slightly. The officer’s expression told her that even if Xu Wen was resting, she wouldn’t be resting in the dormitory. Instead...","\"She’ll supervise you to complete three laps! Listen to the command and turn left! March in unison!\"","Just as she had the thought, the officer gave the order.","Xu Wen swayed. \"Officer...\" Even when she started begging, the officer wasn’t moved. Instead, he said coldly, \"Why? Do you still want to disobey orders?\"","\"Xu Wen, watch us run later and think about why the officer made such an arrangement,\" Ye Jian said. She knew Xu Wen too well. Her personal emotions were easily controlled. Once her emotions were affected, she wouldn’t be calm. Once she couldn’t calm down, she wouldn’t be able to think about the reason.","She needed someone to enlighten her.","It was obvious why the officer didn’t punish Xu Wen but only her and He Jing.","Obeying orders and listening to arrangements were not just about one thing. They covered all aspects, including reminding people what they needed to pay attention to.","Obviously, Xu Wen had changed a lot in the past three years in military school. Her bad habits during her first year of school had all disappeared. However, there would always be some small habits that allowed one to make mistakes.","They were about to be in their fourth year of university. If Ye Jian didn’t change all of Xu Wen’s small habits, she would suffer even more in the military unit.","The officer only punished Ye Jian and He Jing so that Xu Wen could see what consequences her carelessness would bring to her comrades.","He hoped that after this incident, she would be able to cut off some of her small habits immediately and think twice before doing anything.","When the officer saw this, he sighed in his heart. It looked like he still needed to have a good chat with Xu Wen. If Ye Jian hadn’t been guiding her, she would’ve been persuaded to return to her hometown in her first year.","It had been three years, and her rash temper had become much more stable. She had also removed many of her problems. She just needed to trim some small branches and leaves that were difficult to change and were hidden very deeply."]},{"number":4445,"title":"Chapter 4445: Painstaking","paragraphs":["Xu Wen was smart. She just didn’t use her intelligence well. She also liked to do things on the spur of the moment without caring about the consequences. In the past three years, she had suffered many losses and been punished many times. She had changed many things, but she still made mistakes. The officers and instructors had always had a headache because of her.","This time, he was taking the opportunity to teach her a lesson and let her know that some of her bad habits would not only affect her but also implicate her comrades.","Ye Jian immediately thought of the crux of the matter. Seeing that Xu Wen didn’t understand, she hurriedly reminded her.","The officer looked at Ye Jian and then at Xu Wen, who was still pondering over it. He might as well let the three of them run down together. As long as Xu Wen could understand, her comrades wouldn’t have been punished for nothing today.","His painstaking efforts were not in vain.","One lap was one kilometer. Since it was three laps, it would be three kilometers. Normally, it wouldn’t be a problem to run three kilometers. However, it was a little difficult now. He Jing was almost carried by Ye Jian to complete the three kilometers.","Xu Wen, who was watching from the side, was already crying. How could she not understand? She understood everything.","When they finished running the three kilometers, she cried and ran over to help her comrades who were punished because of her. \"I’m sorry, I’m sorry. I was wrong. I was wrong again... Come, I’ll send you back to the dormitory to rest. I’ll listen to the officer and reflect on myself. I won’t make decisions on my own anymore. I won’t be willful anymore.\"","She cried until her snot and tears flowed down. He Jing, who couldn’t take a step forward anymore, replied weakly, \"Sometimes, I really want to beat you up. I didn’t make any mistakes this semester. But when it was almost over, you caused trouble for Ye Jian and me. Don’t cry anymore. I despise your snot.\"","Although she said that she despised Xu Wen, she leaned toward her.","Just now, she relied on Ye Jian to run three kilometers. Now, she was really tired. She just wanted to collapse. \"I want to lie down. My legs are about to break.\"","\"I’ll carry you, I’ll carry you...\" Xu Wen, whose eyes were swollen from crying, immediately squatted in front of He Jing. Her speed stunned He Jing.","Ye Jian held her arm steadily and smiled. \"Let her carry you.\" Not only did Xu Wen have to recognize her mistake, but she also had to learn to bear with it.","Xu Wen had to learn how to bear responsibility so that she would know more about responsibility. That could allow her to change her bad habits.","\"Ah, this... this isn’t what I want.\"","He Jing was shocked. She didn’t want Xu Wen to carry her. She didn’t expect Ye Jian to really let Xu Wen carry her!","\"Yes, really. She should carry you, just like how we should be punished because of her. Groups are inseparable. Remember that.\"","The words that Xia Jinyuan taught her in the past were taught to her two comrades.","Xu Wen carried He Jing to their usual resting place. The soles of her feet were worn out, but she endured the excruciating pain with every step she took.","Ye Jian was right. They were an inseparable group. Her comrades were punished because of her, so her current pain was nothing.","The instructor who was observing from afar couldn’t help but laugh. Ye Jian... had always done well and knew how to clean up the mess. Next, it was Xu Wen’s turn.","Before the holidays in July, Xu Wen did a huge self-reflection and read her self-reflective essay in class. From this, the students in the class realized that Xu Wen had become more mature in just a day.","In the last ten days before the summer vacation, even the company instructors were amazed by Xu Wen’s astonishing growth. She had undergone another transformation!"]},{"number":4446,"title":"Chapter 4446: Wind Change","paragraphs":["Her growth was brought about by her comrades’ suffering. From then on, Xu Wen never made similar mistakes again. No, it should be said that she never implicated her comrades again because of her.","The summer vacation arrived as promised. The huge campus of the National Science University became much empty. Ye Jian left on the same day as she finished her exam.","The cell phone that had been handed over for the entire semester had been carefully charged by the custodian. When the cell phone was turned on, there was a series of notifications. There were some unfamiliar messages, as well as messages from An Jiaxin. There were also messages from the village leader of Shuikou Village.","The village leader, Zhang Defu, rarely contacted Ye Jian. Ye Jian checked his message first.","There were many words in the message. It was more than 50 words long. The content of the message made Ye Jian’s beautiful face turn exceptionally cold.","[Three times in a row, they came to the village to find out which family had a soldier. They even went around asking about a woman called Red Plum who used to be a soldier more than ten years ago. Only you and your mother were soldiers in the village. When they heard these people asking about your whereabouts, the villagers didn’t say anything. Even the women who usually took advantage of you weren’t tempted by the money these people took out.","[Girl, you’re the most promising person in our village now. You have to work hard for yourself. Don’t provoke some shady people outside. If that happens, you’ll be the one at a disadvantage. Do you understand?","[You have to cherish your achievements. I heard from the young people in the village that big names outside are everywhere. You have to be careful. Don’t provoke big names and harm yourself.]","The village leader was worried that Ye Jian didn’t know that it was him, so he specially left his full name.","It was his youngest son who reminded him. The cell phone was also his son’s cell phone.","Zhang Defu provided a lot of information. Ye Jian stood there for a few minutes before slowly coming back to her senses. She pressed a set of numbers and was about to call when a strange call came in. All the numbers were ’0’.","Within a second of receiving the call, she answered it.","The familiar voice from 12 days ago came from the receiver. The coldness on her face disappeared the moment she heard his voice.","\"Captain Xia.\"","Her voice was clear and refreshing. Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but smile. \"Are you preparing to leave?\"","\"I just got my cell phone. I’m preparing to rush to the airport.\" Ye Jian didn’t stay any longer. She walked quickly toward the school gate.","Many students chose to go home after the exam that day. Hence, there were buses that would go to the train station. As for the airport, there were no arrangements. Ye Jian strode forward and walked past the students one after another. She only used 11 minutes to walk out of the campus.","It took three minutes to get a taxi after walking out of the campus. As the car door closed, Xia Jinyuan heard his woman say to the driver, \"Sir, please go to the airport.\"","\"Okay!\"","The taxi driver with a Xiang City accent smiled and agreed. He stepped on the accelerator and drove towards the airport.","\"I’m in the car. I’ll contact you when I reach.\"","Ye Jian reminded Xia Jinyuan that she had already gotten into the car. There were some things that were not convenient for her to say right now, so she would wait until she was alone to say them.","\"Okay, contact me when you reach. This is a satellite phone. Call my cell phone number directly. The signal might fluctuate, so you might have to call me a few more times. I’ll hang up first.\" Xia Jinyuan didn’t say much. He just reminded her to be careful on the road before cutting communication.","Ye Jian planned to tell Xia Jinyuan when she met him. Someone went to Shuikou Village to ask about the situation. As for Commander Xia... Ye Jian thought for a moment and took out her phone again. She typed a message and sent it to Commander Xia’s personal phone."]},{"number":4447,"title":"Chapter 4447: Abandon","paragraphs":["Commander Xia once told Ye Jian that if there was anything, she had to tell him in time. She mustn’t hide or make any decisions or actions on her own. Sun Xueqing’s matter wasn’t Ye Jian’s alone. Besides her family feud, there was a huge network of connections. If Ye Jian was not careful, she might get herself into trouble.","Ye Jian forwarded all the messages sent by the village leader, Zhang Defu, to Commander Xia’s personal cell phone. While waiting for Commander Xia to reply, Ye Jian tried to call home, but she thought that it might go unanswered.","Without any hope of answering, she heard the old man’s voice from the other end. Ye Jian jumped up from her seat and said in surprise, \"Grandpa, when did you go home?\"","The old man went to the Space Academy laboratory for more than half a year. During this period, Ye Jian tried calling home a few times, but the calls were always unanswered. Even Uncle Fu, who took care of the old man, wasn’t at home. He also went to the Space Academy to prepare the old man’s meals.","Old Master Fu, who had only been back for less than half a month, heard Ye Jian’s voice. He had silver hair and wore presbyopia glasses. He laughed loudly. \"I’ve been home for a while. I learned that my good granddaughter had called home several times. When I came back, I was so anxious. I was afraid that my good granddaughter had something urgent to tell me. Is it the holidays? When do you plan to come home? Call me before you come home. I’ll send a car to fetch you home.\"","The old man missed Ye Jian very much. It had only been less than a month since he came home. Although the old man supported Ye Jian’s work, it didn’t mean that he could endure not seeing Ye Jian for a long time.","As people got older, the only thing they missed was their descendants.","When Ye Jian heard the old man asking her when she would be coming home, she felt so guilty that she didn’t know what to say.","There was no need to explain her pause. To the old man, silence meant an answer.","Although the open-minded old man was disappointed, he expressed his absolute support for his granddaughter’s work. He smiled and comforted Ye Jian. \"Do you feel guilty that you have to go out again and can’t come back to accompany me?","\"Hahaha, my good grandchild, you’re still young. Young people travel around the world. Your great-grandpa and great-grandmother taught me this. I studied abroad at the age of 14 years old and left home for 14 years before returning to my hometown. It’s time for you to study and strive. Learn more and see more. As long as you’re learning, I’ll be happy just waiting at home.\"","The old man was already used to living alone. When he was young, he didn’t accompany Mr. Fu much. After Mr. Fu grew up, Mr. Fu didn’t have time to accompany the old man anymore. Now that his granddaughter was back, she didn’t have time to accompany him either. The three of them were very used to living alone.","Ye Jian regretted not calling home a few more times. If she knew that her grandpa was back, she would have returned to the capital city to accompany the old man for a few days before going to the border for training...","Unfortunately, there was no medicine for regret. Her schedule was set, and her mission couldn’t be changed. Her comrades were all waiting for her to go over. She... had to go over.","\"I’m sorry, Grandpa. I can’t go back to the capital city to accompany you. I’ll definitely come back to accompany you during the seven days of holiday for National Day.\" Ye Jian’s voice was as soft as a mosquito. She lowered her head because of guilt.","\"It’s July now. There’s not much time left until National Day. I’ll wait for you at home. What you need to do is much more meaningful than coming home to accompany me. A country is a home. I understand.\"","The old man, who had dedicated his entire life to the development of the country’s aerospace, could understand this very well. This was the case for the old man himself. Even Mr. Fu, who was groomed by him, was the same. He gave up his small family for everyone."]},{"number":4448,"title":"Chapter 4448: Great Success In The University Entrance Examination","paragraphs":["Through the phone line, the old man could feel how guilty his granddaughter was. His good granddaughter valued love so much that she was probably burying her head in guilt now.","He needed to persuade her. He couldn’t affect her mood because of this.","\"Everything is fine at home. Your father is fine too. Last month, I was at a certain base discussing a few problems with your father. He was in good spirits and didn’t have the time to care about us. Don’t think about him. Let’s see if we can meet at the end of this year.","\"When you’re outside, just take good care of yourself. Don’t care about anything else. Don’t affect your pace because of this. Take every step steadily. No matter how stormy the road is, it won’t shake your progress. Do you understand?","\"Finish your work properly. I will always support you!","The old man didn’t just chat with Ye Jian. From time to time, he would educate Ye Jian how to face the storms of life. He hoped that Ye Jian would be happy and preferred Ye Jian to be strong.","’If you don’t want to cry your entire life, you have to learn to be strong. Only then can you smile and live proudly.’","The two of them chatted from the moment Ye Jian got into the car to the moment Ye Jian got out of the car. They chatted until the electric panel on their cell phones was hot. When the taxi driver collected the money, he couldn’t help but sigh. \"Miss, you and your grandfather sure are chatty people...\"","The driver didn’t know that she hadn’t spoken to her grandpa for more than half a year. How could they finish saying the words they had accumulated for more than half a year in such a brief moment of time?","Ye Jian’s flight was at eight o’clock in the evening. She would transfer to Landi and then fly to the bordering town. The entire journey took about five and a half hours. When she arrived at the bordering town, it would be one o’clock in the morning.","It was only a few minutes past six. Ye Jian couldn’t bear to hang up the phone after chatting for the entire journey. It was only when Uncle Fu reminded the old man that he could have dinner that Ye Jian reluctantly wrapped things up. She also reminded the old man to take care of himself. At the same time, she didn’t forget to chat with Uncle Fu. It was hard on Uncle Fu to take care of the old man.","\"Don’t worry, leave it to me. I’ll definitely take good care of Old Master!\" Uncle Fu patted his chest and guaranteed, making Old Master Fu laugh.","His granddaughter was concerned about his health. How could he not be happy?","The call ended after 56 minutes.","After the call with the old man, the news sent by the village leader, Zhang Defu, didn’t affect Ye Jian’s mood anymore. She looked at her cell phone again and realized that as it turned out, Commander Xia had already replied to her message.","She sent a message. Five minutes later, Commander Xia replied to Ye Jian.","\"The military is already aware of it. Currently, Old Master Li is seriously ill and has been hospitalized to recuperate. Everything in the outside world has been suspended. Those related to the investigation of Martyr Sun Xueqing have also stopped their operations. Train in peace and return early.\"","Old Master Li was seriously ill and couldn’t take care of things anymore. When the people investigating saw that he was sick, they didn’t dare to investigate anymore. They would stop until Old Master Li was discharged.","Ye Jian was even more relieved when she received the message. The reason why the Li family hadn’t fallen until now was all because of Old Master Li. Once Old Master Li fell, the Li family would be in a state of disunity.","The two sons of the first wife were not on good terms with the second wife, nor were they on good terms with their stepsister. Although Second Old Madam Li had some tricks up her sleeve, her power was only limited to the Li family’s mansion.","Once Old Master Li fell, Ye Jian knew that the Li family would be at the end of their rope.","At that moment, Ye Jian called the village leader of Zhang Defu. Although she hadn’t contacted the village leader for a long time, their conversation was still considered harmonious. An elegant and dignified rich lady walked past her with a tall and beautiful young lady. Ye Jian’s military uniform made the rich lady look at her unintentionally. When they walked past each other, the rich lady let out a soft exclamation."]},{"number":4449,"title":"Chapter 4449: Encounter","paragraphs":["There were many people coming and going in the airport. No one would pay attention to anyone. The reason why the rich lady saw Ye Jian at first glance was because Ye Jian was wearing a military uniform. She only glanced at her casually. That was why the rich lady was surprised.","It was a female student who had taken the elevator with her at the military hospital. In the end, she even had a few arguments with her son, Qin Xiu. It was because of these arguments that Qin Xiu went overseas. Until now, he rarely contacted his family.","She didn’t expect to meet the same female student at the airport again.","The rich lady who recognized Ye Jian was none other than Qin Xiu’s mother. Beside her was Du Jiayi, who had been trying her best to become the daughter-in-law of the Qin family.","Du Jiayi heard Mrs. Qin’s surprised exclamation and asked with an intimate smile, \"What’s wrong, Aunt? Did you see Qin Ying?\"","Qin Ying was Qin Xiu’s sister and Mrs. Qin’s daughter. She was a famous photographer who didn’t want to come home after being forced to marry. Whenever she faced Mrs. Qin, she acted as though she was facing a great enemy. Hence, she fled home and went all over the world instead.","Mrs. Qin shook her head. She thought of Qin Xiu, who hadn’t contacted her family for a long time, and said to Du Jiayi, who had accompanied her to the Southern Province, \"Jia Jia, wait for me. I’ll be right back.\"","\"Okay, Aunt. I’ll stand here.\" Du Jiayi nodded. She was obedient, not at all arrogant and dignified. Mrs. Qin couldn’t help but smile.","She knew how good Jiayi was. She could support the family and handle things. The daughter-in-law she liked adored her son so much. As long as the woman had feelings for him, the man would bow down to her sooner or later.","A good man feared a fierce woman. Her son was not a hard-hearted person. As time passed, he would realize how good Jiayi was.","\"Don’t just stand there. That’s tiring. Go to the seating area in front and sit for a while. I’ll be back soon. My daughter is probably looking for us too. Keep an eye out for her.\"","Mrs. Qin was desperate. As she spoke to Du Jiayi, she paid attention to Ye Jian to prevent her from disappearing.","Her actions puzzled Du Jiayi. Why did it seem like Mrs. Qin wanted to avoid letting her see someone or something?","Du Jiayi followed Mrs. Qin’s gaze. When she looked over, Du Jiayi’s back tightened.","She knew Ye Jian, so she recognized her immediately.","Why did she meet Ye Jian here?","Had Mrs. Qin been looking at Ye Jian just now? How did she know Ye Jian? Why was she in such a hurry to look for her?","Was she... mistaken?","Her expression changed slightly. Du Jiayi, who was holding an exquisite small handbag, grabbed the handle of the small handbag with both hands and revealed an impeccable and appropriate smile. Then, she asked Mrs. Qin, \"Aunt, are you... looking for her? The girl in the military uniform?\"","Mrs. Qin’s gaze definitely caught a hint of something amiss. She asked, \"Do you know her?\"","Mrs. Qin was really looking for Ye Jian! Mrs. Qin wanted to meet up with Ye Jian without having her around!","How did Mrs. Qin know Ye Jian?","Du Jiayi’s impeccable smile turned a little stiff. Fortunately, she was standing still. If not, she wouldn’t be able to maintain her composure. \"Yes, I met her a few times, but I’m not familiar with her.","\"Do you know her too?\" she asked again. Her grip on the small handbag tightened, and her knuckles turned white.","This time, it was Mrs. Qin’s turn to be a little shocked. \"You know her too? Which family in the capital city is this girl from?\"","\"She’s not from the capital city, nor is she from a wealthy family. I only know that she came from a small mountain village in the south. She’s from the military school of the National Science University. I heard that she’s quite capable.\"","Du Jiayi knew very well what kind of woman Mrs. Qin liked. First of all, she had to have a good family background. Thus, she decided to expose Ye Jian’s low family background first. As expected, Mrs. Qin frowned slightly.","Obviously, she didn’t like Ye Jian’s family background."]},{"number":4450,"title":"Chapter 4450: Provoke","paragraphs":["She came from a remote mountainous area... How did Qin Xiu know her? Mrs. Qin’s expression was a little ugly.","That day, he denied that it had anything to do with Ye Jian. But how could Mrs. Qin not understand her son?","He looked easy to get along with, but he was actually cold to the core. When had she ever seen him chasing after a woman? He clearly had his own intentions, which was why he lowered his status like this.","In the end, Mrs. Qin learned that Ye Jian came from such a background!","Mrs. Qin, who was also holding a dark blue luxury bag in her hand, held it under her armpit and said calmly, \"I see. No wonder I don’t see her around often.","\"I’ve only seen her once, but Qin Xiu knows her. Their relationship should be quite good. Since you know her, come with me. I want to ask if Qin Xiu has contacted her recently.\"","The poor mountainous areas gave birth to unruly people. Thinking back to what she did to Qin Xiu in the hospital that day... she was really rude!","Du Jiayi thought that Mrs. Qin only knew Ye Jian. Unexpectedly, she heard that Qin Xiu and Ye Jian had a good relationship. At that moment, Du Jiayi felt as if her head had exploded.","Her heart sank in an instant. Waves of coldness rose from the bottom of her feet...","She finally squeezed out a smile with all her might and replied to Mrs. Qin, \"Okay, I’ll accompany you.\"","Ye Jian... Ye Jian actually knew Qin Xiu?","The two of them had a good relationship?","Why... did she never know this? Why had she never heard Qin Xiu mention it? Why didn’t she hear anything?","What scheme did ye Jian use to get close to Qin Xiu? They even had a good relationship!","Xia Jinyuan, Li Jinnian, Qin Xiu... Ye Jian knew all the outstanding young masters in the capital city?","Hah!","In order to climb up the social ladder, Ye Jian really... racked her brains!","Du Jiayi felt threatened in an instant. Her intuition told her that Ye Jian and Qin Xiu’s relationship was not ordinary.","That was because Qin Xiu didn’t take the initiative to befriend any woman. He had never had a good relationship with any woman in his work or life. He always kept a distance from them. He was cold and polite, never getting close to any woman.","Now, even his mother knew that he had a good relationship with Ye Jian.","A mother knew her son best. Mrs. Qin definitely knew something that she didn’t. Otherwise, why would she specially look for Ye Jian to ask if Qin Xiu had contacted her recently?","Qin Xiu didn’t even contact her, Du Jiayi!","Du Jiayi, who was burning with jealousy, even walked stiffly. It was not easy for her to maintain a dignified smile. It was really impossible for her to maintain her composure in all aspects.","The figure in military uniform in front of them had her back facing them. She seemed to be smiling. From her back view, they could tell that she was very relaxed. She seemed to be very happy to chat with the person on the other side of the cell phone.","Who was the person she was chatting with?","Qin Xiu?","Du Jiayi, who couldn’t help but think too much, got closer and closer to Ye Jian. Her gaze on Ye Jian’s back became colder and colder. Mrs. Qin only paid attention to Ye Jian and didn’t notice how gloomy her future daughter-in-law’s expression was.","Ye Jian turned around. She had no choice but to turn around. The hostility in Du Jiayi’s gaze was as deep as a knife. If she didn’t turn around, she was really worried that she would be stabbed by a real knife.","She turned around and saw the two people walking toward her. She frowned slightly.","Why did she meet Qin Xiu’s mother and Du Jiayi at the airport? And why were they walking straight toward her?","Ye Jian looked around. After confirming that they were really walking toward her, she continued walking. She didn’t want to interact with them."]},{"number":4451,"title":"Chapter 4451: Robbed","paragraphs":["Ye Jian wasn’t unfamiliar with Mrs. Qin. Of course, she would have a deep impression of Mrs. Qin when she was sized up by her like she was merchandise when they hadn’t even spoken a word to each other.","That night, something happened to Uncle Chen and Mrs. Qin suddenly appeared. Ye Jian, who had never forgotten that night, would never forget Mrs. Qin.","If Mrs. Qin hadn’t appeared, Ye Jian definitely wouldn’t have remembered Mrs. Qin’s gaze at that time. Now that she had appeared, there was even a deeper look of contempt in her eyes. If Ye Jian continued standing here and waited for them to come over, she’d be a fool.","She turned around and left, leaving behind the two people who were walking over.","When Mrs. Qin saw this, her expression changed. The contempt she tried her best to hide flashed past her eyes.","It wasn’t that she looked down on people from the mountains. No matter how good they were, they lacked manners! She thought that this military school student would be different, but the result was still the same.","She clearly saw them coming over, but she still turned around and left. She really didn’t have any manners.","Although Du Jiayi kept staring at Ye Jian, the corners of her eyes never left Mrs. Qin’s face. She had always known how to read people’s expressions and how to coax the elders. Seeing the contempt on Mrs. Qin’s face, Du Jiayi heaved a sigh of relief.","The current Qin family was no longer helmed by Old Madam Qin. It was Mrs. Qin. As long as Mrs. Qin didn’t like Ye Jian, even if Qin Xiu liked Ye Jian... their relationship was destined to be impossible!","However, Ye Jian was a little devious. Every time Du Jiayi saw her, she felt that Ye Jian was a threat that would hinder her.","Her intuition was right. Wasn’t Ye Jian a threat now?!","Qin Xiu liked Ye Jian?","Good, very good!","Since Qin Xiu liked Ye Jian so much, Du Jiayi would let Mrs. Qin hate Ye Jian just as much. She wanted to see what other tricks Ye Jian had up her sleeve.","Ye Jian’s cold actions were exactly what Du Jiayi wanted, especially since she knew that Mrs. Qin hated Ye Jian. Du Jiayi’s expression and actions were finally no longer stiff. In the blink of an eye, she returned to being dignified.","She raised her voice, but it was neither loud nor soft. There was a hint of surprise in it. Anyone who heard it could tell that this lady had accidentally met someone she knew and was very happy.","\"Ye Jian... Ye Jian... Ye Jian... Wait...\"","She called out ’Ye Jian’ three times in a row. It could be seen how eager and surprised the lady was. At least, that was what a few tourists who passed by thought.","Du Jiayi was beautiful to begin with. She had elegant eyebrows and crescent eyes. She was wearing a plain silk dress and a pair of stilettos. Her every move was elegant and pleasing to the eye. Sometimes, people would unintentionally glance at her.","Such a beautiful and elegant woman had become a beautiful scenery.","Her anxious and surprised voice didn’t stop Ye Jian from moving forward. The airport broadcast sounded and reminded the passengers to board the plane. Ye Jian, who needed to check in, was stopped by a middle-aged woman. She reminded her kindly, \"Miss, your friend is looking for you...\"","Ye Jian was speechless.","The kind-hearted woman’s enthusiasm made Ye Jian helpless.","\"Ye Jian, Ye Jian...\"","Du Jiayi’s pursuit came again. Ye Jian, who was stopped, was reminded by the enthusiastic middle-aged woman. \"It’s really your friend who’s calling out to you. Look back.\"","Ye Jian really didn’t want to turn around, so she smiled and said, \"I understand. Thank you, Miss.\"","\"You’re welcome. No wonder you two are friends. Both of you are really good-looking.\" The middle-aged woman didn’t see Ye Jian’s resignation and thought that she had done a good thing."]},{"number":4452,"title":"Chapter 4452: Acting","paragraphs":["At this moment, Ye Jian’s mood was... calm. The woman was too enthusiastic, and Ye Jian couldn’t handle it. Du Jiayi and Mrs. Qin caught up to her.","\"I finally caught up to you. Fortunately, I didn’t make a mistake. Otherwise, I would’ve been embarrassed.\"","Du Jiayi spoke to Ye Jian in a relaxed and familiar tone. Of course, she was just putting on an act for Mrs. Qin. No matter how much she disliked Ye Jian, she had to be polite in front of Mrs. Qin.","Ye Jian, who had met Du Jiayi many times, knew her tricks. Hearing that, she smiled faintly and said, \"If I had continued walking, it would’ve indeed been embarrassing.\"","As usual, she didn’t show Du Jiayi any courtesy. After she finished speaking, Ye Jian saw that the smile on Du Jiayi’s face had turned a little stiff. Her hands, which were holding the handle of her exquisite small handbag, were so tight that the green veins on the back of her hands could be seen.","They clearly hated each other, but Du Jiayi still wanted to show a harmonious relationship. Ye Jian felt that she was not competent enough to do what Du Jiayi was doing.","\"That’s why I’m glad you heard me. Long time no see, Ye Jian.\"","Du Jiayi, who had a stiff smile on her face, would not embarrass herself. She took the initiative to extend a hand to Ye Jian in what she thought was a friendly gesture and looked at Ye Jian with a hint of anticipation.","What was she looking forward to?","She hoped that Ye Jian wouldn’t give her any respect. Then, Mrs. Qin would say that Ye Jian was so rude she wouldn’t even shake hands with others.","It wasn’t that Ye Jian didn’t know how to be two-sided. She just didn’t like it.","Since that was the case, Ye Jian smiled and reached out her hand naturally. She didn’t follow the script Du Jiayi set and said politely, \"Long time no see.\"","They weren’t close, but she wouldn’t let the other party embarrass her. She wouldn’t sit still and let the other party scheme against her.","When they shook hands, Ye Jian deliberately exerted more strength. Du Jiayi, who thought that Ye Jian would definitely be rude, was shocked...","She hated Ye Jian to begin with, so she didn’t actually want to shake hands with Ye Jian. She thought that Ye Jian hated her too and wouldn’t really shake hands with her. In the end... The moment they shook hands, Du Jiayi instinctively wanted to retract her hand. Unexpectedly, Ye Jian grabbed it quickly and held it tightly.","In the end, Du Jiayi was the one who failed.","Her expression changed drastically. The reaction in her brain was reflected in her actions. She acted as though she had been electrocuted when she made contact with Ye Jian’s hand, allowing Mrs. Qin to see it clearly.","\"I’m sorry, my hands are sweaty...\" After Du Jiayi shook her hands. She knew that she had made a mistake and immediately apologized to Ye Jian. To prove that her hands were really sweaty, she quickly took out a tissue from her bag and handed it to Ye Jian. \"I walked too quickly just now and was in a hurry. I got my sweat on your hand, right? Hurry up and wipe it.\"","Ye Jian did not take the tissue. She smiled at Du Jiayi, who was trying to salvage the situation, and said, \"You can use it. I’m fine.\"","Mrs. Qin paid attention to her future daughter-in-law’s every move. Her expression softened. She smiled at Ye Jian and said gently, \"Hello, Ye Jian. I’m Qin Xiu’s mother. We met once in the hospital. Do you still remember me?\"","Ye Jian’s impression of her was too deep. She wouldn’t be able to forget about her, but she couldn’t say that out loud.","Shaking her head, she said, \"I’m sorry, I don’t remember.\"","\"It’s alright. That day, I didn’t manage to chat with you. Ye Jian, don’t be nervous. I have no other intentions. I happened to meet you today and know that you have a good relationship with Qin Xiu. Can you tell me how Qin Xiu is doing recently?\"","The older, the wiser. Although Mrs. Qin looked down on Ye Jian’s background, she didn’t show it. Her facial expressions were very gentle."]},{"number":4453,"title":"Chapter 4453: We’re Really Not Close","paragraphs":["Mrs. Qin felt that she was very gentle and polite. She also felt that there was nothing wrong with what she said. As an elder, she wasn’t rude.","That was what she thought.","Ye Jian was stunned.","After a while, she said politely, \"Madam Qin, I’m sorry. First, I need to clarify something. I’m not familiar with Ambassador Qin. You’ve misunderstood.","\"Since I’m not familiar with Ambassador Qin, I can’t answer your question about how Ambassador Qin has been recently. I’m sorry, but I need to check in. Goodbye.\"","Ye Jian left immediately. She picked up her camouflage duffel bag and left.","At the entrance of the airport lobby, a woman wearing a gray and white striped casual suit with healthy skin and extremely eye-catching facial features aimed the camera in her hand at a figure decked in green among the crowd. She quickly pressed the shutter.","Ye Jian turned around and left. She didn’t know that her back view had been captured by a photographer.","Her swift and decisive demeanor stunned Mrs. Qin right on the heels. When she reacted, Ye Jian had already walked a few steps away. Mrs. Qin was a little anxious and chased after her. \"Ye Jian, wait a moment. I want to ask you something else.\"","Obviously, Mrs. Qin didn’t believe what Ye Jian said. She thought that Ye Jian was just patronizing her.","Du Jiayi didn’t believe it either. If it was just like what Ye Jian said, that she wasn’t familiar with Qin Xiu, why would Mrs. Qin want to ask Ye Jian about Qin Xiu?","That was right. Ye Jian said that they weren’t familiar with each other, not that they didn’t know each other. The difference between the two was huge. Even though they weren’t familiar with each other, they still knew each other! Since they knew each other, with Qin Xiu’s personality, he must have interacted with Ye Jian differently.","What kind of interaction would make Mrs. Qin think that Qin Xiu had a good relationship with Ye Jian?","Du Jiayi, who was also meticulous, seemed to figure things out. The terrifying thing was that her theory was correct. Ye Jian and Qin Xiu did know each other and had interacted with each other before.","What kind of extraordinary interaction did Ye Jian and Qin Xiu have?","Du Jiayi felt that she needed to know urgently. That way, she could solve the problem at its roots and not let Ye Jian have an opportunity.","Now, she was certain that Ye Jian, who came from a small mountain village, was seducing the noble young masters in the capital city with her goal of becoming successful!","Li Jinnian, Xia Jinyuan, Qin Xiu... They were all young masters from wealthy families!","No matter how much she disliked Li Jinnian, she had to admit that many wealthy families in the capital city treated Li Jinnian as an eligible bachelor!","No matter how bad Li Jinnian’s relationship with the Li family was, he still had the golden surname!","Mrs. Qin chased after Ye Jian. Du Jiayi gritted her teeth secretly. There were still dark clouds in her eyes. Her dignified and smiling face was stiff as she chased after Mrs. Qin. She said with concern, \"Aunt, slow down. The airport...\"","Just as she was about to remind Mrs. Qin, who was also wearing high heels, to be careful of the slippery floor of the airport, Mrs. Qin slipped and staggered. She fell onto the smooth and hard tiled floor.","She was so shocked that she cried out in pain. The passengers passing by were so frightened that they took a few steps back.","Mrs. Qin, who had always cared about her image outside, took a fall in front of everyone. She screamed in shock and fell to the ground. It was painful and embarrassing. She was so frustrated, but she had nowhere to hide.","However, she was able to stabilize herself. Even though she had fallen, she wouldn’t let herself get into a more embarrassing state. No matter how painful it was, she had to tidy herself up and try her best not to embarrass herself further."]},{"number":4454,"title":"Chapter 4454: A Heroic Woman","paragraphs":["Du Jiayi was the one who was really worried about Mrs. Qin’s fall. Du Jiayi’s face turned pale. She couldn’t care less about her thin high heels and hurriedly ran over to help Mrs. Qin. \"Aunt, are you alright? Are you alright?\"","Realizing that she couldn’t stand up on her own, Mrs. Qin held Du Jiayi’s hand and wanted to stand up. Someone on her right came over with a faint smell of perfume and held Mrs. Qin firmly.","Ye Jian, who was about to help Mrs. Qin up, saw this and glanced at the face of the woman who was holding Mrs. Qin. Her features were similar to Qin Xiu’s.","The woman was very similar to Qin Xiu. She had short hair, and she only wore an earring on one side of her ear.","There was also a nimble and heroic spirit on her. She was wearing a women’s casual suit with grayish-white stripes. Even though she was squatting down right now, one could tell that she was a slender woman.","There was a camera with a professional lens beside her feet. It looked like it was expensive. She had casually placed such an expensive camera on the ground. With a frown on her face, she placed all her attention on Mrs. Qin.","Since she resembled Qin Xiu, Ye Jian figured there was no need for her to go over and help Mrs. Qin. Seeing that she had nothing to do, Ye Jian quickly disappeared into the crowd with her luggage.","Mrs. Qin, who was trying her best to maintain her image, was overjoyed. She turned her head and looked at the woman who had walked over.","The first thing she saw was her tanned skin. Before the joy on Mrs. Qin’s face could completely surface, her expression went back to its original coldness.","\"Mom, how many times have I reminded you to stop wearing high heels now that you’re old? You were even chasing after someone. Do you still think you’re young? Did you hurt yourself badly?\"","The person who came was only concerned about whether her mother had fallen or not. She didn’t pay much attention to the change in Mrs. Qin’s expression.","Du Jiayi recognized the woman who was holding Mrs. Qin. She was Qin Xiu’s biological sister, the famous photographer, Qin Ying. She was a woman who lived like a man. No one could tell that she was a noblewoman.","That was true. A woman who ran around with a pile of camera equipment every day wouldn’t have the image of a rich lady. She ran around all day and didn’t have the time to care about her image.","\"Miss Qin Ying, you’re here.\"","Du Jiayi said happily. Then, she said nervously, \"Miss Qin Ying, let’s quickly help Aunt to the side. I think Aunt is in pain. Let’s send her to the hospital for a check just to be safe.\"","Qin Ying brushed her hair away from her forehead and looked up at the young woman who was speaking. She was fair-skinned, beautiful, and elegant. She spoke naturally too. There was no such cousin among her relatives. That meant that...","\"Mom, you’re really amazing. You brought your daughter-in-law candidate to Grandpa’s birthday. Aren’t you afraid of angering Qin Xiu so much that he’ll sever his mother-son relationship with you?\"","As soon as Qin Ying opened her mouth, Mrs. Qin was so angry that her hands trembled. It was said that daughters were more worrisome than sons, but when it came to Qin Ying...","\"If you continue, I’ll cut off our mother-daughter relationship first!\"","Mrs. Qin glared at her daughter. Only her unfilial daughter would dare to talk to her like this. The moment she opened her mouth, she would anger her until she had to be sent to the hospital.","Qin Ying wasn’t afraid. She replied, \"Thank you in advance, then!\"","\"You!\" Mrs. Qin, who was angered again, turned ashen. She took a deep breath and turned to Du Jiayi with a bitter smile. \"I’m just old. There’s no big issue. I’ll be fine after resting for a while. Help me over...\""]},{"number":4455,"title":"Chapter 4455: Ha, Don’t Know Her","paragraphs":["Mrs. Qin, who refused to communicate with her biological daughter, looked up as she spoke... Mrs. Qin swallowed her unfinished words. Actually, there was no need to help her over. The person she was looking for had already disappeared.","That meant that Ye Jian didn’t look back when she fell just now.","Really...","Mrs. Qin closed her eyes and held the side of her waist that was in pain with one hand. She sighed and said, \"Help me sit back down. Then, make a call and check if the luggage has been received.\"","Du Jiayi was a little embarrassed. She knew that Mrs. Qin and her daughter, Qin Ying, didn’t get along, but she didn’t expect them to be at odds with each other. They even talked about severing their relationship in front of her.","After the awkwardness, Du Jiayi was overjoyed. Could it be that Mrs. Qin no longer treated her as an outsider?","Qin Ying really wanted to leave her mother alone. Her mother had a terrible temper, and she was the only one who thought she had a good personality. Qin Ying simply didn’t say anything and picked up the camera with one hand while helping Mrs. Qin up with the other.","Mrs. Qin had embarrassed herself thoroughly today. She had never been in such a sorry state.","Ye Jian...","Earlier, she thought that if her son really liked Ye Jian, she would try to put aside Ye Jian’s family background and judge her character. If Ye Jian was really a good girl, she would grit her teeth and agree to their relationship since Qin Xiu really liked her.","Although Ye Jian came from a bad background, she was still a military school student. If the Qin family supported her, she would still be able to make a name for herself.","At this moment, Mrs. Qin no longer had those thoughts.","Good character?","There was no need to look at Ye Jian’s character in detail, let alone think about it secretly. After what happened today, Ye Jian was completely out of her consideration as her future daughter-in-law.","Qin Ying, who was carrying a camera on one shoulder, looked around and didn’t find anything. She said to Mrs. Qin’s favorite daughter-in-law candidate, \"Take this madam to rest first. What’s your cell phone number? I’ll drive the car over. You can help the madam out later. I’m sorry to trouble you.\"","Referring to Mrs. Qin as ’madam’ was completely derogatory.","\"Ah, it’s not troublesome. It’s just what I should do.\"","Du Jiayi replied with a smile. She knew that Qin Ying and Mrs. Qin’s relationship was very tense, but she also knew that Qin Ying and Qin Xiu had a good relationship. She didn’t just need Mrs. Qin’s approval. She needed the approval of the entire Qin family.","This time, Qin Ying was one of the targets she needed to take down when she came to the Southern Province.","Qin Ying sized up this young lady who had become her mother’s ideal daughter. She smiled politely and helped Mrs. Qin sit down. \"Rest for a while. If you have anything to say, we can talk in the car.\"","Mrs. Qin snorted softly as an answer. Du Jiayi smiled at Qin Ying apologetically and explained considerately, \"Miss Qin Ying, Aunt encountered something just now. She might not be in a good mood. Don’t worry.\"","’Excuse me... who are you?’","In the face of Du Jiayi’s thoughtful explanation, Qin Ying had a huge question in her heart. Out of consideration for Mrs. Qin, though, Qin Ying did not ask. She just smiled.","This woman was more like Mrs. Qin’s biological daughter than Qin Ying herself. No wonder the madam liked her so much.","What was the use of Mrs. Qin being satisfied with this woman, though? Qin Xiu’s satisfaction and happiness were what mattered most. She wanted to tell Du Jiayi that she shouldn’t dream about getting together with Qin Xiu. Qin Xiu wouldn’t like her weak and small body!","What was Qin Xiu’s ideal type?","Five minutes ago, she took a photo of someone like that!","It was the lady that was being chased by ’the madam’. She was the kind that Qin Xiu liked. He liked her very much!","Since the lady in front of her claimed to be the future daughter-in-law, Qin Ying felt that with her kind and magnanimous nature, she shouldn’t ruin the other party’s dream. Hence, she didn’t want to be brutally honest on behalf of her younger brother, Qin Xiu."]},{"number":4456,"title":"Chapter 4456: This Woman Is So Cool","paragraphs":["Qin Ying carried her camera and turned to leave. Even her back view as she walked was quite cool. Her capable and elegant attire was also eye-catching.","She was 1.72 meters tall and had a good figure and good looks. The camera on her back was thicker than a man’s arm. It was indeed a sight to behold.","Mrs. Qin, who was angered by her biological daughter, was in an even worse mood now. Thinking about how Ye Jian didn’t come back to help her when she fell, Mrs. Qin felt even more stifled. Du Jiayi, who was accompanying her, became even more cautious.","She wasn’t Sun Ying. She wouldn’t be timid because she was afraid of offending others. Even though she knew that Mrs. Qin wasn’t in a good mood, she wouldn’t deliberately curry favor.","Her surname was Du, and her father was the staff officer. Her biological mother came from the Li family in the capital city, and her status was not bad. There was no need to please anyone, not even Mrs. Qin.","She was able to act appropriately, handle matters generously, and remain calm. This was enough to make Mrs. Qin like her.","This was what Madam Li had taught Du Jiayi. It had to be said that it was very useful. Until now, Mrs. Qin liked Du Jiayi’s generosity and composure the most.","\"Jia Jia, tell me about Ye Jian’s situation. To be honest, I suspect that Qin Xiu likes Ye Jian. However, Ye Jian clearly didn’t want to talk about Qin Xiu and didn’t want to interact with me. Can you analyze it and let me know if you think she has a good impression of Qin Xiu?\"","After saying that, Mrs. Qin looked at Du Jiayi with a sharp gaze and a scrutinizing smile.","This was her test.","Du Jiayi, who had impeccable etiquette, felt a chill in her heart. Soon, she lowered her head and thought for a while. When she looked up again, she just stated the facts. She was not disturbed by Mrs. Qin’s words.","\"Your question stumps me. I know Qin Xiu very well. He’s a cautious person. As for Ye Jian, as I’ve told you before, I’m not familiar with her.","\"The reason why I know her is because she knows Little Six, Xia Jinyuan, and my cousin, Li Jinnian. I’m surprised that she knows Xia Jinyuan and my cousin, Li Jinnian, with her identity.","\"Logically speaking, it’s impossible for her to know them. Their families are different, and their social circles are different, so how can she know them?\"","\"I’m not afraid of you saying that I’m too careless with my words. I don’t have a good impression of Ye Jian. I always think she’s too gorgeous and cold. But I realize she acts completely differently in front of Xia Jinyuan and my cousin. In front of them, she’s gentle, well-educated, and polite. It’s easy to have a good impression of her.","\"If you ask me if she has a good impression of Qin Xiu... I think it’s hard to answer.\"","Mrs. Qin was very satisfied with her future daughter-in-law’s reaction. She didn’t panic just because she deliberately emphasized that she suspected that Qin Xiu liked Ye Jian. Instead, Du Jiayi really thought about the problem carefully.","It was inevitable for men to be flirtatious when they were outside, and even her husband was no exception. When men were socializing, they would always meet shameless women who would take the initiative to throw themselves at the men. If the main wife of the family did not stabilize herself, she would only upset the man who was doing big things, and his career would be affected.","A woman’s priority was to run her family. If she couldn’t even manage her family and man properly, what was the use of marrying such a woman?","On the other hand, Ye Jian seemed to have some ability. It was obvious that Jia Jia didn’t like her.","A woman who climbed up the ladder meant that she was ambitious. It didn’t matter if she was ambitious. As long as she had a good path and could set her ambitions and quickly complete her goals, that kind of woman was worth admiring.","She came from a small village and met young masters from the capital city who were from a completely different circle. Mrs. Qin felt that it was not just because Ye Jian was beautiful."]},{"number":4457,"title":"Chapter 4457: Shoot Yourself In The Foot","paragraphs":["Mrs. Qin’s position was firm in the Qin family. In the past, Old Madam Qin, who was extremely picky, chose her as her daughter-in-law. Mrs. Qin’s methods and strategies were extraordinary. She didn’t have a good impression of Ye Jian because of her background and even looked down on it.","She didn’t like Ye Jian’s character either. She had always acknowledged that unruly people came from poor mountainous areas. Hence, everything Ye Jian did could be attributed to her lowly background. She couldn’t be magnanimous.","After Jia Jia said that, although her words contained malice, it made Mrs. Qin change her opinion of Ye Jian.","If Du Jiayi knew that her words had changed Mrs. Qin’s impression of Ye Jian, she would be so angry that she would vomit blood on the spot.","Why did Mrs. Qin change her opinion of Ye Jian because of her words?","It was mainly because of the three people Du Jiayi mentioned.","Little Six of the Xia family was Old Master Xia’s grandson and Commander Xia’s only son. He had seen all kinds of women! As long as he bent his finger, he could have any woman he wanted.","Li Jinnian was the eldest grandson of the Li family and had always been ruthless. He had been in the military for a long time and almost never returned home. He had never relied on his family’s power. Such a man must have a firm temperament. He would not lose his basic judgment just because of a beautiful woman.","Qin Xiu was her son. She knew his character very well. Even Du Jiayi, who was talented, beautiful, and capable, wasn’t liked by him. Why did he chase after Ye Jian alone?","Three men expressed their goodwill toward Ye Jian, who came from a small mountain village. They were even willing to make friends with her. What did this mean?","This meant that Ye Jian was not bad. She had the ability to attract three outstanding men.","As for charm... With Mrs. Qin’s many years of experience, she couldn’t see any charm in Ye Jian for the time being. From a mother-in-law’s point of view, she didn’t like this kind of woman.","She might not, but the young men sure did... Mrs. Qin smiled and raised her hand to pat the back of Du Jiayi’s hand lightly. She smiled and said, \"Alright, let’s not talk about her anymore. Let’s talk about Qin Ying. I can’t do anything about her.\"","The change of topic made it impossible for Du Jiayi to tell if she had succeeded in defaming Ye Jian. She couldn’t tell what Mrs. Qin was thinking at all.","It looked like she needed to ask her mother, who was far away in the capital city, for advice later.","Du Jiayi stopped surrounding Ye Jian and chatted with Mrs. Qin about Qin Ying. Mrs. Qin was the same as Madam Li. She didn’t mind saying that her daughter was bad, but she would never allow others to criticize her daughter.","Du Jiayi understood. Even if Mrs. Qin complained about Qin Ying, she still secretly thought Qin Ying was good.","Hence, Qin Ying saw a smile on Mrs. Qin’s face when she got into the car. She couldn’t help but take a few more glances at Du Jiayi, who thought of herself as Mrs. Qin’s future daughter-in-law. She said, \"She’s very beautiful. I’ll give you a few more copies of the photo the day after tomorrow.\"","\"Qin Ying! Jiayi is a guest!\" Mrs. Qin’s smile disappeared once her biological daughter spoke. \"Just focus on driving. If you say anything else, I’ll get out of the car with Jiayi immediately!\"","...","Fine, she wouldn’t say anything.","Qin Ying shrugged her shoulders, indicating that she didn’t mind.","The madam was indeed the madam. She was delicate and domineering. As her daughter, Qin Ying would give in if she could. If she really couldn’t... She would bring her camera with her and fly far, far away to find the man she liked!","Qin Ying had fallen in love with a man and had a photo of him. She searched for him for five years but to no avail.","She had set a goal for five years. If she couldn’t find this man within five years, she would give up. Soon, the deadline she set for herself arrived. She thought for a moment and changed it to ten years.","If she couldn’t find that man within ten years, she would give up."]},{"number":4458,"title":"Chapter 4458: Each With Their Own Thoughts","paragraphs":["Qin Ying, who was the driver, didn’t join in the conversation between Mrs. Qin and Du Jiayi. Since Mrs. Qin didn’t like her speaking, she wouldn’t. Anyway, the mother and daughter didn’t have anything in common. If they opened their mouths, they would definitely argue. It was better to let each other be and feel at ease.","It was rare for the mother and daughter to come to an agreement.","Although Qin Ying didn’t say anything, it didn’t mean that she wasn’t paying attention to the conversation between the two of them. After listening carefully and thinking about it carefully, she understood why Mrs. Qin liked this Miss Du.","Miss Du was good at talking. She didn’t just coax Mrs. Qin with humility and obedience. She had her own unique opinions. Sometimes, if Mrs. Qin’s words were biased, Miss Du would even smile and express her opinions. Not only was Mrs. Qin not angry, but she was even happier.","Her voice was neither high nor low, neither servile nor overbearing. Her words and actions were natural, dignified, and imposing. It had to be said that Du Jiayi was eloquent and good at figuring out people’s hearts.","She was good with words and tricks. Her actions were dignified and elegant. In addition, her skin was fair and beautiful... Qin Ying looked at her own tanned skin and smiled.","\"The Southern Province is filled with beautiful mountains and rivers. I know a few women from the Southern Province. They’re all beautiful and outstanding. If you don’t mind us young people being noisy, I’ll call them over to accompany you another day.","\"But I’ll have to give you a reminder. They’re all like me. If they offend you, you can’t take it to heart. You have to forgive us.","\"You can criticize us and correct us, but don’t be angry at us.\" Du Jiayi pouted and hugged Mrs. Qin’s arm intimately. She looked more like Mrs. Qin’s biological daughter than Qin Ying.","They talked about the Southern Province and then about Mrs. Qin when she was young. Du Jiayi quietly flattered Mrs. Qin, who was from the Southern Province. Then, she quietly mentioned that she knew a few women from the Southern Province. She said that they were all like her.","If Mrs. Qin was interested, she could generously introduce them to her. She wasn’t afraid that Mrs. Qin would choose a few candidates from these women.","These words shouldn’t be taken at face value. They showed Du Jiayi’s character and way of doing things. It satisfied Mrs. Qin.","\"It’s a good thing that you’re magnanimous, but sometimes, you have to plan for yourself. When you reach the Southern Province, you don’t have to accompany me all the time. It’s good to hang out with your good friends. Some friends can be good friends for life, while others can just be acquaintances. It’s all part of socializing.\"","Mrs. Qin even gave Du Jiayi advice. It couldn’t be helped. It was all because Qin Ying didn’t like listening to her.","However, even if Qin Ying didn’t like it, they were still in the same car. How could she not listen?","Why was Mrs. Qin giving advice to Du Jiayi?","Wasn’t it because Qin Ying was in the car?","Teaching Du Jiayi made Du Jiayi happy. At the same time, she could teach her own daughter. Mrs. Qin was killing two birds with one stone.","Du Jiayi expressed that she had learned something. Her expression was serious and solemn, causing the smile on Mrs. Qin’s face to deepen. Then, she looked at her daughter who was driving from the corners of her eyes. A trace of darkness flashed past Mrs. Qin’s eyes.","A daughter-in-law was still a daughter-in-law. No matter how considerate she was, she was not a biological daughter. No matter how disobedient Qin Ying was, she was still Mrs. Qin’s flesh and blood. Mrs. Qin had no choice but to interfere!","A dark look flashed past Mrs. Qin’s eyes. She remembered what she heard half a month ago.","\"Aunt, I know why Qin Ying is afraid of getting married. It’s because she has a man she likes. I’m not lying to you. When the time comes, ask Qin Ying if she has a photo of him on her. Does she take it out to take a look from time to time?\""]},{"number":4459,"title":"Chapter 4459: Blossoms","paragraphs":["Half a month ago, her uncle’s illegitimate son, Qin Yi, begged her for a favor. Seeing that he was an honest man and the favor he was asking for wasn’t illegal, she sent someone to settle the matter for him. After that, he was grateful and repaid her.","When she heard that, she calmed down for a while before she lost her composure.","\"I didn’t care at that time. I just took a casual look. He was wearing a camouflage uniform, and half of his face was covered in blood. It was scary. Just ask me anything you want to know. I promise that every word I say is true!\"","As a mother, she finally knew that her daughter refused to get married not because she was afraid of marriage but because she had someone in her heart!","If there was someone in her heart, why did she hide it from Mrs. Qin?","Since Qin Ying was hiding it from her, it meant that the person in Qin Ying’s heart wasn’t someone Mrs. Qin would be satisfied with as her son-in-law. It could even be said that as long as Qin Ying dared to mention it, Mrs. Qin would definitely be furious.","After Qin Yi finished speaking, a chill ran down Mrs. Qin’s spine. She even caught a cold. She received such a huge scare from Qin Yi’s words that she fell ill.","Besides going back to the Southern Province to celebrate the old master’s birthday, another important thing on her agenda was to find out who Qin Ying liked that made her not return home for a few years and made her not want to interact with other men.","Camouflage uniform, half of his face was covered with blood... The more Mrs. Qin thought about it, the more frightened she felt. After more than half a month, she still didn’t know what to do.","Her daughter was harder to discipline than her son. How could she ask Qin Ying about this matter?","Mrs. Qin’s eyes were dark. Her heart turned cold. She had to ask even if she couldn’t. She wouldn’t allow a man from a remote village to deceive Qin Ying.","Putting everything aside, Mrs. Qin was also a mother who always thought for her children. Unfortunately, she had too many self-conceptions and couldn’t allow her children to go against her.","Her daughter was getting further and further away from her. As for her son, if things continued developing like this, he would get further and further away from her too. Hence, she had to find a daughter-in-law candidate who suited her and make her son like her.","Du Jiayi had already received Madam Li’s advice. Thus far, Mrs. Qin was the most satisfied with her. Otherwise, Mrs. Qin wouldn’t have brought her to the Southern Province to attend Qin Xiu’s grandfather’s birthday banquet.","In the back row, the two of them chatted in detail. There were so many topics between them that they could probably talk until dawn. Qin Ying watched as her mother set a trap for Du Jiayi, and Du Jiayi came out of the trap reasonably. Qin Ying, who was amazed, watched coldly from the side.","The madam liked fair-skinned and beautiful women the most. Qin Ying was outside every day, and her skin was tanned. The madam didn’t need to speak. With just a glance at Qin Ying’s tanned skin, her disgust was evident.","Miss Du was quite good at coaxing people.","Unfortunately, she was just coaxing Mrs. Qin. There was no way Du Jiayi could win over Qin Xiu. It had been two or three years, but she still didn’t understand what kind of woman Qin Xiu liked. She wanted Qin Xiu, but she kept coaxing Mrs. Qin. Even if she were to receive a lot of advice, it would be useless.","Even Qin Ying didn’t like this kind of personality. Du Jiayi looked natural and unrestrained, but she was actually scheming against others. How could Qin Xiu like someone like her?","Sometimes, it was not good to be too smart. If one were too smart, one would think that there was nothing one couldn’t do and no one one couldn’t get.","The bright and beautiful lady was destined to fight to the death for Qin Xiu.","As she thought about it, Qin Ying simply turned on the radio and listened to music. She didn’t know which country the song was from, but the pitch was so high that Mrs. Qin’s cerebral cortex tightened. She scolded, \"Turn it off, Qin Ying!\""]},{"number":4460,"title":"Chapter 4460: Big Mistake","paragraphs":["...","Look, was it Qin Ying’s fault that she wasn’t close to Mrs. Qin?","In her mother’s eyes, everything she did was wrong. How could she get close to her?","They couldn’t get close.","Hence, tomorrow, she would beg her relatives and friends to stop persuading her. She was afraid that she wouldn’t be able to control herself and would leave with her luggage. If she really wanted to escape, she had to think about which route she should take.","Qin Ying’s personality was like Old Master Qin’s. Among his grandchildren, Old Master Qin liked her the most. She was magnanimous and elegant. She would never give up on the things she liked to do. Hence, she would not give up on the person she liked either.","She was still thinking about where she should escape to next. She didn’t know that Qin Yi, who unintentionally found out that there was someone in her heart, had sold her information to Mrs. Qin.","The night sky was filled with lights, and the city was filled with luxurious scenery. Some people started to get drunk while others began their suffering. Ye Jian closed her eyes as she sat on the plane. Next, what awaited her was the 30 days of suffering.","It took about two and a half hours to fly from Xiang City to Landi. Ye Jian had yet to reach Qingdi. Du Jiayi, who was staying at Hotel Caesar in the Southern Province, called Madam Li and told her everything about meeting Ye Jian today and what she said to Mrs. Qin.","\"I clearly hinted that Ye Jian is hooking up with people everywhere to climb up the social ladder. Xia Jinyuan, Li Jinnian, and Qin Xiu are all people she wants to use to climb up the social ladder, but Aunt Qin didn’t react at all. She was listening attentively, and I saw that she despised Ye Jian. But she didn’t show any reaction. It’s very abnormal.\"","Who was Madam Li? She was the daughter of Second Old Madam Li, who was taken in by the first wife and later angered her to death. Her methods were all inherited by Second Old Madam Li, and her strategies were even better than Second Old Madam Li’s.","Hearing this, Madam Li’s expression darkened. She reprimanded in a low voice, \"Jiayi, you made a huge mistake! Not only did you not make Madam Qin dislike Ye Jian, but you even made her more interested!\"","\"What?!\"","Du Jiayi, who had never thought that she would make a fool of herself, was shocked. Her face turned pale as she asked, \"Mom, what did I do wrong? Aunt Qin was the one who asked me. I just answered her.\"","How could she make such a huge mistake that made Mrs. Qin become interested in Ye Jian?","What went wrong?","Du Jiayi panicked. \"Mom, tell me quickly. As long as I think about Qin Xiu and Ye Jian getting closer, I... I won’t feel at ease.\"","Not to mention Du Jiayi, even Madam Li felt uneasy!","Her daughter wanted to worsen Madam Qin’s impression of Ye Jian, but...","Hearing that her daughter was getting anxious, Madam Li patiently pointed out, \"Ye Jian said that she wasn’t familiar with Qin Xiu, but you mentioned it again and again. This is the first mistake! Even if Mrs. Qin mentioned it, you should’ve said that it mainly depended on Qin Xiu and that it wasn’t your place to say anything!","\"Secondly, you shouldn’t have mentioned Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian. You shouldn’t have mentioned that Ye Jian has a good relationship with them! You want to say that Ye Jian is trying to climb up the social ladder, but have you thought about it? Xia Jinyuan and Li Jinnian are different from regular people. How could they not know who wants to use them to climb up the social ladder?","\"If Ye Jian wanted to make use of them to climb up the social ladder, would they be friendly with her? Would they let themselves become a stepping stone for a lowly woman? No!","\"Who are the three of them? What are their identities? Besides, there are many women who are more beautiful than Ye Jian! How could they be tempted by lust? It has never happened before!","\"So, they’re on good terms with Ye Jian, and even Qin Xiu might like her a little. Jiayi, think about it. Did you or did you not do something stupid?\"","..."]},{"number":4461,"title":"Chapter 4461: Enemy Of Two Lives","paragraphs":["Madam Li pointed her sword at Du Jiayi’s vital points. Du Jiayi was like a fish that had been slapped ashore by a huge wave. Her eyes were wide open. She couldn’t return to the river that would let her swim around.","That was right... Why didn’t she think of that?","Who was Xia Jinyuan? He was the grandson of the founding father, Old Master Xia, and the son of Commander Xia! Hadn’t he seen beautiful women before? He had seen them many times!","Who was Li Jinnian? Who was Qin Xiu? They were all from aristocratic families and had seen many storms. Hadn’t they seen beautiful women before? They had seen too many of them!","Why were they only amiable to Ye Jian?","Did they really think that Ye Jian was so prestigious that they liked her?","No!","No!","That wasn’t the case!","Du Jiayi was wrong, extremely wrong!","Not only did Mrs. Qin not hate Ye Jian, but she also felt that since Ye Jian was able to gain the favor of the three elites, she had to be outstanding.","Ye Jian, who had outstanding qualities, was liked by Qin Xiu. If... if Qin Xiu begged Mrs. Qin to fulfill his wish... would Mrs. Qin agree?","Du Jiayi thought of the worst outcome and asked her question shakily.","Madam Li was silent for a long time.","It was quiet. Du Jiayi waited for Madam Li to answer, but she didn’t hear any reply for a long time. She panicked even more.","\"Jiayi, you’re always too anxious. I can only tell you what you did wrong. But as for how you correct your mistakes, I can’t help you with that.\"","\"If Qin Xiu really begs Mrs. Qin, do you think he’ll agree? Ye Jian’s background is indeed bad, but she’s very hardworking. We can’t deny that.","\"She has strategies and means. She’s even calmer than you are. Jiayi, think about how Ye Zhifan’s family fell. Even an entire family couldn’t win against her. Do you think Mrs. Qin will agree?","\"Ye Jian came from a bad background. But no matter what, if she graduates from the military school and dresses in luxurious clothes, I can tell you with certainty that I’d agree if I were Mrs. Qin. I’d definitely agree. There are many candidates for a daughter-in-law, but there are very few women who are smart and capable.\"","With a bang, the cell phone slipped from Du Jiayi’s hand and fell to the ground. Du Jiayi’s teeth were trembling, and her face was pale without any signs of life. She had made the stupidest move.","If that was the case, she would no longer have any support. The man she had loved for many years would become someone else’s boyfriend and husband!","No, that was impossible. Absolutely impossible.","She had to think of a way to destroy everything. She couldn’t let Ye Jian get close to Qin Xiu.","No, no. She needed to figure out if Qin Xiu liked Ye Jian or not. It would be best if he didn’t. If he liked her... Du Jiayi slowly moved her footsteps. Her hand trembled as she unscrewed a bottle of mineral water and poured it into her mouth.","The water flowed out of her mouth and wet her collar. After a while, half of the large bottle of mineral water was drunk.","She wouldn’t sit still and wait for death. Never!","After drinking the water, Du Jiayi raised her hand and coldly wiped the water from her mouth. The mineral water bottle twisted and creaked as she clenched it tightly. The unfinished water spilled out of the bottle, wetting her hand and staining the carpet.","Madam Li didn’t say anything else. With a gloomy expression, she hung up the phone and sat on the couch alone for a long time. Ye Jian... It was Ye Jian again.","For some reason, she didn’t like Ye Jian the first time she saw her. She even felt a little threatened. She felt like Ye Jian was her enemy from her previous life. Now that she met Ye Jian again, the young woman was destined to cause a storm of blood.","Madam Li previously thought that she was thinking too much, but now, it seemed that it wasn’t the case!"]},{"number":4462,"title":"Chapter 4462: Sleep With Who?","paragraphs":["Madam Li didn’t talk to her daughter anymore. Instead, she sat alone and thought about it slowly. She didn’t really understand why Ye Jian gave her a sense of threat. Ye Jian was just an orphan and had no one to rely on. Although she was outstanding enough to get close to Xia Jinyuan, Li Jinnian, Qin Xiu, and other noble young masters, what could she do?","However, if she really caught Mrs. Qin’s eye, there was no doubt that Ye Jian and Qin Xiu would be able to get together. If Qin Xiu liked her, how could Mrs. Qin really stop him from being in love?","She had to let Jiayi think it through first. She had to treat Ye Jian as a training stone.","Pride came from confidence. However, arrogance surpassed confidence. That meant that she was only a step away from failure.","Jiayi was not young anymore. She was 26 years old this year. If she didn’t train well, it would be even harder for her to marry into the Qin family.","This time, Madam Li decided to stand by and do nothing for the time being. She would see what Du Jiayi would do.","On the other hand, Qin Ying and Qin Xiu were on a video call. The quality of the external camera was a little low, and there seemed to be a layer of mist on their faces. The siblings couldn’t see each other clearly.","\"The madam is getting more and more domineering. Brother, you’re really wise and mighty. You managed to escape in time. Now, you’re singing high in the mountains. As for me, I’ve been caught and am suffering.","\"I plan to book a plane ticket to where you are. Will you welcome me?\"","Qin Ying, who was wearing headphones, was chatting while holding the mouse and copying the photos from her camera into her laptop. The hard drive on her laptop was quite big. It could fit many photos.","Her slender fingers kept clicking on the mouse while her left hand was working on the keyboard. As for Qin Xiu, who was woken up by her call and finally climbed into bed to turn on the computer, he looked at her calmly with a cup of freshly brewed coffee in his hand.","Qin Ying was nagging. He didn’t say anything and only focused on stirring the coffee in his hand.","\"That Miss Du is really amazing. She wants to be with you, not the madam. Does she think it’s useful to be flattering the madam all the time?","\"She looks bright and beautiful and smart. Why is she so inflexible? Does she want to be with you or our mother? I’m confused.\"","After stirring the coffee, Qin Xiu turned his head silently. He almost choked on the coffee that touched his lips.","\"Qin Ying, please speak elegantly. Thank you.\"","He reminded his sister. He felt a headache and was helpless.","The anomaly in the family was Qin Ying. She was wilder than a man and had wild ways. Every time, their parents would stomp their feet in anger because of her.","Later on, her father got used to it and accepted it. At the same time, he realized that Qin Ying wasn’t that naughty. It was just that at home... the madam didn’t relent and vowed to transform his sister into a lady from a wealthy family.","In the end, well... the results were right in front.","Qin Ying continued to do whatever she wanted. The more time passed, the more carefree she became. The more time passed, the more troublesome it was for the lady at home.","That was good too. He was very supportive of Qin Ying.","This way, he wouldn’t appear too out of the ordinary. With precedents, he would be forgiven.","Ambassador Qin, who fought with everyone during the diplomatic negotiations and silently destroyed other people’s walls to fight for the country’s best interests, was resourceful. He was also a person who took one step at a time."]},{"number":4463,"title":"Chapter 4463: The Head","paragraphs":["Qin Ying finally found the photo taken at the airport tonight and sent it to Qin Xiu. \"I’ve been in the martial world for a long time. There are powerful people in all walks of life. Elegant? It won’t be too late for me to be elegant after I find that man.","\"I sent you a photo. The woman in the photo is your type. Take a good look. If you really like her, we’ll think of a way to get her personal information. Qin Xiu, you can’t be led astray by me. Otherwise, I’ll be committing a huge sin.\"","Qin Xiu had turned 29 in the blink of an eye. He was good-looking, but he had remained single. Although Qin Ying didn’t say it, she was still anxious. She was really afraid that Qin Xiu would be affected by her and not get married.","All these years, she had been around the world but had also been paying attention to whether there was a woman Qin Xiu would like. She had never met anyone like that. Unexpectedly, she met someone at the airport today.","Qin Xiu didn’t want to look at the photo. He said calmly, \"You have a man in your heart, and I have a woman in my heart. I’m hanging up. I need to organize a few documents.\"","...","There was too much information from his words. Qin Ying blinked. She had never heard Qin Xiu say that he had a woman he liked...","\"Hang up after you look at the photo! It won’t take up even a minute of your time!\"","Although he already had someone he liked, looking at a photo wouldn’t affect anything.","Although the siblings didn’t meet often, they often kept in touch. Their relationship was very deep. Hearing that, Qin Xiu frowned and dragged the video frame away. A figure in a green soldier uniform entered his eyes, making his heart skip a beat.","His heart was pounding. It was a little fast and anxious. This was a great surprise.","With just one look, Qin Xiu knew who the figure in the photo was.","It was so sudden that Qin Xiu didn’t have time to control his facial expressions. Qin Ying saw everything clearly. She couldn’t help but say, \"Why is your expression telling me that I unintentionally took a photo of my future sister-in-law? I can’t be that amazing, right?\"","\"Yes, it’s her.\"","Qin Xiu didn’t hide it and admitted openly, \"It’s magical. It’s so magical that I’m helpless.\"","They were not fated, but... his gaze lingered on the figure that he often dreamed about. Then, it landed on her beautiful side profile. Qin Xiu leaned closer to the computer screen. His handsome and elegant expression was very focused. \"I didn’t expect you to meet her and take a photo of her.\"","Qin Ying was at a loss for words.","She really wanted to curse now!","She had been searching for the man she liked for five years but couldn’t find him. She took a photo casually and ended up taking a photo of the woman her younger brother liked. Heh, heh... Damn it!","She couldn’t help but explode.","Qin Xiu shifted his gaze away from Ye Jian’s photo and glanced at Qin Ying, who was cursing through the camera. \"Qin Ying, why don’t you undergo a sex change surgery?\"","\"Yes. I’ll chase after her after my surgery. Get lost.\" After Qin Ying finished speaking, she glared at the smile on his face. He was so handsome that he looked like a noble young master in a painting. Damn it, she felt suffocated!","\"Goodbye!\"","After speaking coldly, Qin Ying ended the video call.","She had to look for her man. At the same time, she hoped that her younger brother would get the woman he wanted.","It was late at night. There was no longer any traffic outside the window. The car sped past, leaving only a string of taillights. It was already 10:00 pm.","The plane from Xiang City to Landi arrived at the airport on time at 10:30 pm. Ye Jian left the plane too. She boarded another plane half an hour later.","She turned on her cell phone and quickly received a message from Xia Jinyuan, reminding her to reply to him when she arrived at Landi. Ye Jian, who had a deep smile on her face, immediately replied: [I arrived at Landi on time.]"]},{"number":4464,"title":"Chapter 4464: Sad","paragraphs":["At the same time, Qin Ying, who came out of the shower, wiped her short hair with one hand and shuffled to the desk in her hotel disposable slippers. She took her phone and saw Qin Xiu’s profile picture. Qin Ying opened the dialog box, and her pupils instantly constricted. She stared at the message in the dialog box. After a long time, a bitter smile appeared on her face.","\"I thought Lady Luck was on your side, but in the end...\" The result was tragic.","Now that the woman was already taken, he had to retreat.","There were only a few words in the dialog box. Just like Qin Xiu in life, his words were concise and clear.","Qin Ying closed the dialog box and clicked on the folder where the photo was stored. She found the photo and clicked right. As the mouse moved, she clicked left again. She clicked to confirm, and the photo of the soldier that was specially stored was successfully deleted.","Then, she entered the recycling bin and cleared it. All traces were deleted.","After everything was done, Qin Ying left a message for Qin Xiu, who was already offline. [A gentleman should do what he should do.] She reminded Qin Xiu to restrain himself.","Although Mrs. Qin was headstrong, she was also quite strict with her children’s education. They could be arrogant, but they couldn’t be domineering. They could be arrogant, but they couldn’t be rude. They could beg, but they couldn’t force themselves.","Qin Ying and Qin Xiu had always been able to distinguish the severity of the matter. They had never done anything they knew they couldn’t do. It was even more impossible for them to snatch someone’s partner.","Even if the couple was unmarried, it was unwise for them to do so.","Qin Ying deleted Ye Jian’s photo, and Qin Xiu had already deleted it before she did.","The two siblings only spoke about it with each other that night. After that, they never mentioned it again as if it had never happened.","The night got darker and quieter. Ye Jian didn’t receive any reply from Xia Jinyuan until she boarded the plane. She could only turn off her cell phone and contact him when she reached the border.","Five and a half hours later, the plane landed at 1:30 am. Ye Jian finally received a message. When she saw the address on it, Ye Jian couldn’t help but tighten her right hand that was holding her cell phone.","She always thought that she would be training north of the border like before. Now, she knew that it wasn’t the north. It was the south. When she arrived at the border, she needed to take another Class One flight to the south.","The earliest flight was to the city of Accra in the south at 3:20 am. Then, she would enter the sloped plains for training from the city of Accra.","The sloped plains at the foot of the mountain were very special. From 1,700 meters above sea level to 2,200 meters above sea level, the desert was covered with coarse sand and gravel. There were sparse drought plants growing in the desert. From 1,400 meters above sea level to 1,700 meters above sea level, the desert was bare gravel. From 1,200 meters above sea level to 1,400 meters above sea level, it was an ancient oasis distribution area. After long-term irrigation, the soil kept maturing.","This time, she would enter the rough desert training that took place 1,400 to 1,700 meters above sea level. She could see the continuous high mountains and snow mountains that reached into the clouds.","It wasn’t that she hadn’t entered the rough desert for training before. It was just that she hadn’t... entered the desert training in the south of the territory where terrorists were active.","No wonder Captain Xia said that this training was all live ammunition. As it turned out, he had already hinted that this training wasn’t ordinary training. Due to his reaction at that time, she didn’t think that it was really live ammunition training.","Taking a deep breath, Ye Jian carried her luggage and walked toward the departure hall.","It was 1:40 am now. She could go to the departure hall to rest before boarding the plane.","The waiting hall wasn’t very calm. Most of the people here were tourists. Ye Jian looked around and found a corner seat."]},{"number":4465,"title":"Chapter 4465: Tension","paragraphs":["The plane took off at 3:20 pm sharp and arrived at the city of Accra 40 minutes later.","There weren’t many passengers on the plane. It wasn’t even half full. Fortunately, it was a small plane. It didn’t seem empty even though there were less than half of them.","The flight attendant reminded the passengers to fasten their seatbelts and turn off their cell phones. She also wished the passengers a pleasant journey.","At 4:30 pm, Ye Jian walked out of the plane. She received another message on her phone. After reading it, Ye Jian didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","Why did she feel that Captain Xia seemed to have sent her this message on purpose? Was he afraid that she would go back on her word and pick up her luggage and return?","He could have said it all at once, but he insisted on sending multiple messages. Was he really afraid that she would go back on her word?","[Roger that. Do you have any more instructions?]","Xia Jinyuan took out his cell phone and looked at it. He couldn’t help but laugh softly. His woman probably knew that he sent the message on purpose.","[Nothing for now. Wait patiently. See you in six hours.]","Ye Jian replied: [Roger that.]","She still needed to wait for two veterans. They were all acquaintances.","One was proficient in six languages and was an electronic demolition expert, White Crane. The other was Weaver, who graduated from the aerospace school and became an army soldier. He was good at flying all kinds of helicopters.","The two of them would only be able to reach the airport in Accra at 6:30 am. Ye Jian could make use of the time to rest.","At 4:00 am, the airport in Accra was even quieter. Besides the passengers who came out of the plane just now, there was no one else. The surroundings were quiet.","Even if there were only a few people, not all of them were regular people. There were two people with sharp eyes disguised as plainclothes soldiers.","One of the plain-clothes soldiers was quite sharp. He caught Ye Jian’s gaze in an instant. His sharp gaze gave Ye Jian a sharp feeling.","One was a plain-clothes policeman while the other was a soldier. When their gazes met, the plain-clothes policeman, who thought that he had discovered the situation, retracted his gaze. In the blink of an eye, he became an ordinary person again. He even smiled at Ye Jian amiably.","Ye Jian smiled at him.","The south was complicated. There was no need to make a fuss when she met plain-clothes policemen. However... Ye Jian frowned slightly as she walked out of the exit with her luggage. She just felt that they were looking for someone.","After walking out of the exit, Ye Jian headed to the airport lobby. She would meet White Crane and Weaver in the lobby.","The airport lobby was also quite calm. It was empty. The rows of seats were empty. There were plain-clothes officers in the crowd too. This time, Ye Jian didn’t pay much attention to them.","She locked onto a seat in the corner. Carrying her simple camouflage bag, she walked toward a seat.","Ye Jian walked toward the resting place she found. On the other side, four women who looked like university students were also looking for a resting place. When they saw Ye Jian, the four of them said something in low voices. They pushed the suitcases in their hands onto a luggage trolley and walked toward the corner where Ye Jian was resting.","Ye Jian, who was sitting down, had her back facing them. She didn’t notice that four women were walking toward her.","She needed to make use of the time to rest. When she reached the desert, she wouldn’t have much time to rest.","Ye Jian, who was already familiar with Xia Jinyuan’s training method, was already used to his training mode.","Ye Jian fell asleep immediately. She placed her camouflage luggage on her knees and hugged her luggage with her arms. She lowered her head and laid down to sleep. The four women who were walking toward her saw this and hesitated. They wanted to approach but didn’t dare to."]},{"number":4466,"title":"Chapter 4466: She’s The Source Of Comfort","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who was sleeping with her luggage, didn’t notice what the four women were conflicted about. They stammered for a while and lowered their heads to say a few words. In the end, they pushed the luggage cart over and sat down gently across Ye Jian.","They didn’t dare to look at Ye Jian. They felt much more relaxed just sitting there.","This was the first time they came to the bordering town to travel. Previously, they had seen too many posts about how unsafe the bordering town was and were a little afraid. As their plane landed late, they were even more afraid in the middle of the night.","They didn’t dare to be around other people. Ye Jian happened to appear and became the support of the four women.","Ye Jian wasn’t completely asleep. She knew that there were people sitting not far away from her and felt several harmless gazes sizing her up. Since they were harmless, there was no need to care about them.","After a while, someone sat over. Almost everyone was sitting around Ye Jian. It was a corner, but it became the place with the most tourists.","\"Put it here, put it here. Lower your voice. Can’t you see that she’s sleeping?\"","\"Don’t sit too close. The four young ladies specially left two seats empty.\"","The people who came over lowered their voices and spoke. Ye Jian heard them clearly. She wanted to sleep, but the passengers were all walking toward her. No matter how light their footsteps were or how low their voices were, the sounds were not soft for her.","She wanted to get up and change her seat, but she heard the passengers sitting in the row behind her whisper, \"Everyone is in a state of panic. I wonder if they’ve been caught. Look, we’re too afraid to go out.\"","\"I’m sure they haven’t been caught. Otherwise, the authorities wouldn’t be investigating so strictly. Stop talking about it. It’s chilling to talk about these things in the middle of the night.\"","\"There’s a soldier sitting in front of us. What are you afraid of?\"","...","Ye Jian was about to get up and change her seat when she lowered her head silently. As it turned out, she had the effect of stabilizing the peace here.","She also found out why there were so many plainclothes officers in the airport. As it turned out, they were really looking for someone.","They definitely weren’t looking for her. Otherwise, the plainclothes officers wouldn’t be searching the surroundings from time to time.","The quiet waiting room was very suitable for sleeping. Soon, the four women fell asleep. When the alarm clock they set rang, the four of them opened their eyes in a daze. It took them a while to wake up fully.","\"She left? When did she leave?\"","A woman who was closest to Ye Jian’s seat spoke softly. She was a little surprised. \"I didn’t sleep much. I felt a few people passing by us. But I don’t know when she left.\"","\"She was worried about waking us up, right? Let’s stop talking. We need to catch the morning bus.\"","\"Luggage, luggage, take your luggage.\"","\"Check if anything is left behind...\"","The four women hurriedly woke up the passengers who were sleeping nearby. Some passengers started to wake up slowly. They were all on the morning bus. It was almost time.","Ye Jian tidied up in the bathroom. It was six o’clock. White Crane and Weaver would arrive in 40 minutes at most.","At this moment, White Crane and Weaver, who were dressed casually, were still on the plane. They weren’t sleeping. The two of them ran to the bathroom to wash their faces and had chewing gum. They tidied up and looked at the newspaper provided on the plane leisurely.","The two of them didn’t interact much the entire time. For what reason would the two of them interact?","They couldn’t talk about work. And when it came to personal matters... they didn’t have any personal matters. They spent every day with each other. If their butts were bitten by mosquitoes, the other party would already be aware of that knowledge. What personal matters could they possibly talk about?","The two of them, who didn’t have any personal matters to talk about, maintained a high level of tacit understanding. After tidying themselves up, they read the newspaper and waited for the plane to land.","The plane landed at 6:20 am. At 6:30 am, the two of them prepared to walk out of the exit. Weaver looked at White Crane’s chin and said in a low voice, \"F*ck, you disappeared in the last five minutes. As it turned out, you shaved behind my back! How scheming!\""]},{"number":4467,"title":"Chapter 4467: Danger Sense","paragraphs":["White Crane touched his chin. Yes, not bad. It was very clean.","\"Scheming? How paranoid. I’m just more concerned about my personal hygiene than you are. Also, how can a gentleman be rude in front of a lady?\"","White Crane, who came from Jiangnan Water Village, replied unhurriedly, but his footsteps were a little faster.","Ye Jian was the only female soldier in their team. She was the ’treasure of the team’. As male soldiers, they couldn’t be too sloppy and scare the only female soldier away.","\"Sophistry.\" Weaver concluded and rolled his eyes at White Crane.","White Crane raised his eyebrows and picked up the same camouflage travel bag as Ye Jian. He quickened his pace. \"It’s already 6:30 am. How long do you want her to wait?\"","Naturally, the sooner they met her, the better.","Weaver quickened her footsteps and secretly touched his chin. It seemed quite clean and not prickly.","As for his attire, he had specially tidied up his uniform. There shouldn’t be a problem.","The two of them walked out of the cabin and strode to the arrival gate. When two tall figures came out of the gate, several gazes landed on them.","Normal people wouldn’t notice them. Even if they did, they would think that the other party was just looking for someone.","White Crane and Weaver sensed a sense of danger from those faint gazes. The two of them pretended to inadvertently glance at the faces that blended into the crowd and narrowed their eyes.","\"Plainclothes officers. Looks like the situation here isn’t peaceful.\" Weaver maintained his smile and spoke in a low voice. \"Five people, two in front, one at two o’clock, and two at eight o’clock. They’re armed with guns.\"","When one of the plainclothes officers saw the two of them appear, he subconsciously moved his hand to the side of his waist. It looked like he was lifting his pants, but it was actually an action of touching a gun. One look and they could tell that he had just started working as a plainclothes officer.","Perhaps it was because the police force was insufficient that these young and inexperienced plainclothes officers were sent out.","\"The security in the city is not bad. We have to be careful when entering the mountains.\" White Crane retracted his gaze. He raised his head and puffed out his chest. His inadvertent action made the older plainclothes soldiers heave a sigh of relief. Their tense backs relaxed.","Fortunately, there was no problem.","\"There’s no problem with them. They should be armed police officers,\" an old man in plainclothes told his group. At the same time, he gestured to the surroundings.","The other plainclothes officers who received the instructions retracted their gaze at the same time and looked around again.","\"There’s no problem with the person. He should be an armed police officer,\" an old man in plain clothes told his family. At the same time, he gestured to the surroundings.","A plainclothes officer walked past them. He served in a different system. They didn’t communicate at all. They didn’t even look at each other. They were strangers to begin with. There was no need for strangers to communicate.","It was almost 7:00 am when more and more passengers were arriving at the airport. Most of them were from the local ethnic minorities. They had high nose bridges and deep eyes. Coupled with their fair skin, they were extremely beautiful, regardless of gender. Especially the children who smiled carefreely. They had big eyes, high nose bridges, and fair skin. They were beautiful and cute. Ye Jian couldn’t look away.","Ye Jian didn’t understand what they were saying. They spoke quickly.","There were also some faces from the West or other countries. If it weren’t for the plainclothes officers, Ye Jian wouldn’t have felt any nervousness.","Here, the country invested a lot of police and resources to maintain the stability of the country. There was indeed no need to be too afraid.","At 6:40 am, Ye Jian finally saw two familiar figures. They were comrades who fought side by side. As long as they appeared, she would be able to recognize them immediately."]},{"number":4468,"title":"Chapter 4468: You’ve Grown Taller","paragraphs":["The two of them saw Ye Jian too. They looked at each other, and the smile on their faces slowly disappeared. Ye Jian, who had already changed into casual clothes, walked toward them quickly. They strode toward Ye Jian as well.","Just like before, the two of them suddenly walked very quickly. The plainclothes officers immediately looked over and quickly looked away.","\"Sorry to have kept you waiting.\" White Crane reached out and took Ye Jian’s luggage. Weaver, who was a step slower, gritted his teeth. He reached out his hand.","\"Long time no see.\"","Weaver reached out his hand and shook Ye Jian’s hand. \"Did you wait until you wanted to flare up? Don’t stand on ceremony. Just vent your anger. Our skin is thick, and we can take it.\"","Because they were familiar with each other, there was no sense of restraint. Even when they spoke, they were much more casual. They were not as distant as when they first met.","Ye Jian shook her hand and replied with a smile, \"Captain Xia told me in advance, so I wasn’t given a chance to flare up. Try next time.\"","\"Hahaha, no problem.\" Weaver retracted his hand and started chatting with Ye Jian. \"Flying from the Northeast to the Northwest is too a distance. He and I were worried that we would be late before we boarded the plane. Fortunately, the journey was smooth and we didn’t make you wait long.\"","White Crane held one luggage in each hand and let Weaver talk first. When they walked out of the airport lobby, the three of them had already started chatting. White Crane raised his hand and smiled as he used it to measure Ye Jian’s height. He teased, \"The food in the military school is not bad. You’re much taller than the last time we met. In the past, when I talked to you, I needed to take a step back. Now, I just need to take half a step back.\"","White Crane and Weaver were both tall. No, it should be said that other than the scout who was less than 1.8 meters tall, the rest of the special forces soldiers were more than 1.8 meters tall. As a result, as long as Ye Jian was too close to them, she had to raise her head to look at them.","Due to the difference in height, it became a topic of discussion for the Xueyu unit for a long time.","Xia Jinyuan let them talk about this topic without any malicious intent. Occasionally, he would join in and tease her as well.","Ye Jian had been troubled by her height for a while. They were too tall, making her, who was not short, look very short. When they gathered, their heigh difference was obvious. Alas, she was helpless.","Ye Jian was still very happy to hear that she had grown taller.","\"The food is indeed not bad. Fortunately, I’ve gotten taller. If not, my neck would hurt whenever I talk to you,\" she replied with a smile. The two male soldiers on her left and right laughed softly.","There were armed police officers on duty outside the airport. There were three posts, one in the middle and one on each side. The three of them walked past the middle post. Facing the tourists coming and going, Weaver lowered his voice and said, \"It looks like there’s a big move. Plainclothes and armed police have been mobilized.\"","\"Something happened. I even acted as a guardian in the early morning. At first, I wanted to find a corner to sleep alone, but there were at least 15 people sitting around me in the end. It became the most crowded corner in the entire hall. I was really eye-catching, so I changed into my only casual outfit.\"","Ye Jian recalled the scene she saw when she woke up. She didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. However, she felt a little proud. Later, she realized the reason why people kept looking at her. She went to the bathroom to change into her only casual clothes. That was why no one sized her up anymore.","There was a taxi outside the airport. The three of them took a taxi to the city before taking a Jeep arranged by the military unit to enter the desert.","A taxi stopped in front of the three of them. White Crane immediately went to pull the back door. Before he could pull it open, the taxi driver leaned his head against the steering wheel and sized up White Crane first. Then, he looked at Weaver. Finally, his gaze landed on Ye Jian. The locked door opened with a click.","The three people outside the car had already secretly exchanged hand signals."]},{"number":4469,"title":"Chapter 4469: Unfriendly","paragraphs":["The three of them were suspicious. For a moment, they wanted to give up on taking this car. White Crane said in a low voice, \"Get in first. I know the Uighur language.\"","If there was really a problem with the driver, the three of them could subdue him with their skills.","Ye Jian hesitated for a few seconds. She was worried that there would be a suicide bomb installed in the car...","Weaver saw her hesitation and smiled. \"It’s okay. Get in.\"","If one were to encounter trouble here, sometimes, it wouldn’t just be a small trouble. It would be a matter of life and death. Since Weaver and White Crane, who knew the situation in the Southern Frontier, had noticed something amiss, they naturally wouldn’t turn a blind eye.","Before the car door opened, Ye Jian said in a low voice, \"Bomb.\"","The two male soldiers were overjoyed.","Caution was a good thing. One couldn’t be too cautious.","Ye Jian’s face turned red from their laughter. She... really thought so.","The three of them opened the car door and got in one by one. White Crane sat in front while Ye Jian and Weaver sat in the back. After giving their address, the three of them didn’t stop talking because of the driver’s abnormality. They talked about the military unit and the military school. They could also talk about the situation in Accra.","The three of them became tourists.","They hadn’t found anything wrong with the driver, but they were 100% sure that there was something wrong with him!","At first, he didn’t want to drive them. But when he saw Ye Jian, he immediately changed his mind and unlocked the car door for them. There was an obvious hostility in his eyes. When the three of them got into the car, there was even a hint of fierceness in his eyes.","Ye Jian was already touching her wrist lightly because of the fierceness in his eyes. She had not used the silver wire for a long time. If something really happened, she could make use of the silver wire.","Ye Jian had never been to the Southern Frontier before. Due to the news from her previous life, she was already mentally preparing for combat.","This was Ye Jian’s first time visiting the Southern Frontier, but it was not White Crane’s and Weaver’s first.","Although the Southern Frontier was more backward than the Northern Frontier, in addition to the large proportion of ethnic minorities, the Southern Frontier was indeed a little more dangerous than the Northern Frontier due to the difference in living habits and religious beliefs.","However, as long as the locals of the Southern Frontier adhered to all their habits, they would be enthusiastic and hospitable. They would not be hostile to others.","At least White Crane, Weaver, and the others had never encountered them before in the past few times they came to the Southern Frontier.","This time, it was an exception.","When the two of them bent down and got into the car earlier, they looked at each other silently. They both thought of the plainclothes officers that appeared in the airport.","The three of them, who were extremely vigilant, became very wary of the driver. As they spoke, they didn’t relax their vigilance against the driver.","The three of them chatted about the scenery in the Southern Frontier. After that, they didn’t speak for a long time. The driver, who had a tense expression on his face as if someone owed him money, suddenly said a few words in the local language.","He spoke so quickly that no one knew what he said."]},{"number":4470,"title":"Chapter 4470: Hijack","paragraphs":["His sudden interruption made Ye Jian, who didn’t understand, narrow her eyes slightly. She glanced at the driver who had a fierce look on his side profile. She paused for a moment and asked her comrades with a smile, \"What did the driver say? I didn’t understand a word. Did you understand?\"","Weaver raised his eyebrows and spread his hands casually. He smiled and said, \"I didn’t understand either.:","White Crane tilted his head and asked the driver with a blank expression, \"Excuse me, were you talking to the three of us just now?\"","The driver quickly glanced at White Crane. His deep eyes were cold and suffused with the chill of a winter morning. He spoke a string of words in the local language. White Crane turned his head and said to his comrades sitting behind him, \"There’s a language barrier. I don’t understand either.\"","White Crane, who had turned his head to speak, turned his body sideways. He made a casual gesture with his left hand, and the two people sitting behind laughed.","The three of them looked at each other and smiled. They had a tacit understanding.","It wasn’t that White Crane didn’t understand. He understood. The first sentence was about the weather inland, and the second sentence was about why they came here.","That was right. The driver asked the three of them why they came here.","This time, they had encountered an unfriendly local, and it was this taxi driver.","The distance from the airport to the city was not far. The border was wide, and there were few people. There was no need to build an airport dozens of kilometers away from the city like in the mainland. The car drove extremely fast. The dashboard showed that they had already driven for more than 125 miles, and the number was still rising.","Ye Jian couldn’t help but hold the silver wire with one hand. Her eyes were already cold.","Weaver secretly patted Ye Jian’s arm and comforted her. There was no need to be nervous. They were ready for everything. When the car turned right at a fork in the road, White Crane and Weaver knew that something was wrong.","They just needed to drive along the middle road in the city. However, the driver chose to turn right. Where did he plan to bring them?","White Crane, who was in front, stretched out his right hand from the narrow gap between the passenger seat and the car door. He curled his middle three fingers and raised his thumb and pinky. Then, he retracted his hand and placed it beside his ear. He pointed his pinky to his mouth and pressed his thumb close to his ear.","The entire gesture was completed in about three seconds.","Ye Jian received the signal and said to her two comrades, \"I want to sleep for a while. Tell me when we reach.\"","\"Okay.\" Weaver took out his phone and nodded with a smile. The three of them fell silent.","Ye Jian closed her eyes and pretended to sleep. White Crane pretended to look at the scenery outside. Weaver sent a message to the main forces in the desert.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t see the message on his cell phone immediately. About an hour later, he took out his phone and turned it on after completing his task.","He was wearing a desert camouflage uniform. He bent down and walked to the camouflage tent to look for Z7. \"Locate Weaver’s cell phone. He sent me a message an hour ago. I suspect that he met someone from the East.\"","Z7 was establishing a data connection. Hearing what Xia Jinyuan said, he replied in disbelief, \"They encountered bad people when coming out of the airport? They’re not so unlucky. That’s probably not the case.\"","\"Cut the crap. The airport isn’t peaceful. They’ve mobilized plainclothes officers inside and outside. The North has always been a little chaotic.\"","Xia Jinyuan took off his helmet and stared at the computer screen with his black eyes.","As Z7 completed his tracking, the small red dots on the computer started blinking. Were they heading in their direction?"]},{"number":4471,"title":"Chapter 4471: Tricky","paragraphs":["Weaver’s message informed him that they suspected their taxi driver was an extremist and the car had been hijacked. The location showed that they were heading to the desert.","Z7 stared at the location for a few seconds. He tilted his head and smiled. \"I told you that they weren’t so unlucky. They’re coming toward us...\"","\"That’s not right. The three of them aren’t coming over,\" Xia Jinyuan interrupted with a cold voice. \"The desert is south-northwest. They’re going directly to the north. The north has never been peaceful. Since Weaver told us that they suspect it’s an extremist, it’s 90% true.\"","As for the other 1%, the driver might not be an extremist but another type of criminal.","Due to their different living habits, that place was almost a forbidden area. Even the military units stationed here wouldn’t easily step foot in it. They were afraid that they would offend the people there and cause unnecessary conflict.","Hence, they rarely stepped into that place. In addition, the area was vast, so they couldn’t pull any tricks. If anything happened to the police and soldiers stationed there, they would immediately report it to the local special forces of the city of Accra and let the city send the local special forces to deal with it.","However, there had been no news of suspected extremists in the north recently. Otherwise, with China’s harsh crackdown on extremists, they would have been destroyed.","Xia Jinyuan’s eyes darkened as he rubbed the steel gun unconsciously. It looked like they needed to take a look at the forbidden area in the north.","The residents living in the depths of the mountains were armed with illegal weapons. Hence, they needed to plan this properly. The most important thing now was to find out if it was an extremist or another criminal.","There were drug dealers, human traffickers, and smuggling in the north. Over the years, the country had become stricter with the border. Hence, although there were problems with the restricted area, it had always been relatively peaceful. There were no direct conflicts. Usually, if there were any abnormalities, they would be resolved secretly.","Now, Weaver, White Crane, and Ye Jian were heading to the most complicated north. Xia Jinyuan rubbed his fingers lightly. His eyes were dark, and there was a cold sword intent flashing past them. He said to Han Zheng, \"Track the location again and combine it with the satellite map!\"","Han Zheng widened his eyes and looked at the location carefully again. At the same time, he pulled out the satellite map. As the two overlapped and accurately located a certain point, Han Zheng gasped on the spot. \"They’re really... going north! Damn it, this... is huge!\"","They were actually going to the northernmost part.","Before they set off for their training in the desert, their boss didn’t forget to give them another order. They had to abide by the rules and watch themselves as special forces soldiers who had just entered the border. They couldn’t cross the line of fire and cause discord. They couldn’t be taken advantage of by others.","The northernmost area was a very sensitive place. If they couldn’t suppress the people there with firepower, they were afraid that it would cause a backlash. They were even more worried that it would dissatisfy the locals.","It was impossible to ignore them completely. The land was vast, and there were few people. There would always be some people who were not afraid of death who would cause trouble. There were even some people who would be used by the foreign countries to walk on a path of no return. At this moment, the soldiers had to deal with them secretly and show no mercy.","If there were no abnormalities in the north, no one would enter easily, and no one would come out easily. Sometimes, when the border soldiers entered the base, they would take a helicopter and arrive. That way, they would not destroy the peace there. They would always coexist peacefully in a subtle and vigilant way.","No one took the initiative to cross the border, let alone cause trouble. It was the same for the locals, the military unit, the armed police, and the police."]},{"number":4472,"title":"Chapter 4472: Practice","paragraphs":["Han Zheng felt that it was very troublesome. If they didn’t deal with it properly... it might cause a dispute.","There was another question. Was the driver blind?","Kidnapping special forces soldiers? He was courting death!","Han Zheng, who had been sighing for a while, raised his question in a low voice, \"Q King, do you think it’s really an extremist? Is he blind? Couldn’t he see that the three of them can’t be provoked? Is he blind?\"","For some reason, Han Zheng sympathized with the unknown person who dared to kidnap three special forces soldiers.","How bold!","Was he blind? He had eyes for nothing!","Xia Jinyuan stopped rubbing the pistol and suddenly looked up at Han Zheng. His gaze was so vicious that Han Zheng felt a chill down his spine. He gritted his teeth and asked, \"Don’t look at me like that. It’ll make me feel like I’m going to die in the next second.\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled and patted his shoulder. He smiled and said, \"Don’t worry, you’re very useful. I won’t let you die.","\"Your question is very good. If he isn’t blind, he might not be an extremist.\"","If Weaver was wrong, the three kidnapped people wouldn’t be in as great of a danger, but it would still be troublesome.","If they were really kidnapped by an extremist, there was no need to hold back. They could just bring their troops and overturn the other party’s background.","However, this wouldn’t work in the far north.","That place was too sensitive. They couldn’t kill or even say anything harsh. There were too many policies in place. It was worrying. Although Xia Jinyuan was reminded by Han Zheng, his headache continued.","The three of them definitely had a chance to escape, but the main point was that if they really met an extremist, as soldiers, they definitely could not ignore the situation.","These people had always been fighting with the local forces. The Xueyu unit existed to eliminate the influence of foreign forces in the country. As long as they noticed any signs, the military would immediately give an order.","Now that the three soldiers under him had been kidnapped to the most sensitive north, Xia Jinyuan, who had fallen silent, was thinking about how to deal with it.","\"We have to report this to the boss. We can’t make a big deal out of this,\" Han Zheng said in a low voice. He pursed his lips tightly. \"No matter whether it’s a big or small issue, we can’t cause a conflict.\"","There was dead silence in the tent. Even their breathing was tense. The atmosphere was so heavy that it was like an invisible rock pressing down on the two of them.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t say anything. He seemed to be thinking about something. Han Zheng, who was sitting down, was silent for a while before suddenly exclaiming, \"Huh?\" He looked at his captain, whose cold facial expression had dissipated.","\"That’s not right, Q King. There’s something wrong.\" He frowned and said the key point he thought of just now. \"If there’s a problem with the driver, it’s impossible for the three of them not to have discovered it long ago. Even if they only discovered it not long ago, the three of them could have subdued the driver in the car and sent the suspicious person to the police to deal with.","\"The three of them didn’t make a move at all. They let the driver bring them away and even specially sent you a message to tell you about this. The three of them clearly had a chance to escape but didn’t do it. It’s obvious that they did it on purpose!","\"Damn, have I been worried about them for nothing? They purposely bumped into a bad character and even followed the driver to the north. I bet that Weaver and White Crane already know where they’re going. Azure Bird might not know, though. She’s never been here.\"","Han Zheng, who had figured out the crux of the matter, suddenly relaxed. His tall and big body collapsed on the ground. \"Damn it, I almost thought that something big was going to happen! They were asking for this. Even if something does happen... they’re just getting what they asked for!\""]},{"number":4473,"title":"Chapter 4473: How","paragraphs":["Although he said that, Han Zheng was still very worried. Even if they intentionally encountered this bad character... they needed to be able to escape successfully.","Xia Jinyuan, who was thinking about how to deal with the problem, glanced at his comrade and realized that the three of them got themselves kidnapped on purpose. He smiled slightly and teased, \"I thought you became smarter, but the result is still the same. Your short-lived intelligence is unreliable.\"","As Xia Jinyuan’s good friend for many years, Han Zheng knew very well how vicious the man in front of him was. He knew very well, but experiencing it still made him feel like it was difficult to breathe.","F*ck!","His IQ had always been reliable. What did Xia Jinyuan mean by ’short-lived intelligence’?","Han Zheng, who was hurt, said expressionlessly, \"Then how do you think we should deal with it? From now on, we’ll only discuss the problem. No personal attacks are allowed.\"","He was hurt. He needed to heal!","A dark glint flashed past Xia Jinyuan’s eyes. The corners of his lips curled up slightly. Thinking of a solution, the coldness on his handsome face gradually disappeared. He said slowly, \"If the other party’s identity is as Weaver said, our matter will be easy to handle.\"","Easy to handle?","What did he mean?","Han Zheng couldn’t understand it at all!","Han Zheng leaned forward slightly and asked humbly, \"What can we do? Both sides are in a difficult spot.\"","It couldn’t be helped. Until now, he hadn’t thought of a solution. As for Xia Jinyuan, it was obvious that he had a plan.","\"Practice.\"","Xia Jinyuan slowly spat out a word. He hooked the band of his helmet that was placed at the side with his hand. He stroked his unruly short hair. An arrogant and intimidating smile appeared on his handsome face. He said to Han Zheng, \"Go and ask what happened in Accra in the past few days. Asking about it will make things easier for us and for them... And for those soldiers who are about to go into the battlefield after training.\"","He was referring to Ye Jian, Weaver, and White Crane.","Their comrades had formed a tacit understanding for many years. When Xia Jinyuan said that, Han Zheng’s eyes widened.","He stared at the young captain who was wearing a helmet. His eyes were filled with intimidation and ruthlessness. He was like a wild wolf. He exclaimed, \"Are you crazy?!\"","\"This is a good opportunity.\"","\"No, it’s not an opportunity. Something will happen...\" Han Zheng shook his head. \"I want to report to G3. What you’re doing isn’t part of the plan.\"","\"What do you mean by ’part of the plan’? Is arranging their escape route within the plan? They won’t tell us in advance when the enemy’s bullets come raining down and give us time to have a plan.\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled coldly. His eyes were as sharp as an eagle’s hook. \"Things change instantly. There’s never a plan! You have to do it sooner or later. If you don’t seize the opportunity, it’s a shame to let it go to waste.\"","Han Zheng was anxious. \"Oh my god, we’re not letting them practice now. We have to think of a way to save Azure Bird and the other two!\"","\"It’s both training and saving people. It’s both.\"","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan was the ’king’ of the Xueyu unit. He was a ’king’ who was good at seizing all opportunities.","Han Zheng sat quietly and looked at his good friend and comrade. For a moment, he didn’t know what to say.","It had been a long time since they met. The current Xia Jinyuan was no longer the Xia Jinyuan of the past. He had changed drastically.","When he first saw the young man, even his gaze was arrogant. He walked arrogantly and spoke arrogantly. He was arrogant as if he was the number one person in the world. However, he was especially loyal. He was like a shining star that could call his friends wherever he went. At that time, Xia Jinyuan was undoubtedly the ’demon king incarnate’."]},{"number":4474,"title":"Chapter 4474: Healthier","paragraphs":["Now, Xia Jinyuan was no longer the shining person who called his friends. The arrogant light on his body had settled down at some point in time. He had become deep and reserved. His aura could only be seen when he made a move.","He was no longer fearless or arrogant. He had the arrogance of a deep strategist. This kind of arrogance was terrifying because there was no way to know what he was planning behind his ’arrogance.’","\"I’ll contact the boss. You can ask around.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t change his mind because of Han Zheng’s anxiousness. Since Azure Bird, Weaver, and White Crane were in danger at the same time, then... it didn’t matter if there was another group of people. There was strength in numbers. It would be troublesome if they dawdled.","Very soon, Major General Yang, who was still in the meeting, knew about this matter. He didn’t have a headache because of this. Instead, his eyes lit up. He felt happy that good things had come knocking on his door. He smiled at Xia Jinyuan and said, \"Killing two birds with one stone. That’s good!\"","He received the latest news. At the moment, a group of criminals was trying to cause trouble in the most illegal organization in the north. After receiving the information, they were just thinking about how to infiltrate the north. Who knew that those people would immediately send themselves to their door? A good opportunity to kill two birds with one stone had arrived!","\"The city of Accra has indeed been chaotic recently. A group of criminals is secretly planning a large-scale riot to instigate the people. The military has already clearly grasped the personal information of three of the top targets—two Hanu people and one Keer. They’re local residents in the north.","\"The three of them left the country half a year ago. Half a month ago, they snuck back to the country from the border. Four days ago, a shop was destroyed in front of the city of Accra. That was the start of their riot plan.","\"We have the personal information of the three of them clearly. The military has ordered that they must be killed. If the three of them are really being kidnapped to the north, it’s a good thing with the current situation. The military plans to wipe them out.\"","Xia Jinyuan nodded. That was right, that was right. It was indeed a good thing for them.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t want Major General Yang to know what he was planning. He had a smile on his face, but he said in a low voice, \"I want to know when the military will take action.\"","He didn’t care about anything else. He only cared about when they would take action to clear the enemies so that he could lead the soldiers to practice.","His deep and cold voice made Major General Yang’s heart drop. He asked in a low voice, \"Did something happen to the three of them?\"","\"Not yet, but if we don’t act now, something might happen.\"","So, nothing had happened!","Major General Yang heaved a sigh of relief and asked calmly, \"What’s the hurry? Didn’t I just say that I’m in a meeting? If there’s a move, the order will only be given after the meeting ends.\"","\"We can’t wait. The three of them are in danger. They’re all wearing camouflage uniforms. They hate our soldiers. Once they realize that the three of them are active soldiers, how long do you think they can wait?","\"I hope that we can move out and go to the northernmost area as soon as possible. Once we notice anything amiss, we’ll attack immediately. It’s time to clean up the northernmost area. If we leave them alone and don’t take care of them, the problem will only grow bigger.","\"At that time, even the civilians might get into trouble. Our soldiers’ military power isn’t just to suppress the enemy. It’s to intimidate those people hiding in the dark like rats.","\"If they extend their hands too far, it’s time to cut off their heads.\"","Xia Jinyuan said calmly. Major general Yang could feel the killing intent coming from him even through the phone.","Han Zheng turned his head silently. He was acting as if he was saying the complete truth.","He couldn’t bear to look at him.","Major General Yang, who couldn’t see Xia Jinyuan’s expression, really thought that he was anxious. He, who was in the capital city, was equally anxious."]},{"number":4475,"title":"Chapter 4475: Alpha","paragraphs":["What was the use of being anxious?","They hadn’t gotten approval yet. He had to calm down even if he was anxious.","There would definitely be violent attacks. Commander Xia had said similar words at the meeting ten minutes ago. However, Commander Xia was more direct. These criminals who were walking on a path of no return should be cleaned up. It would be best if they were wiped out so that they wouldn’t give the local armed police and police a headache in the future.","The entire team had to be wiped out. None of the active criminals could escape. Moreover, they couldn’t be caught. The soldiers would kill everyone they saw to show their country’s determination to clean up the terrorists.","They had already started causing trouble. If the military didn’t do anything, others would think the military didn’t dare to take action.","However, these decisions hadn’t been issued in the form of a document. Major General Yang naturally couldn’t say the word immediately. He said calmly, \"Don’t be anxious, Lieutenant Colonel Xia. Don’t forget that you’re not participating in the battle now. You’re just entering the desert for training. I’ll report this at the meeting and inform you immediately if there’s anything. All you can do now is wait patiently.","\"Also, I’m very confident in the three of them. Since the three of them have already noticed something amiss, it’s not the style of a special forces soldier to sit still and wait for death.\"","Major General Yang was anxious too, but he couldn’t say it out loud.","Three special forces soldiers were ’kidnapped’ by a taxi driver who was suspected of being an outlaw. He didn’t believe that with the soldiers’ abilities, they wouldn’t have discovered the problem long ago!","That wasn’t right. Since he believed that the three special forces soldiers who were ’kidnapped’ had discovered the problem long ago, why was Xia Jinyuan in such a hurry to lead the soldiers to the north?","What was this kid planning?","Based on his understanding of him, it was definitely not a good idea!","Damn it!","He almost got tricked by him!","Major General Yang’s expression turned gloomy instantly. To think that he was still kind enough to comfort Xia Jinyuan and say that he shouldn’t be anxious as the matter would be easy to solve.","What happened in the end?","This kid had other plans!","\"Just you wait!\" Major General Yang gritted his teeth and said fiercely, \"The next time you enter the capital city, see how I’ll deal with you! You lay out traps for me every day!\"","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was digging a hole for his chief, didn’t feel guilty at all. He just sighed over the fact that his chief was getting more and more cunning.","\"You make plans for us too. This is a good opportunity to train our soldiers. I don’t want to waste it. Whether we can succeed or not depends on you. Go back and continue participating in the meeting. I’ll wait for your orders.\"","Lieutenant Colonel Xia ended the call quickly. He was 50% confident that they would participate in this mission. That was enough.","\"You lay out traps for the boss every day. You sure are a prized talent.\" Han Zheng, who had been watching the entire time, gave his bold captain a thumbs-up. \"The boss didn’t get heart disease because of you. That proves how strong he is.\"","He suddenly understood why Commander Xia didn’t stop his only son from becoming a special forces soldier. It was definitely a wise move!","Xia Jinyuan would just cause Commander Xia to have headaches. It was better to chase him out and let him trouble others.","The boss became the victim.","Xia Jinyuan raised his leg and kicked his comrade who was teasing him. When Han Zheng saw this, he smiled and dodged agilely. \"Even if you just want to train your soldiers, you have to see if the higher-ups agree. If they don’t agree, it’s all wishful thinking.\"","\"A 50% chance is enough.\" Xia Jinyuan licked his lips that were dry from the sun and sneered. \"They all say that they’re wunderkinds and prodigy. Let’s see how far they can run. Go, keep an eye on the three’s location. We have to keep an eye on their whereabouts.\"","Han Zheng continued his work. Xia Jinyuan turned on the wireless communication device and said to the veterans nearby, \"There will probably be a new operation. Pack up and leave immediately once the order is given.\""]},{"number":4476,"title":"Chapter 4476: Afraid Of Death","paragraphs":["\"What’s the latest operation?\"","Vice-Captain G3’s voice was the first to be heard. Xia Jinyuan walked out of the camouflage tent and replied as he walked, \"Suppressing bandits. Where are you? We need to discuss something.\"","The veterans who were training with the new recruits had recently lost a few layers of skin on their shoulders and backs. They were obviously suffering, but when they heard that there was a new operation, they were like a withered tree that had come back to life. They were so happy that they seemed to be singing and dancing. There was a ruckus in the channel.","The special forces soldiers who were training were also very excited. They had been in the desert for more than half a month. Every day, they were chased by the veterans. They didn’t seem to be practicing any other skills. Their ability to escape had improved a lot.","Last night, they were chased by the veterans once more. The captain, who always looked like Hades, descended from the sky and stood on a weathered rock. He looked down at them with a wolf-like gaze. \"On the battlefield, your priority is to live. If you live, everything will be easy.","\"The soldiers I want don’t think about sacrificing all day long. If you sacrifice yourself, won’t you be wasting your resources for nothing? Remember, even if you know that you can’t do it, you have to be obedient. Escaping is also a strategy.","\"However, if I see you abandoning your comrades or running away like a headless fly, you might not be able to leave my hands alive even if you come back alive.","\"Escaping is a strategy. The bottom line is that you must not be afraid of death! You can’t escape at the last minute and abandon your comrades!\"","This was the first time this ’wolf’-like captain faced them with a more amiable tone.","There was a round red sunset behind him, emitting blood-like rays. He was wearing a desert combat camouflage uniform as he stood high on top of the weathered rock that might collapse at any moment. The Type 95 rifle was pressed against the back of his leg as he supported himself with one hand. His facial features were blurred by the sun. He looked like a demon who had walked out of the sea of blood. He was so fierce, but he made them feel at ease.","They felt a little awkward in their hearts.","Why did his words always sound so unpleasant?","It was as if he thought that there would be cowards among them who would abandon their comrades and escape.","On the spot, a comrade with the codename ’27’ took the risk of being severely punished and shouted, \"I swear to live and die with my comrades. I’ll never do such a beastly thing as abandoning my comrades!\"","\"That’s right! I won’t do anything beastly!\"","\"Don’t look down on us!\"","\"Q King, wait for us!\"","Their captain personally told them not to call him ’Captain’ because they were not qualified to call him that yet.","The reason was simple. He had yet to personally acknowledge them. No one among them was an official special forces soldier. They were all intern special forces soldiers!","F*ck!","It had been more than two years since they entered the military unit for training. In the end, they were still intern soldiers!","Even if they were furious, they could only accept their fate.","Those who had never been on the battlefield and had never used real guns could not be considered Xia Jinyuan’s soldiers. It was very realistic and cruel. They had nothing to say.","Now, there was a new mission. It was a chance to prove that they had the ability to stay and become a true member of the Xueyu unit!","The veterans were elated. The intern special forces soldiers who were hit by Xia Jinyuan every day were even more surprised.","\"Q King, what about us? Are we on standby?\"","Someone asked carefully and expectantly in the channel. As soon as he said this, the entire channel fell silent.","The sun in the desert was strong, and the wind was strong too. The strong wind slashed across his face, causing him some pain. The sand blew past his eyes, but he didn’t raise his hand to wipe them. He waited for Q King’s reply."]},{"number":4477,"title":"Chapter 4477: Scared?","paragraphs":["A very soft and cold laugh came from the silent channel. The captain, who had already shown them how powerful he was, asked calmly, \"Are you afraid of death?\"","\"I’m afraid of death, but I’m more afraid of letting down this camouflage uniform.\"","The intern soldier answered Xia Jinyuan honestly, \"Everyone is afraid of death. I believe in Q King. I believe that the veterans are the same. We’re afraid of death, so we have to come back alive every time! Just like what Q King said, we can’t waste resources.\"","G3 looked at his captain who was standing beside him. He saw a satisfied smile on his cold face as he got up. In the blink of an eye, he disappeared.","\"Not bad, you have some awareness.\"","Xia Jinyuan replied to this group of ’intern soldiers.’ They were all soldiers in his team and his comrades. He only wanted them to live until they retired. He wanted them to have many children and grandchildren.","Plenty had been sacrificed. These few did not need to contribute to that number.","Hence, they should train well and come back alive.","\"Then can we participate in the mission?\"","\"Looking at your performance, are you all free? Do you want to play hide-and-seek again to stretch your muscles?\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who seemed quite easy to talk to a second ago, instantly became fierce again. After he finished speaking, the veterans and intern soldiers in the channel immediately dispersed. Everyone shut up and stopped asking.","A veteran, who had many years of experience, told the intern soldiers, \"Our captain is famous for being difficult to deal with. The more you ask, the more he won’t say anything. You’re still too inexperienced. Don’t ask too much in the future. He’ll naturally tell you if there’s anything.\"","The intern soldiers nodded obediently. In the desert, the intern soldiers started getting obediently chased around.","Xia Jinyuan was confident that he could train them. If not, he wouldn’t have asked them to pack up in advance and wait for the order.","The atmosphere in the conference room in the military headquarters was quite serious. Everyone present in the conference room had military ranks above two bars. Facing Commander Xia’s instructions, everyone nodded slightly in agreement.","\"Three of our soldiers are suspected to have been kidnapped by a criminal organization. According to the information we have so far, those people are about to launch a new round of riots. Before the riots, our soldiers must wipe out all the members of the criminal organization. In the face of those who destroy the peace of our country, we must use force and show no mercy!\"","In the meeting, Commander Xia conveyed the determination of the leader of the Great Hall. They would not tolerate illegal organizations and would hit them back!","As the military gave the order, Xia Jinyuan quickly received the latest news. They would cooperate with the sixth special forces team of the Frontier Brigade to complete a carpet search in the north and eliminate all the criminals.","\"As you wish, gather!\"","Xia Jinyuan’s cold voice came from the channel. Every word hit the hearts of all the special forces soldiers like bullets.","Including White Crane, Weaver, and Azure Bird, there were a total of 16 people in this training. There were 30 intern soldiers, so there were a total of 46 soldiers.","They had enough ammunition and equipment. They could enter combat preparations in minutes and load their guns and shoot in minutes.","\"Among the outlaws, there are three important targets. If you find them, kill them directly. There’s no need to keep them alive. About 20 outlaw targets are known. All of them are from the northernmost area. They were instigated by three important targets to become members of the outlaw organization. Our main mission is to help the Secret Service Squadron eliminate the outlaws. Do you understand?\"","\"Understood!\" An orderly and powerful voice sounded throughout the desert."]},{"number":4478,"title":"Chapter 4478: Ruthless","paragraphs":["It was useless to only understand. Xia Jinyuan had to let them know that there might be danger next.","Xia Jinyuan took a few steps on the spot. His gaze was like an unsheathed sword as he glanced at all the special forces soldiers in front of him. The strong wind of the Desert carried his bloody voice into all their ears. \"They have illegal guns. The bullets in their guns might hit one of you. If you go in alive now, you might not come back alive. It’s the same for me and the veterans. No one can guarantee that we’ll come back alive.\"","Before the troops were deployed, as the captain, Xia Jinyuan pointed out everything in the war cruelly. It definitely had a certain impact on the intern soldiers who had never carried out a real mission.","That was the truth. Xia Jinyuan couldn’t avoid saying it. Otherwise, they would be the ones killed in the next second.","The veterans rubbed the steel guns in their hands. The intern soldiers had all kinds of expressions on their faces. This was a piece of advice and a warning.","As long as they were on the battlefield, even children would be lethal.","The killing intent of war could be seen everywhere. Since they were intern soldiers on the battlefield, they had to remember it.","\"This operation will blockade the three major areas A, B, and C. No one is allowed to enter or leave the blocked area at will until the end of the mission. During the blockade, bullets and bombs will appear at any time, and you will die at any time. Finally, let me ask you. Are you prepared?\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing under the scorching sun, asked them calmly. Even his voice was very calm. \"If you’re prepared, leave. If you’re not, wait for orders. If you come out with me, I’ll bring you back alive.\"","That day became the most unforgettable day for the intern soldiers. They finally understood why the veterans trusted their captain so much. As it turned out, their captain was not as cruel as he looked.","All his cruelty stemmed from the fact that he wanted all of them to live and come out alive.","No one flinched. They answered their captain with straight backs and fearless eyes.","They were prepared to fight. They were ready to move forward!","\"Let’s go!\"","Under the scorching sun, the young captain gave the order. His voice was sonorous and powerful.","The captain of the Xueyu unit, Xia Jinyuan, also codenamed Q King, led the team to the north at the fastest speed. At the same time, the sixth team of the city of Accra, the Secret Service Squadron, set off.","The Secret Service Squadron of the sixth unit of the city of Accra was a special squadron. All the soldiers fought on the frontlines all year round. They didn’t even remember how many major terrorist incidents they had dealt with.","This was a group of heroes. It was also the group with the highest sacrifice rate. Every time they sent troops, it was a matter of life and death.","The military gave the order to the Xueyu unit that was training in the desert. At the same time, the soldiers of the sixth special forces unit in the city of Accra received the latest order.","They knew that there would be a fierce battle before the captain of the Xueyu unit.","Gripping the steel guns that were loaded with bullets, every secret service soldier ran into the bulletproof truck and set off toward the north.","This time, they would send 50 people for this Class A mission.","Not long after they boarded the bulletproof military transport vehicle, the squadron leader received the latest news. Three special forces soldiers from a certain military unit had been kidnapped to the north by an outlaw disguised as a taxi. Now, the three special forces soldiers who had been kidnapped had become their surveillance for this mission. They could report the latest news to the outside world at any time.","At the same time, they learned that a special forces team that entered the desert for training half a month ago would also be helping them to complete this mission."]},{"number":4479,"title":"Chapter 4479: Beating Up","paragraphs":["At first, the squadron leader had some scruples. He was afraid that these special forces soldiers didn’t have any actual combat experience. When he knew that they were all special forces soldiers who fought on the frontlines and had blood on their hands, the squadron leader felt at ease.","It was good to have help, but they were afraid that the help they received would be inexperienced.","The two groups of soldiers moved towards the north. Ye Jian, Weaver, and White Crane continued moving forward. The scenery on both sides became more and more desolate. In the end... they weren’t even driving on a road anymore.","The car finally stopped. The taxi driver took out a pistol from his pocket and pointed it at White Crane, who was sitting in the front passenger seat. He no longer hid his fierce and cold gaze. \"Get out.\"","The stiff words were heard. White Crane stuck close to the car door. The tall man revealed a ’panic’ that made Ye Jian try her best to hold back her laughter.","The Xueyu unit was a magical special forces unit. Not only could all the special forces soldiers carry guns to kill their enemies, but they could also act... All of them graduated from film school. They were professionals!","At this moment, White Crane... was acting very vividly. He was acting like an ordinary citizen who was shocked at the sight of a gun. From his gaze to the shocked expression on his face, he did not miss a beat. He stuck close to the car door like a frightened bird. At the same time, he started stuttering, \"G-Gun... Gun... F*ck!\"","Weaver, who was beside him, was also shocked and shouted, \"F*ck, a gun!\"","Then... he was so frightened that he didn’t say anything else.","Facing two comrades who seemed to have graduated from the film school, Ye Jian didn’t know how to react.","Should she act like them?","She would be even more unnatural... She really didn’t know how to act.","She was better at being expressionless!","In that case, she would be expressionless.","She hugged her head and asked Weaver shakily, \"What’s wrong... Where are we?\"","She had been sleeping in the car. It was normal for her to ask where they were now.","Chaotic footsteps came from outside the car. Right on the heels of that, someone opened the car door forcefully. It was very rough and aggressive.","\"Get down, get down. All of you, get down!\"","The car door was pulled open forcefully. A pair of hands grabbed Ye Jian’s wrist forcefully and pulled her out of the car.","White Crane and Weaver were the same. They were all pulled out of the car.","A group of men in gray robes and headscarves of the same color surrounded three of them. Ye Jian glanced at them from the corner of her eye. There were seven of them. All of them were holding rifles.","They were all simple, cheap, and ordinary AK-47s. Ye Jian looked at them carefully and realized something. They weren’t the original AK-47s. They were all imitations that could be bought for 100 USD.","Among the seven people, three of them were around 30 to 40 years old, two were around 20 years old, and two... were so young that their faces were immature and their eyes looked fierce. But they were not intimidating at all. They were only 16 or 17 years old.","It was uncertain what kind of ’path of no return’ they had walked on. They held their AK-47s arrogantly. One of them pressed the muzzle of the gun against Weaver’s head and deliberately made a ’bang’ sound to scare him.","Weaver, who graduated from a film academy, was really ’frightened.’ Ye Jian saw his knees give way ,and he fell onto the gravel road.","Weaver’s reaction successfully amused the 16-year-old boy. In the empty mountain, the boy laughed arrogantly. No one knew where he was pointing his gun at. Weaver seemed to be so frightened that his legs went weak, but he was actually a special forces soldier. He was a special forces soldier who had killed countless terrorists."]},{"number":4480,"title":"Chapter 4480: Human Traffickers","paragraphs":["White Crane struggled and shouted, \"What do you want? Let me go! Let me go!\"","\"Behave yourself and don’t move!\"","His struggle was exchanged for a beating from the three criminals. He used the butt of the replica AK-47 in his hand to hit White Crane’s back. Weaver roared angrily, \"Let go of my friend, let go of him! Mphm...\"","A young man revealed a strange and fierce smile. His eyes were clearly beautiful, like the light blue of the sky at this moment. However, the actions he did were so fierce that they destroyed the clarity in his eyes.","He used the muzzle of his gun to hit Weaver’s abdomen. It wasn’t just once. He hit Weaver again and again. \"Shut up, disgusting fellow!\"","He spoke fiercely in the local language. Weaver arched his back and let out a pained sound before retracting his hand reluctantly. A middle-aged man with a long beard beside him laughed and patted the young man’s shoulder. He muttered a few words and took out a handful of money and handed it to the young man.","Ye Jian and Weaver didn’t understand. White Crane heard everything clearly. Because he heard everything clearly, White Crane narrowed his eyes with a calm facial expression.","F*ck!","Something was wrong!","These violent people were violent, but it wasn’t these violent people who were kidnapping them. It was... Damn it, human traffickers!","Human traffickers?","He, Azure Bird, and Weaver were... being trafficked by human traffickers?","Ye Jian and Weaver were dumbfounded.","What did they mean by paying?","What did the taxi driver mean by thanking them?","Why couldn’t they figure it out?","Guns and money... For the first time, Ye Jian felt that her IQ was insufficient!","\"Why did they pay? What did they say just now?\" Weaver, who had fallen to the ground, asked his comrade, White Crane. Only White Crane, who could understand the local language, could answer.","\"Would you believe me if I said that we were kidnapped by human traffickers?\"","White Crane said with a blank expression.","...","The air between the three of them froze and hit their faces one after another... It hurt!","\"I was kidnapped by human traffickers?\" Weaver, who had been beaten until the corner of his mouth was bleeding, asked with a straight face.","White Crane nodded. \"That’s right. My condolences.\"","Ye Jian looked at the two of them and closed her eyes. She whispered, \"It’s a little embarrassing, comrade.\"","A little embarrassing? No, no, no! It was so embarrassing that the two of them even thought of retiring!","Special forces soldiers were kidnapped by human traffickers?","Wasn’t it embarrassing?","Wasn’t it embarrassing?","Ye Jian continued, \"Since they’re human traffickers, why do they have guns? And there are two groups of people.\"","Weaver’s eyes lit up. That was right! He was so focused on the ’human traffickers’ that he forgot that there was a group of people with guns.","\"Yes, they’re human traffickers and outlaws. Hence, it’s not too embarrassing.\" White Crane comforted the two of them. \"Do you feel better?\"","Yes, they were feeling better!","They had returned to Earth from hell.","Weaver heaved a sigh of relief and said to Ye Jian, \"I’ve never hoped to meet a group of real outlaws as much as now.\"","\"It takes one to know one.\" Ye Jian came back with lingering fear.","White Crane nodded slightly in agreement.","The three of them didn’t think about their own safety when they faced the gun-wielding violent man in front of them. Instead, they thought about how they hadn’t embarrassed themselves. It could be said that they were strange and different.","The taxi driver took the money and patted the shoulder of the young man with the gun. He said a few words in a low voice. The young man nodded and replied."]},{"number":4481,"title":"Chapter 4481: Embarrassing","paragraphs":["The taxi driver walked to a few other locals who were holding guns and said something to them. They nodded to show that they understood.","The taxi driver didn’t stay for long. He spoke to the middle-aged man in the lead and stared coldly at the three people he brought over. Soon, he drove away.","The middle-aged man patted the young man’s shoulder and smiled. \"You’re a warrior. Your family should be proud of you.\"","The young man immediately stopped looking fierce and became extremely pious. He knelt on the ground and seemed to worship devoutly toward the northernmost point.","His pious worship was praised by the adults. The middle-aged man took the opportunity to lecture another young man. Ye Jian and Weaver couldn’t understand him because of their language barrier. White Crane, who was the only one who could understand, had a cold glint in his eyes.","His pious worship was praised by the adults. The middle-aged man took the opportunity to lecture another young man. Ye Jian and Weaver couldn’t understand him because of their language barrier. White Crane, who was the only one who could understand, had a cold glint in his eyes.","In order to achieve their ulterior motives, these people would bewitch the youngsters at any time and place. They would use violence and killing as an access pass to heaven so that the youngsters could become tools in their hands and commit heinous crimes without any scruples.","They didn’t do good, nor did they stop evil. They were brainwashed by extreme thoughts and became machines that didn’t have their own thoughts. Those people could create killing machines at any time.","The young man’s future was no longer carefree. It was no longer clear. There was only grayness and blood-red killing intent. Yet, he was proud of it.","White Crane narrowed his eyes and clenched his fists. He would remember this middle-aged man who bewitched the young man.","In order to prove that he had a brave heart, the young man kicked Weaver, who resisted the most violently just now, to prove himself to the middle-aged man.","Weaver didn’t retaliate. His hands were clasped behind his back, and he stood with his back arched, allowing the young man to do whatever he wanted. The young man’s fists hit his face, and blood flowed out from the corner of his mouth. He kicked Weaver’s legs and abdomen again and again. Just from the sound, one could tell how strong he was.","Weaver didn’t resist and only avoided getting his vital points hit as he struggled. He hid his bloodlust of a special forces soldier, making everyone think that the three of them were ordinary tourists.","As for their camouflage bags, they threw them on the ground the second before they boarded the car. They didn’t bring their bags with them at all.","Ye Jian looked at the young man who had completely lost his conscience. There was a bone-chilling coldness in her eyes. She was the victim of this transaction and a witness to evil. Next, she would be the executor of evil.","The young man beat up Weaver for at least five minutes before the middle-aged man stopped him. At this moment, Weaver and White Crane seemed to have been frightened and didn’t dare to struggle anymore.","There was no turning back. They had to see this till the end.","Ye Jian’s chin was grabbed forcefully, and she was forced to raise her head. She saw in the other party’s eyes that she was sized up like a good. They wanted to see if she was cheap or expensive.","She should be worth some money. The other party nodded in satisfaction and said a lot to the two people holding her. She became the only one who didn’t get beaten up.","White Crane’s fingers, which were tied behind his back, touched Ye Jian’s tied hands. His slender fingers drew lightly on her fingers.","\"There’s another deal to kidnap us. Before the deal is completed, we shouldn’t be in danger. Don’t worry, with Weaver and me around, nothing will happen.\""]},{"number":4482,"title":"Chapter 4482: Find","paragraphs":["Ye Jian lowered her eyes and listened to these people speaking in a language she couldn’t understand. She understood what they said through White Crane’s translation.","She moved her fingers slightly and replied to White Crane by writing the words, \"We’ll be fine.\"","Nothing would happen to them. The problem was this group of criminals.","A gunman left. Soon, he drove over an old pickup truck and urged the three of them into the pickup truck. The journey was bumpy as they continued to the north.","If they continued north, they would enter the northernmost hinterland. If they continued north, they would reach the border and enter other countries’ territory.","There were no roads for cars to pass through in the northernmost hinterland. They followed the weathered dirt roads that were filled with gravel. This was the path that led to the northernmost hinterland and the dangerous centers where mountains and steep ridges were hidden.","There was almost no greenery in the northernmost part. All they could see were gray mountains. The trees that grew in the mountains were short and sparse. Even their leaves were grayish-white. The sky was clear and the mountains were gray. These two completely different colors painted the most beautiful scenery.","The three of them were tied up like livestock in the middle of the back compartment. The outlaws holding guns were sitting around them. Their fierce and cold gazes would sweep across them from time to time to prevent the three of them from escaping.","At the same time, the two cleaners at the airport handed the three camouflage bags that had been thrown on the ground one and a half hours ago to the front desk of the airport service.","It was common to lose luggage at the airport. Without thinking too much, the front desk staff opened the bags and tried to find the information of the passengers who lost their luggage.","After they took out three identification documents from the three bags, the front desk staff looked at them for a while before contacting the security center through the intercom to report this matter.","There were two military IDs, one military school student ID, three desert combat camouflage uniforms, three pairs of rubber military boots, and three plane tickets.","The highly vigilant security staff immediately handed it over to the airport police. As soldiers, it was impossible for them to be so careless that they lost their luggage. Moreover, all three of them lost their luggage at the same time.","They had to have done it on purpose.","Why did they do it on purpose?","A policeman recognized the three people on the identification document and asked the staff member they found the bags. He used his fastest speed to check the surveillance cameras at that time to look for clues.","Recently, the city of Accra had been very chaotic. Almost all the police had been mobilized. Even the soldiers of the armed police unit were patrolling in plain clothes, especially at the location where the traffic was concentrated.","Now, three soldiers suddenly appeared and lost their luggage at the same time. When the police saw their luggage, they immediately realized that something was wrong.","The surveillance footage was quickly retrieved. The three of them met in the airport lobby and walked out together.","\"Check Camera No. 6...¦\"","When the person-in-charge of the security center saw the two of them walking out of the lobby door, he immediately knew which surveillance cameras outside were filming at a closer distance.","The footage from that particular surveillance camera was pulled out immediately. In less than a minute, they saw three figures. A taxi stopped. The first time they tried to open the door, it was locked. Through the surveillance footage, the police could tell that the three soldiers were suspicious.","The taxi didn’t drive away immediately. After about ten seconds, the soldiers were let in and the car drove away.","The man in the front passenger seat moved his right hand. The male and female soldiers in the back nodded at almost the same time as if they were communicating.","\"They must’ve realized that something was amiss. The officer in the front passenger seat reminded his comrades in the back.\"","\"They’re very vigilant, but why did they still get in when they knew that there was a problem? If only they had informed the duty point at that time. They could have subdued the driver immediately.\"","\"They could clearly subdue the driver, but they didn’t do anything or ask for help. It’s very likely that they discovered something and pretended to not know anything.\""]},{"number":4483,"title":"Chapter 4483: Chase Through The City","paragraphs":["Looking at the surveillance footage, a few serious police officers lowered their heads and discussed.","The soldiers got into the car and closed the door. The bags that were supposed to be brought into the car were put aside. The soldiers were not worried that others would take them away!","Through the footage, the police could confirm that the three soldiers had discovered that something was wrong with the driver. Three seconds before they got into the car, they secretly communicated with each other. They even threw their bags aside and left.","\"Immediately pull out the driver’s personal information and contact the traffic police to lock onto the car. Track it through the entire city!\"","The police officers took action immediately after seeing the surveillance footage. They couldn’t delay any longer.","During this special period, the city police of Accra, who were already very fast at carrying out their duties, became even faster this time. From the moment they locked onto the car information to the moment they discovered the car, it took less than half an hour. When they found out that the car was heading to the northernmost part, the police officer in charge of this matter felt his heart turn cold.","The northernmost part... was a forbidden place.","This headache didn’t last long. The police, who knew about this matter, received the latest news that a certain special forces squadron had already taken action. The three soldiers had indeed gotten into the car on purpose, and the military had also taken action.","The police officers who received the latest news heaved a sigh of relief. They really didn’t want to let the situation worsen.","Now, those people were bold enough to drive to the airport to kidnap people. They even kidnapped three soldiers. But they wouldn’t be arrogant for long. There would be results in three days at most.","The bags that were intentionally lost would be handed over to the police. They would be returned after the three soldiers returned.","The time was 12:00 pm. The sun was scorching their arms. The five bulletproof military transport vehicles drove on the bumpy road, causing gravel to fly. The wheels rolled up waves of dust and flew dozens of meters away in the blink of an eye.","The drivers were all veterans of the Xueyu unit. Their driving skills were all top-notch. They could even drive steadily on the Tibetan road, let alone the bordering town.","The performance of the bulletproof military trucks was not bad. It was far more comfortable to sit in it than a regular truck. The 13 veterans led the 30 new recruits to the north. They followed Weaver’s location the entire time. Their direction was quite accurate.","The sixth secret service squadron of the city of Accra also moved forward according to the location provided by Weaver. The two teams headed to the gathering point at their fastest speed.","The northernmost terrain was especially complicated. The gray mountains and precipitous ridges were like dragons lying dormant. During the day, the mountains and rivers were magnificent and shocking. In the night, the starry sky was vast. Every star was extremely resplendent.","There were few people here, and traffic was limited. The ethnic minorities living here were almost isolated from the world. They had also become a piece of juicy meat in the eyes of foreign forces.","In the car, Xia Jinyuan, who had his eyes closed, seemed to have fallen asleep. No matter how bumpy the ride was, he didn’t open his eyes. V8, who was driving, held the steering wheel with both hands and stepped on the accelerator as he led the way.","After departing from the desert, they finally arrived at a gravel road not far away from their destination at 3:00 pm.","For safety reasons, all the vehicles here couldn’t continue moving. The soldiers came down and entered the northernmost combat area on foot.","The sixth special forces squadron arrived an hour earlier than the Xueyu unit. They even disguised their bulletproof military truck and waited for the Xueyu unit members to arrive.","\"Captain, five cars, complete.\"","The secret service officers hiding in the mountain saw five bulletproof trucks that were the same as theirs but of different colors. They were being driven like sports cars. The speed was exciting.","\"Should we continue watching for a bit before stepping out?\"","A secret service officer said in a low voice. It was obvious that he had some doubts about the special forces soldiers who came to support them. This was not the mainland. Special forces soldiers who did not participate in live ammunition defense had to lie low here.","\"Everyone, get out. We’ll know at a glance.\""]},{"number":4484,"title":"Chapter 4484: A Group Of Heroes","paragraphs":["The platoon leader, who had served for 14 years, was a member of the Cole family. His name was a little long. He couldn’t even count how many terrorist missions he had participated in.","Half of the officers in the six teams were locals. This time, more than half of the 50 officers were dispatched. There were as many as 35 local officers.","Five of the 50 people stayed behind to guard the area. The other 45 people walked out of the hiding spot as the five bulletproof trucks got closer and closer. They stood in two teams and waited for the special forces soldiers who were participating in this mission to get off.","The secret service officer, who was standing in a wide field of vision, quickly appeared in the vision of V8, who was driving. He stared at the figure that appeared in front of him and called out to Xia Jinyuan, who had been resting with his eyes closed, \"Q King, they’re truly deserving of their title.\"","They were still a hundred meters away, but he could already feel the killing intent coming at him.","Xia Jinyuan, who had opened his eyes, sat up straight. As the truck drove closer and closer to the line in front, he felt the aura of these comrades from a different system.","This secret service unit was indeed admirable. They were at the frontline of the anti-terrorist team in the country. They were sent out all year round and never rested. There engaged in more battles than the Xueyu unit.","The Xueyu unit was responsible for external counter-terrorism while they were responsible for domestic counter-terrorism.","\"There are no cowards in the most dangerous squadron. There are sacrifices almost every year. I’m afraid they won’t look up to us for the time being.\"","Before they met, the other party would definitely look down on them. Xia Jinyuan wouldn’t think too much about it.","He turned on the communication device, and his cold voice entered everyone’s ears. \"Everyone, prepare to get out of the car. Stay alert. Don’t embarrass yourselves outside.\"","After the order was given, the five cars were not far away from the secret service team standing in front.","The bulletproof military transport trucks stopped five meters away. Xia Jinyuan opened the door and got out of the truck first. Then, the tail door of the truck opened, and the soldiers gathered at the fastest speed.","The trucks were at the back while the soldiers were in front. The special forces soldiers in combat uniform stood on the gravel ground with a murderous aura. They were like a steel city wall with an oppressive aura.","\"You have some talent. It looks like you do have some experience.\"","\"It’s good that you have some information. The three combat police areas, A, B, and C, have a wide range. We can’t leak any information. It’s good that you have experience. You won’t drag us down.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit sized up the secret service officers. The secret service officers standing opposite them sized them up too. As they spoke in low voices, joy gradually appeared in their eyes.","They thought that the soldiers sent by the military were all from the city’s counter-terrorism special forces unit. It wasn’t that they had any opinions about the city’s counter-terrorism special forces unit, but they were different. Their combat tactics were different too.","Now, when they saw dozens of camouflage figures carrying guns on one shoulder and walking over in an orderly manner, the first-tier counter-terrorist officers knew that they had been wrong.","The soldiers sent by the military were all filled with killing intent!","The platoon leader of the sixth team heaved a sigh of relief. When he knew that the military had sent special forces soldiers to help, he was half happy and half worried. He was happy that there were reinforcements, but he was worried that they might have different combat tactics. How could they adapt to combat in the mountains?","At this moment, he was as happy as he was worried earlier.","The bloody killing intent that assaulted their faces couldn’t fool anyone. It was the aura of a soldier who had blood on their hands.","Their gazes were very sharp, like a bullet that shot straight between people’s eyebrows. Every step they took was as steady as a mountain, like a longsword being unsheathed.","The two captains shook hands and introduced themselves briefly. They greeted each other amiably and then shook hands with the others. Then, they split the work and worked together to formulate their own strategy."]},{"number":4485,"title":"Chapter 4485: Leading Soldiers","paragraphs":["It was obvious that the special forces of the Xueyu unit were experts. Just the equipment they took out made the secret service officers click their tongues.","Wireless communication, satellite navigation, infrared equipment... It would be a lie to say that the secret service officers were not envious. They were far inferior to the special forces sent by the military.","From their equipment, one could tell that they were a frontline combat unit. The 13 of them were like leopards that had been released from their cages. When they unintentionally looked at each other, they could see the terrifying killing intent in each other’s eyes.","Before the combat deployment, Xia Jinyuan briefly introduced their identities. After all, this combat deployment was commanded by the secret service team. The Xueyu unit was only there to help.","As a special forces unit that covered all aspects of terrain combat, they were all focused on eliminating the roots of the problem. Hence, it was not suitable for this kind of search combat. The captain of the sixth secret service squadron only listened to a few sentences, and his eyes were already filled with admiration.","As a first-tier counter-terrorist combat team, the Xueyu unit’s coverage was wider than the secret service team. They had been seen in Yunnan, Tibet, and the southern border.","\"According to our current location, the three kidnapped soldiers have arrived at the combat area at point A in the northernmost hinterland. There are a lot of illegal weapons in this combat area. Be careful of cold guns during the process.","\"Our mission this time is very different from the past. We need to get close to the area and fight. Not everyone in the combat area is useless. You’re not suitable to be the vanguard. The vanguard will be our sixth secret service team. You’ll surround them and fight. How about that?\"","The captain of the secret service would ask Xia Jinyuan before deploying every time. He wouldn’t make a decision immediately.","After all, they were from different systems. The sixth secret service squadron belonged to the armed police system that combated internally, while the Xueyu unit soldiers were from the army that combated externally. The system was different, so it was better to be humble.","Xia Jinyuan had no objections. The Xueyu unit didn’t have much experience in counter-terrorism. In addition, they brought intern soldiers over to train. They would help the secret service the entire time and not turn the tables.","He nodded and said, \"I have no objections. Our team will follow the arrangements.\"","\"Alright, I’ll be in charge. Thank you for your cooperation.\"","With his deep facial features, it was obvious that the platoon leader was local. When he saw Xia Jinyuan’s attitude, he revealed a faint smile with a serious expression. The military comrades respected their arrangements, which would save a lot of trouble.","The squadron leader’s Mandarin was a little inaccurate, but it didn’t affect communication. The local officers who carried out missions together could speak Mandarin. They were all locals who joined the team for peace and stability. They weren’t afraid of death.","The map was spread out. The squadron leader started setting up as quickly as possible. Z7 kept an eye on Weaver’s location.","The three combat areas were locked down. In order to prevent the three combat areas from being illegally connected and thus leading to the failure of the operation, they entered the three A, B, and C combat areas in three batches and moved together.","Based on his many years of combat experience in counter-terrorism, the squadron leader of the secret service told them in advance about the dangers that might happen so that the soldiers of the special forces who were supporting them would be mentally prepared.","The veterans knew what to do. This was the first time the intern soldiers were taking on a mission, though. They held the steel guns in their hands tightly and listened attentively. The sun started to set in the west. After careful combat arrangements, the secret service squadron and the special forces unit were split into three teams. They advanced toward the three combat areas.","Xia Jinyuan divided the intern soldiers into three groups. The veterans led the combat while he participated in rescuing Weaver, White Crane, and Azure Bird."]},{"number":4486,"title":"Chapter 4486: Offshore Attack","paragraphs":["This was a fierce battle. However, compared to the missions the veterans carried out in the past, it wasn’t a dangerous battle. After all, it was just peripheral support. There was no need to fight in depth.","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t worried about the veterans. He was mainly worried about the intern soldiers. Although they didn’t need to go into deep combat, they were still using live ammunition.","No matter how worried he was, he had to let them take on the mission. It had been two years. It was time for them to graduate!","Han Zheng, who was staring at the location, saw that the red dot had finally stopped moving. He moved to the side of a secret service officer and lowered his body. \"Our comrades have entered Combat A. The distance is 37 kilometers.\"","The officer glanced at Han Zheng and said in a low voice in surprise, \"How did you know that I’m a communication soldier?\" They hadn’t even introduced themselves. How could the military brothers tell?","Han Zheng replied, \"I observed with my eyes. Come, let’s see if this is one of the combat areas that needs to be cleared.\"","The officer didn’t ask Han Zheng how he could tell that he was a communication soldier in the team. He took a look and nodded. \"That’s right. They’ve indeed entered our combat area. As long as the positioning remains, we can find them immediately.\"","\"Can you drive?\" Han Zheng asked again.","It would take at least four hours to travel 37 kilometers. Four hours was a little long! This kind of matter needed to be solved as soon as possible.","\"We can use the vehicle, but it’s inconvenient. We’re mainly worried about the covert sentries. If they discover us, they’ll slip away faster than rabbits. We won’t be able to catch them.\"","The officer’s reply made Han Zheng frown. Xia Jinyuan, who was talking to the captain of the secret service squadron, said in a low voice, \"Since it’s inconvenient to drive, let’s just walk.\"","After he finished speaking, he turned his head and asked Han Zheng loudly, \"Where’s the location displayed?\"","\"Report!\" Han Zheng jogged over with his military portable laptop. \"It’s 37 kilometers away from us. We can take a vehicle over, but to prevent any hidden traps, we should walk.\"","The captain of the secret service squadron pointed at the location with a serious expression. \"The terrain in this area is complicated. 370 kilometers deeper and it’s the more complicated Isu area. Cross the Ukersh River and they can escape from the border.","\"To prevent them from escaping the border, we need to hurry.\"","37 kilometers of walking would take at least four hours. Four hours... They would have to see how Weaver, White Crane, and Azure Bird dealt with the situation. With their abilities, their escape skills were top-notch. If something really happened... they could at least escape.","If there were no other combat areas B and C, Xia Jinyuan would definitely choose to drive into combat area A.","After confirming the combat plan again, both sides immediately moved forward on foot.","Xia Jinyuan wanted to let the intern soldiers practice as soon as possible, while the secret service officers wanted to get rid of all the targets as soon as possible to prevent any accidents from happening.","However, at four o’clock in the afternoon, an hour after the two parties met up, Weaver’s location started to change. Z7 was shocked.","\"Q King, the location has changed. The location has changed!\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was walking, shouted, \"Reposition!\"","Reposition... Thinking of going further into the borders of other countries, Xia Jinyuan was worried that internal combat would become overseas combat!","The sudden change caught everyone off guard. They didn’t expect it to happen.","Looking at the rapidly changing position in the north, the secret service officers, who were only in charge of counter-terrorism, started to frown.","The commander in charge of combat area A said to Xia Jinyuan, \"If we keep moving north, we might cross the border. We can’t cross borders to fight. Once we enter other countries’ territory, you can only rely on yourselves to rescue them.\"","With the veterans of the Xueyu unit, overseas combat wouldn’t be a big deal.","The main problem was that the only veterans around Xia Jinyuan were E6 and Z7. The other ten were intern soldiers."]},{"number":4487,"title":"Chapter 4487: Missing","paragraphs":["It was difficult to focus on gathering the veterans now. The secret service squadron’s combat deployment had to be rearranged. There was only one best solution now—solve all the hidden dangers in combat area A and drive to catch up.","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t lead the team to chase after Ye Jian and the other two immediately. If they wanted to leave, the secret service squadron team would have to reorganize their combat deployment. Not only would it waste manpower and resources, but it would also make the entire combat plan fail.","They could only cooperate with the secret service squadron to clear combat area A first before driving over. If they delayed for too long, they would have to ask the Army Aviation for help.","Soon, G3, K7, and the other veterans who split up knew that Azure Bird and the other two were not in combat area A. Instead, they were continuing north. It was very likely that they would leave the border.","After knowing this news, the expressions of all the veterans changed. Xia Jinyuan, who was contacting the veterans who were fighting separately through the satellite phone, said in a low voice, \"The three of them might have to enter the territory of Gistan. We can’t rule out the possibility that we’ll have to enter the territory of Gistan with them.\"","The latest news was reported to Major General Yang. Major General Yang, who answered the call in the office, gripped the phone so hard that it almost cracked. \"Okay, you’ll assist the secret service squadron in completing the combat now. I’ll contact the Army Aviation first. After you assist in the mission, you’ll immediately catch up with the three of them by helicopter. The military will contact the various border defense outposts and complete the interception!\"","If they really entered Gistan, the three of them, who didn’t have any defensive weapons on them, would be entering a tiger’s den without any reinforcements. The danger factor would soar. They couldn’t continue moving forward. They had to be stopped.","However, there was another problem. If the three special forces soldiers chose to follow the extremists into the territory of Gistan...","After ending the call, Major General Yang’s expression was a little dark. If that was the case, it could be seen that the three of them must have discovered clues that were closely related to their country. Would the border defense soldiers still be able to intercept them?","Major General Yang, who was halfway through the call, slowly put down the receiver. He contacted Xia Jinyuan again and told him the problems he had analyzed just now.","Xia Jinyuan, who was still moving, remained silent for a while. His gaze was as sharp as a blade. \"If that’s the case, our border defense doesn’t have to complete the interception and might even let them pass. The three of them will enter the territory of Gistan to gather information. Then, I’ll bring my troops in and clear all the uncertain factors that will destroy the stability of our border!\"","This would be another overseas combat.","Major General Yang thought for a moment and nodded. \"I’ll send the approval immediately. You can assist the secret service squadron in completing the combat in the various areas first!\"","\"I understand!\"","Xia Jinyuan’s last reply solidified the decision to engage in overseas combat.","The battlefield changed instantly. Even if the plan was flawless, something might happen.","For instance, everything was clearly arranged for this combat, but the kidnapped soldiers’ position had changed, which forced them to arrange follow-up combat plans.","Major General Yang moved very quickly. He first contacted the Army Aviation and then contacted the various border defense outposts. At the outpost closest to Gistan, Major General Yang received an important piece of news.","At the border, herdsmen went missing four days ago. Their family asked the soldiers at the outpost for help at 3:00 pm yesterday. The outpost sent soldiers into the Tianshan Mountains to look for the four missing herdsmen.","Missing people at the border, kidnapping at the airport, going to the border... What if the four missing herdsmen were kidnapped by extremists and entered the territory of Gistan?","What if the three kidnapped special forces soldiers had no choice but to enter the territory of Gistan?"]},{"number":4488,"title":"Chapter 4488: Huge Net","paragraphs":["The news reported by the outpost made Major General Yang’s facial expression turn colder and colder. If that was the case, the three kidnapped special forces soldiers would definitely choose to enter the territory of Gistan!","Ye Jian, Weaver, and White Crane, who were chased out of the car, were exposed to the sun for an hour. They saw the two young men carrying a bucket of oil. The faint smell of it floated over, making their hearts sink.","Ye Jian watched as they poured gasoline into the fuel tank of the car. She pursed her lips that were dry from the sun. \"It looks like we still need to continue taking the car. If we go further north, I’m afraid we won’t be far from the border. What do they want to do by bringing us to the border?\"","Ye Jian couldn’t guess what was going on.","\"Do you want to continue pretending?\" Weaver didn’t want to go along with this anymore. It was fine if he knew what they wanted to do, but now, he was completely confused. They even had the female soldier, Azure Bird, beside them. If they continued, he was really worried that it would be more and more disadvantageous for them to escape.","\"We have to follow them closely. They wouldn’t just kidnap the three of us. There must be others. We have to figure out their goal.\" White Crane didn’t plan to give up. The more he couldn’t figure it out, the more it meant that the problem was serious.","Human traffickers, kidnappers, extremists, money transactions... This was like an invisible huge net. If this net wasn’t torn apart, other people would definitely suffer.","Ye Jian agreed to continue with the act. Her thoughts were the same as White Crane’s.","From 6:50 am till 4:00 pm, she had been acting with these people for more than nine hours. Since she was already in character, she might as well find the truth!","However, there was still a problem. Ye Jian’s throat was so dry that it burned. She said hoarsely, \"There’s another possibility. If we’re kidnapped and brought into the territory of Gistan, what will we do?\"","\"That’ll be a good thing. When Q King discovers that the three of us are heading to the border, he’ll also guess that we’ll enter the territory of Gistan. The border outpost has entered Class A security. We can choose to escape. If nothing happens, we can choose to follow them into the territory of Gistan.\"","It had to be said that the chemistry that they had cultivated after fighting together for so many years, as well as the chemistry between the entire Xueyu unit and Major General Yang, was astonishing. There was no communication, but based on the chemistry that they had cultivated over the years, the problems they thought of were almost synchronized.","Ye Jian didn’t raise any more questions. The three of them continued to pretend that they were powerless to retaliate and chose to wait and see.","The pickup truck started moving again. The three of them, who had been exposed to the sun, resumed their journey. As the engine of the truck rumbled, it continued driving along the riverbed into the depths of Tianshan Mountain.","On the other side of the river was a small village. That was the secret service squadron combat area.","The pickup truck drove for about an hour from the riverbed to a road paved with stones. When they saw the numbers on the road and realized that they were about to reach the boundary point, the three soldiers exchanged glances.","Whether they wanted to follow these people into Gistan would depend on the sentinels’ vigilance!","The Ukersh River was at the northernmost border. There was a steel bridge on the river. On this side of the steel bridge was China’s territory, and on the other side was the Gistan border.","White Crane raised his eyes slightly and looked at the tall mountains that were going past him. Then, he looked at the few people who were sleeping soundly. He said softly, \"The border defense company is more than 700 kilometers away from the city of Accra. The border defense company is a seasonal sentry post. Beyond that is the border of Gistan. Prepare to illegally enter another country.\""]},{"number":4489,"title":"Chapter 4489: The Bandits’ Den","paragraphs":["When Weaver heard the words ’border defense company,’ he quickly said, \"It’s the old company that you served in the army. It’s a good time to revisit this place to see if there are any changes.\"","White Crane was more familiar with this place than Ye Jian and Weaver. Before he joined the Xueyu unit, he served in the border defense company in 1996. He only joined the Xueyu unit after passing the selection.","Many years had passed. Unexpectedly, he might appear in the border defense company again.","As for the changes... White Crane looked into the distance. The changes were too big. Back then, when he was in the border defense company, there wasn’t such a wide road. There was only a very wide dirt road.","The road to the border was much smoother and wider now. The biggest change was the increase in the military strength at the border. Those criminals who once crossed the mountains and entered China’s territory were basically unable to return.","The pickup truck was still moving. On the other hand, the intern soldiers led by Xia Jinyuan finally had their first live combat. They helped the secret service squadron to clear the combat area.","From 5:00 pm to 11:00 pm, the three combat areas A, B, and C entered a comprehensive clean-up stage. Ye Jian and the other two were getting closer and closer to the border. At 1:00 am, the clearing of the three combat areas ended. Z7 would send their location back to the military right before entering Gistan, which was when he would cut off their location tracking.","Ye Jian, Weaver, and White Crane were escorted by seven extremists. They crossed the nameless mountain range and left China’s territory, entering the territory of Gistan.","Ye Jian had gone overseas through abnormal means twice. Once, it was when she went to rescue K7. This time, she left the country illegally.","At 2:00 am, a transport plane sent by the Army Aviation took 46 special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit and flew to the border between China and Gistan.","At 3:00 am, after walking for nearly four hours, they finally arrived outside the skyline where towering mountains stood on both sides and there was only a narrow path in the middle. This place belonged to the territory of Gistan.","It was also a must-cross point to enter the gang’s den.","The Republic of Gistan, which was established in 1991, was a landlocked country in Central Asia. It covered an area of 199,900 square kilometers. The Tianshan Mountains and the Pamir-Arai Mountains were located at the edge of the Central Auspicious Region. Ye Jian and the rest had crossed the Tianshan Mountains and entered the country.","It was very cold in the mountains at night, and the night sky was exceptionally clear. When they raised their heads to look at the night sky, they could even see a resplendent Milky Way. The stars were so big that it seemed like they could be plucked right out of the sky.","Ye Jian had just raised her head to look at the night sky when a strong wind came from behind. Ye Jian knew that a foreign object was about to hit her back, but she didn’t dodge and endured it.","The person hit Ye Jian with the butt of a gun, and it was the young man from before. Ye Jian staggered forward and was kicked down again.","\"Sit down, sit down! If you move, I’ll beat you to death!\"","The middle-aged man in the lead, who could speak in Mandarin, held a gun to Ye Jian’s head. He used Ye Jian as a bargaining chip and threatened Weaver and White Crane to sit down obediently. If they dared to run around, he would shoot the three of them.","The young man with the gun was even more brutal than everyone else. He hit White Crane’s abdomen with the butt of the gun and said stiffly, \"Sit down, sit down!\"","This punishment was nothing to White Crane. He would feel such pain even during normal training.","The three of them, who were drenched in sweat, sat down obediently with their backs facing each other. They wanted to get closer so that they could communicate.","\"They said we’ve reached. It looks like this is the bandits’ den.\" White Crane was the first to speak. \"Among the seven of them, there are people from Gistan. The middle-aged man who’s leading the entire process might be an extremely evil person from Gistan.\""]},{"number":4490,"title":"Chapter 4490: Bleeding","paragraphs":["\"But why do they kneel and worship?\" Weaver gritted his teeth and asked Ye Jian worriedly, \"How’s your back? Does it hurt a lot?\"","Although her hands were tied behind her back, Ye Jian could still move her shoulders. \"I’m fine. It’s just a little painful. We’re entering Gistan now. It’ll be a little difficult for Captain Xia and the rest to sneak over.\"","White Crane was very convinced by the young captain who was two years younger than him. He smiled softly and said, \"With him around, there won’t be any difficulties. They’ve always been tracking us down. It’s just a matter of time before he finds us.","\"Before he finds us, we have to protect ourselves. Now that we’re here, it’s a little difficult to escape.\"","They had probably entered Gistan. The seven of them were not as vigilant against the three of them. They stood nearly three meters apart, making it very convenient for the three of them to communicate secretly.","\"I don’t want to escape now. I just want to know why they kidnapped us!\" Weaver frowned. His voice was filled with anger. \"They kidnapped us overseas. How big of a game do they want to play?\"","The Republic of Gistan was a country with many extremists. From time to time, they would cause riots in the city, especially when it came to the election of a new president. The extremist would be even more active then.","The election... Weaver narrowed her eyes and asked Ye Jian, \"Have you watched the new presidential election in Gistan?\"","\"I have. It’s still ongoing. There’s a huge commotion in a few cities because of the election.\" Military school students would pay attention to this kind of news. Ye Jian was no exception.","As she spoke, Ye Jian seemed to understand something. She frowned and said, \"Are you saying that our kidnapping has something to do with the election? The connection is very far-fetched.\"","\"If the middle-aged man is an extremely evil person, it wouldn’t be far-fetched for him to kidnap us to create a commotion and frame our country.\"","Their many years of chemistry allowed White Crane to immediately grasp the point that Weaver wanted to express. A mess couldn’t just be a mess. There were often political factors involved.","The extremists of the Republic of Gistan had always wanted to infiltrate their country, but they had always been captured and killed by their country. After a long time, they had long harbored resentment.","Now, the Republic of Gistan was in the midst of an election. If they kidnapped a few Chinese citizens and caused a commotion in the city, they would be able to slander the Chinese through the news media.","\"If they really want to do this, we don’t mind letting them see blood in Gistan.\" After Weaver finished speaking, a sharp whistle sounded from the front. About ten seconds later, the whistle echoed from inside.","Damn, this was a secret signal!","Weaver spat coldly. Right on the heels of that, the three of them got up and walked out with guns pointed at their heads again.","After walking for a while, Ye Jian saw a brightly lit village at the foot of the mountain. It was the border village of the Republic of Gistan. It was not much different from the border village in China.","The people living at the border of the two countries were all of Hanu and Ker ethnicities. They spoke the same language and drank water from the snow mountains of Tianshan. Their living habits and religious beliefs were the same. In the 1950s, the Hanu and Ker people in China could still enter this place to live and marry.","From the top of the mountain to the bottom, it looked very close. But in fact, it was a big distance. Ye Jian and the other two only arrived at this village at 5:00 am.","As soon as the three of them entered the village, someone ran out of the entrance to a village and walked to the middle-aged man in the lead to say a few words. White Crane pursed his lips. They wanted to lock Azure Bird up alone!"]},{"number":4491,"title":"Chapter 4491: Fright","paragraphs":["Before Ye Jian left in a hurry, she gestured to Weaver and White Crane, indicating that they should stay put and wait for her to figure out the situation.","She was escorted away alone. Weaver’s gaze darkened, and he couldn’t help but step forward.","White Crane pressed Weaver’s wrist tightly. \"Don’t move first. Let’s figure it out first.\"","\"She’s already being separated from us. We can’t let anything happen to her!\" Weaver was anxious. It was fine if the three of them were together. Now that Azure Bird was separated from them, he was very worried that if something happened to Azure Bird, the two of them wouldn’t be able to help in time.","White Crane lowered his head and replied softly, \"They want to use her to threaten us. As long as we listen, she’ll be fine.\"","These people thought that the three people who had been kidnapped didn’t understand a word of what they were saying. Every time they communicated, they never thought of avoiding them. It was very convenient for White Crane to keep learning useful information, including why they separated Azure Bird.","Weaver was slightly relieved.","Ye Jian took advantage of the starlight and memorized the path she took to enter the village. After walking for about 15 minutes, she was brought to a small courtyard and pushed into a mud house with an iron door.","The iron door opened with a bang. Before Ye Jian entered, she heard a few screams from inside. They were the screams of a frightened young lady.","Ye Jian, whose hands were tied, was stunned. Besides the three of them, could it be that there were other Chinese tourists tied up in Gistan?","\"Go in!\"","Ye Jian’s back was pushed hard. She fell into the dark mud house.","The iron door closed again with a bang. Ye Jian took a while to get used to the darkness of the mud house. It wasn’t completely dark. There was a small window at the top of the mud wall that was big enough for children to crawl through. Sunlight was refracted through the small window. There was a trapezoid-shaped light port on the ground. It was this small light port that gave the dark mud house a hint of light. It allowed Ye Jian to see the situation in the house clearly.","Besides her, there were a few young girls around 16 or 17 years old. They all had big eyes and high nose bridges.","They were very afraid. Their eyes were filled with fear. When they saw Ye Jian enter, they hugged each other and trembled.","After being locked up for a long time, the room was filled with the smell of vomit and excrement.","Ye Jian wanted to approach the six young girls. However, the moment she took a step, the six girls screamed again. Ye Jian was so shocked that she was stunned in place. She thought for a moment and said softly, \"Don’t be afraid, don’t be afraid. I’m not a bad person. I’m a student they caught. Can you understand me? Can we communicate?\"","If they weren’t Chinese tourists, then... they wouldn’t understand what she was saying.","She spoke softly. Before the young ladies could speak, Ye Jian stood still and tried her best to show her kindness.","These girls had been provoked before. That was why they were so afraid.","She glanced to the side and saw a black embroidered flower cap. This was the kind of caps that the local girls liked. Six girls... seven flower caps...","Ye Jian sat down slowly. Facing the trembling girls, she whispered, \"Can you talk? I... was kidnapped by them. What about you? Are you the same as me?\"","The girls didn’t answer. They widened their eyes in fear. It seemed that apart from screaming, they couldn’t speak.","Ye Jian, who couldn’t gather any useful information, stopped talking. She sat down and looked at the girls quietly. They needed to calm down. She would ask about the situation later."]},{"number":4492,"title":"Chapter 4492: Scheme","paragraphs":["Ye Jian couldn’t gather any useful information immediately. When Weaver and White Crane were sent in, there was progress. They were sent to a room where 15 to 16 people were locked up.","The cave was dark, and they could only vaguely see figures. The two soldiers whose hands were tied were also stunned. Why were so many people locked up here?","Damn it, could it be that they were all Chinese?","There was no time to think. The two of them turned around at the same time and shouted outside the iron door, \"What on earth are you doing to my friend? Where did you take her? What on earth do you want? What on earth do you want?!\"","They needed to speak first and see if there were really Chinese people among the people being held. No one outside answered the two of them, but four people suddenly rushed out and pounced on them.","A middle-aged man from the Keer ethnic group, who could speak basic Chinese, said excitedly, \"We’re Chinese. We’re herdsmen at the border. The Keer ethnic group. They kidnapped the four of us. Kidnap... Help, help us...\"","The four people who pounced on him spoke in very stiff Chinese with an extremely strange accent. After they finished speaking, their tears flowed.","Weaver’s and White Crane’s expressions instantly darkened. There were really Chinese people kidnapped. Their trip was not in vain!","\"Don’t be anxious. Speak slowly. Speak slowly first.\" The two of them held onto the four Keer herdsmen who were tied up in Gistan. Tevezya wiped his tears and said, \"Okay, okay. Speak slowly, speak slowly...\"","White Crane gathered useful information from their conversation bit by bit. He learned that other than the four of them, the rest were villagers from Gistan. They were all unwilling to listen to the arrangements of the extremists of Gistan and were betrayed by their acquaintances before being locked up.","\"We need to communicate with them.\" White Crane listened to the villagers as he said to Weaver, \"If Q King doesn’t find us, we need to understand the situation here first before thinking of a way to escape and find Azure Bird. As for the four of them, we need to bring them back to the country.\"","Weaver nodded slightly. \"I’m worried that Azure Bird will come out.\" His low and soft voice was filled with worry. \"This isn’t the country. It’ll be very troublesome.\"","Just now, he wanted to resist, but Azure Bird stopped him. From her eyes, he could tell that she didn’t want to see them get beaten up again.","Actually, when these people’s fists landed on their bodies, it didn’t hurt much.","The corners of Weaver’s mouth were cracked. His eyes were cold as he said slowly, \"As long as we meet Q King, none of these bastards will be able to escape.\"","\"I think Azure Bird is safe for the time being. Let’s figure out the situation in the village first. Even if Q King brings his troops over, we can report the entire situation in the village immediately.\"","Soon, the imprisoned villagers of Gistan surrounded the two of them. From what Weaver said just now, they could tell that the two of them were Chinese. The Chinese were actually caught by the extremists in their village. This made the villagers of Gistan find it unbelievable.","Ye Jian couldn’t communicate with the imprisoned girls, but Weaver and White Crane had a smooth conversation with the prisoners in their cave.","The villagers of Gistan didn’t know how to speak Mandarin at all. They were in a hurry to express something. As they spoke their own language, they gestured and tried their best to convey what they wanted to express.","The vigilant White Crane didn’t expose that he could understand the language of the two ethnic groups. He quickly gathered all the useful information through this method.","Firstly, they were all villagers from a village at the border of Gistan. Some were betrayed by their families, some resisted, and some tried to escape but to no avail. They came from five different families."]},{"number":4493,"title":"Chapter 4493: Exposed","paragraphs":["They belonged to families in the village that strongly resisted. That was why they were locked up.","Their daughters were also detained. One of the daughters was dragged away by her cousin. White Crane found out that the girl who was dragged away was wrapped in a row of bombs by her brother and sent somewhere...","The girl’s mother covered her face with her hands and cried. The girl’s father hugged his wife. His eyes were red and tears were flowing out.","They never thought that one day, their son would personally send his sister away...","She didn’t know where she went. She didn’t need to know where she went. It was a place where she could never come back... They knew. They all knew.","The mother covered her face and cried softly. Two other women kept comforting her. Their daughters weren’t with them either.","The crying mother was helpless. She couldn’t stop what was happening. When she heard that her son had personally tied the bombs to his sister, her world collapsed.","She begged God to save her lost son and her poor daughter. She begged Him day and night, even if it meant giving up her life.","\"God will protect us. Nothing will happen to our child. God will protect us.\"","The other couple, who were also separated from their children, kept comforting the mother who was crying in despair. They placed all their hopes on God, hoping that God would see their piety and save them.","Weaver heard his fists clenching secretly.","This bunch of bastards! Wherever they went, they would bring nightmares. Although the injured person in front of him was a villager from Gistan, Weaver was still furious.","What bullshit about ’doing good and ending evil’!","They had clearly done many evil things, and their humanity was destroyed!","Why didn’t the military take action after such a huge matter happened? Why didn’t they send soldiers to deal with it?","Weaver spat out a mouthful of blood. He clenched his jaw and said fiercely, \"Let’s stabilize this place first. We can’t show any signs of weakness. Just you wait, bastards! I’ll kill anyone I see!\"","\"We need to get rid of them. We can’t let them harm the various countries.\"","White Crane spoke softly. The veins on the back of his hand were bulging as if they were about to break out of his skin. It took him a lot of effort to suppress the anger in his heart.","Tevezya pointed at himself as he spoke. He said word by word in awkward Mandarin, \"They’re all fine. All right... You guys and us are not fine.\"","He held Weaver with both hands and made a gesture that looked like a blessing. The corner of Weaver’s mouth was even split. He thought that Weaver was the most injured.","Weaver looked at him and listened attentively.","\"We want to run to Tianshan Mountain. We have to go fast. Tomorrow night, we’ll escape!\"","Then, he pointed at the villagers of Gistan. \"They’re locals from Gistan. Nothing will happen to them. They’re locked up and won’t be in danger. Don’t have to bring them along...\"","As the matter was complicated, the kidnapped Tevezya used their language again. The villagers who understood what was going on nodded.","That was right. They were all villagers here. Nothing would happen to them. The Chinese who were caught were different. The Chinese would be dragged out to die. They would be like the daughters of their neighbors. They would be tied to bombs and leave the village to go to the big city.","’God, please forgive the innocent Chinese.’","Weaver and White Crane looked at each other. White Crane asked softly, \"Have the four of you ever tried to escape?\""]},{"number":4494,"title":"Chapter 4494: Unexpected Gain","paragraphs":["\"Yes, but they have guns, so we don’t dare to. We’ll escape the day after tomorrow. We’ll leave with bombs. Tomorrow night, we’ll run. If we don’t, we’ll die...\" Tevezya finished speaking agitatedly. Then, he pulled a villager from Gistan and said, \"He’ll help us escape.\"","The villager from Gistan bowed and said a few words of blessing. He raised his feet and swept the ground. He swept away the weeds and picked up a blade of grass to draw on the dusty ground.","He drew a route that could allow White Crane and Weaver to escape. After they left, they would run on a small mountain path to the left and all the way into Tianshan Mountain. It would be difficult to find them in Tianshan Mountain. They could even go to the border to look for the soldiers stationed there.","After drawing, he raised his head and looked at the Chinese who were tied up in their country. He said to Tevezya very seriously, \"Remember this and escape. Don’t bring anyone else. It’s very dangerous and you’ll die.\"","The meaning was very easy to understand. After they escaped, they shouldn’t come back, let alone bring people over. This place was too dangerous. They would die if they brought people over.","Tevezya immediately translated the message to Weaver and White Crane in his clumsy Mandarin.","When the middle-aged man drew the route, the other villagers consciously stood to the side. There were even people guarding the door and watching.","White Crane noted down the escape route and asked Tevezya in a deep voice, \"Please help me ask if any Chinese have been dragged out by them.\"","\"No, the villagers were dragged out...\" The middle-aged man’s voice turned much more sorrowful. He looked at the villagers who were helping them escape. \"Their relatives didn’t come back. They might be dead.\"","White Crane looked up and saw the couple who had been praying to God. After spotting him, the couple’s pupils constricted, and they continued comforting the other villagers.","White Crane retracted his gaze. His facial expression was a little cold.","He didn’t completely believe the villagers of Gistan. He had come into contact with too many anti-terrorist incidents. He once saw foreign soldiers helping a woman carrying a child. In the end, the three of them were blown up into all kinds of body tissues.","He didn’t believe everyone, but White Crane believed in the middle-aged man in front of him who was focused on helping them escape. This was because one of the paths he drew that couldn’t be used was the path they came in from just now. At the same time, he drew a line into the village.","\"Can you tell me how many criminals there are here?\" he asked in their language. The middle-aged man’s deep eyes widened.","The middle-aged man from China, Tevezya, was a little excited. White Crane... could speak their language!","\"Who are you? Who are you?\" Tevezya was very agitated. His gaze became extremely scorching as he looked at White Crane. \"Are you...\"","Before he could finish, White Crane interrupted him softly, \"Don’t raise your head. Don’t stand up. Let’s talk slowly in a low voice. I’m sorry, but I can’t trust everyone. I want to know if there are many extremists in your village. Have they even reached out their hands to China?\"","White Crane’s attitude was calm as he communicated with Tevezya and the middle-aged man who helped them escape. The other party was very sincere, so he naturally had to show the corresponding sincerity to show his respect.","The middle-aged man sighed. He leaned against White Crane and sat down. He spoke very close to him, \"We have many extremists here. They all say that they’re warriors. Most of them are young people. My son wasn’t one in the past, but he changed later on. My brother wasn’t one in the past, but he changed later on too.\""]},{"number":4495,"title":"Chapter 4495: Chaos","paragraphs":["The middle-aged man from Gistan lowered his head and lowered his voice. \"No one can escape from here, and no one dares to come in. It’s the same for the Chinese people who were kidnapped. You’ll be taken away the day after tomorrow. I know that you want to survive. I want to help you leave this place. Run. Run toward the depths of Tianshan Mountain in your country to find the soldiers in military uniforms. They’re your guardian angels.","\"Don’t tell them what happened. You can’t say it. If you do, your guardian angels might come. I know they will.","\"We can’t let them come over. They should continue to protect your Tianshan Mountain and your borders. They shouldn’t die here. We don’t want to see them die again. It’s enough. It’s really enough.\"","The middle-aged man lowered his head and spoke in a low voice. A drop of water landed on the dusty ground. The water droplet was stained with dust and curled into a muddy bead, just like their current mood.","White Crane’s fingers trembled slightly. When the middle-aged man said that he saw people getting killed, was he referring to the armed police? Had they already been sacrificed?","He asked in a low voice, suppressing the cold sword intent.","\"No, they weren’t your guardian angels. They were a few of my old friends.\" The middle-aged man wiped the tears from the corners of his eyes. The immense sorrow he was suppressing made his shoulders collapse. \"They shouldn’t have died. They should be living well.\"","White Crane heaved a sigh of relief.","The middle-aged man fumbled in his arms for a while and took out a small accessory. He held it tightly. \"We couldn’t save them. We only took off their accessories. Please help me bring them out and bury them in the direction of Tianshan Mountain. I hope their souls can find their way home.\"","White Crane slowly reached out and took the accessory that had always been well-kept. It was clearly very light, but it was so heavy that White Crane’s hands were trembling.","He nodded heavily and promised, \"Okay, I’ll definitely bring it out and bury it in the direction of Tianshan Mountain.\"","\"Thank you, thank you. They’re gone, and we can’t find them. I hope the jade they wore when they were alive can guide them home and bring them back to heaven.\"","The sky outside gradually darkened. The dim sky was still so clear, like a mirror that couldn’t hide the dirt of everything. It was so beautiful and peaceful.","This was the border of Gistan. It was also a border that was evil, but the military of Gistan didn’t care much about it. That was why this place became a paradise for the extremists of Gistan.","At 6:00 am, a vicious attack occurred in a small county at the border of China. The border soldiers killed 12 criminals and successfully rescued a Keer person from the Republic of Gistan with a bomb tied to his body.","The news of what happened at the border didn’t reach Accra. After clearing the event location and verifying the number of people until it was dark, the girl from Gistan who was successfully rescued fainted from shock. After the military surgeon’s diagnosis, it was concluded that there were no other problems with her body. She was just in shock.","The girl from Gistan woke up at around 7:00 am. The first thing she did was ignore the long needle on the back of her hand. Before the military surgeon could react, she had already gotten up from the bed and knelt on the bed while facing the military surgeon. This frightened the military surgeon. He quickly stopped the girl from doing anything and called the sentinel on duty.","Soon, the company commander of the border defense battalion arrived. Due to the language barrier, the company commander specially brought a soldier from the Keer ethnic group to the ward."]},{"number":4496,"title":"Chapter 4496: Freedom","paragraphs":["Five minutes later, the main border defense team received an extremely urgent call. Only then did they know that herdsmen at the Chinese border had been kidnapped by extremists from Gistan.","The commander-in-chief of the border defense team couldn’t delay calling the military for even a second. That was how he knew that the military had taken action.","The military was very reserved. As they were entering other countries to rescue them, they only said that they would solve all the problems. This sentence needed a deep understanding to comprehend the bloodiness behind it.","In a small village in Gistan, people were sitting in a dark mud-walled room with bloodshot eyes. The morning sun shone on a corner of the room. They hummed a sad song with tears in their eyes.","Their loved ones... were dead and would never come back.","Tianshan Mountain was covered in snow. Eagles spread their wings and flew past the village. However, their relatives could no longer see the snow on Tianshan Mountain. They could no longer see the eagles spreading their wings and flying past. From then on, they fell into a long sleep.","The low and long tone was so sad that it touched everyone’s hearts.","\"My family, my family. Don’t leave us and go to a distant and cold place. My family, my family...\"","The sorrowful song echoed in the dark house. The villagers of Gistan who had lost their loved ones were as sad as children. They leaned against each other and cried together.","The cries shrouded everyone’s hearts like dark clouds. They didn’t recover from the sorrow of their loved ones’ deaths until the sky turned dark. On the other hand, the girls from Gistan who were being held captive were also crying.","Ye Jian held Ayiguli’s hands tightly. She was the only girl who could speak Chinese. She went to school in the border village for two years. Ye Jian held her hands tightly and said softly, \"It’s not your fault. It’s not your fault. Ayiguli... It’s not your fault. Don’t cry... It’s not your fault.\"","Ayiguli, who was crying on Ye Jian’s shoulder, gritted her teeth and bit her sleeve. This was the only way to stop her from crying.","She returned to the village she hadn’t returned to for two years. She returned to her home and saw her parents who she missed. She saw her brother and uncle who loved her in the past...","Not long after, her nightmares started... Her relatives left one after another. Even after so long, her nightmares continued. They would continue for generations and never pass.","Ye Jian hugged this girl who blamed herself for not succeeding in committing suicide twice. She comforted her softly. Her eyes landed on the iron door, and the look in her eyes were like polished arrows. Her eyes were shining with a cold light.","There were footsteps outside. It wasn’t one person. There were five to seven people.","They were walking over.","The sensitive Gistan girls heard the footsteps. They hugged Ye Jian and Ayiguli tightly and widened their beautiful eyes. They stared at the iron door in fear and told the crying Ayiguli that someone was coming.","Ayiguli, who was crying on Ye Jian’s shoulder, stopped at this second. She raised her head, and her big eyes, which seemed to be covered with dust, shone. She quickly said to Ye Jian, \"Ye Jian, your chance to escape is here! You must escape!\"","Without giving Ye Jian a chance to speak, she turned her head and spoke quickly to the Gistan girls in the local language. She needed them to create chaos and help Ye Jian escape.","The Gistan girls obviously didn’t expect this. They were stunned for a moment."]},{"number":4497,"title":"Chapter 4497: Intense","paragraphs":["The footsteps got closer and closer. Ye Jian didn’t give the Gistan girls a chance to speak. She forcefully pulled away Ayiguli, who was trying to help her escape, and said word by word, \"Ayiguli, listen carefully. Nothing will happen to you, and nothing will happen to me. Believe me, you must believe me. You must believe me, you’ll definitely regain your freedom!","\"You will be saved. The villagers who were kidnapped with you will be saved too. I swear on my life that all of us will be free again.\"","Ayiguli was a strong-willed girl. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have attempted suicide multiple times.","Ye Jian knew what would happen to her. She wasn’t afraid. She even looked forward to it. Only then would she have a chance to escape.","However, she was worried that the strong-willed Ayiguli would do something stupid again. She quickly comforted Ayiguli before the criminals from Gistan appeared.","Ayiguli shook her head. She kept shaking her head. She didn’t want anyone to save her. She didn’t want anyone to save her at all. If it wasn’t for her, her family wouldn’t have died.","\"Ye, don’t come back after you escape. Run to your country’s Tianshan Mountain. You’ll be...\"","Bang!","The iron door was pushed open. At the last second, Ayiguli expressed what she wanted to say. \"You’ll see your country’s guardian angels in the deepest part of Tianshan Mountain.\"","The glaring white light of the flashlight swept across the girls. A boy who was no more than 16 or 17 years old was holding a replica rifle. His young face was engraved with a ruthlessness that didn’t belong to his age as he spoke fiercely in the local language.","His tone was very fast, as if he was accusing them of something.","Ye Jian recognized the boy who spoke as the boy who beat up Weaver during the day. He was an extremely evil person.","The boy was furious. He accused one of the girls of being unfaithful to God. He accused the girl of being unwilling to give up her life. He was ashamed of having a sister like her.","Facing her younger brother’s accusation, the girl with red and swollen eyes shouted back in an even angrier voice. She scolded him loudly and cried and shouted with all her might. Her voice was hoarse.","Ye Jian couldn’t understand what they were saying at all. The boy, who was scolding fiercely, was pulled to the side. An adult man said a few words in an impatient tone. Ye Jian, who was in the middle, felt that she was being protected even more by the other girls.","The silent Ayiguli finally screamed, \"No, no, you can’t take her away.\" She spoke in Mandarin. Then, she screamed back in the local language and fought with her meager strength.","The other girls from Gistan protected Ye Jian tightly. They could vaguely guess what these vicious and evil people wanted to do. The girls wanted to stop them and use their strength to stop everything.","It was useless.","Ye Jian was dragged out of their arms. She was dragged out of the dark house roughly.","Her legs were held tightly by the Gistan girls. One of the Gistan girls pounced on the criminals who were holding Ye Jian back. She screamed tragically and used her hands to hit and grab them.","The girls’ strength was nothing for an adult man. They couldn’t resist at all. A middle-aged man with a beard raised his leg and kicked a girl down. He cursed loudly. Then, a female voice came from behind these people."]},{"number":4498,"title":"Chapter 4498: A Great Move","paragraphs":["The young lady’s voice was filled with viciousness.","She had been standing at the back and was blocked by a few adult men, so Ye Jian didn’t notice her immediately.","Now that she had revealed herself, the first thing she did was to tighten her long braids. Her beautiful face was filled with darkness as she raised her hand and slapped Ayiguli’s face.","Slap!","She slapped Ayiguli’s face from left to right.","She must have said the most vicious words. Ye Jian, who was completely grabbed by the shoulders of two adult men, saw that Ayiguli’s pale face had turned gray and desperate.","The young lady who spoke laughed proudly. She was teasing Ayiguli.","She was the former good friend of the imprisoned Gistan girls. Now, she had become the master of her former companions’ lives. She could raise the rifle in her hand and shoot at her former companions.","Her laughter stimulated the unyielding Ayiguli. She glared at her former good friend and criticized her in the loudest and most vicious voice, \"You’ll definitely be condemned by God. You’ll definitely receive the greatest punishment. I, Ayiguli, will use my life to curse you!\"","Ayiguli, who knew that she was powerless to resist, stared at the familiar face in front of her. Her beautiful eyes had lost their luster. All their luster was covered by grayness. There was no light or hope.","Ye Jian seemed to have thought of something. Fear appeared on her face. She shouted loudly, \"No! Ayiguli! No!\"","Bang!","Ayiguli, who had attempted suicide several times, got what she wanted this time. She used all her strength to hit the round bolt on the iron door.","She used so much strength that the small round bolt smashed into her skull, the hardest part of the human body. Blood dyed her black hair.","This scene happened too quickly. Ye Jian was the only one who had a premonition that Ayiguli would kill herself. Even if she broke free from the restraints of the two adult men, it was too late.","Ayiguli leaned against the iron door and fell. Her beautiful eyes stared at Ye Jian, who ran back after being dragged outside. Ayiguli was very weak now. She was so weak that the sound she made was like a newborn cat. It was so weak that she could leave at any moment.","\"Run, Ye... Run...\"","Ayiguli looked at the Chinese girl running toward her. Blood and tears flowed down her big eyes. ’Run. Don’t come back. Run, my friend. Don’t come back. Run, run...’","\"Catch her, catch her!\"","Ye Jian’s escape made the abusers angry. They didn’t care about Ayiguli’s death. She committed suicide. It had nothing to do with them.","The young boy smashed Ye Jian’s shoulder with the butt of his gun and cursed fiercely. He scolded Ayiguli for being disloyal and the Han girls for resisting.","The entire dark house was in chaos. The shrill voices of the Gistan girls struck everyone’s hearts. They pounced on Ayiguli and shouted her name.","At the last second of her life, her beautiful eyes were burning with the light of destruction as she stared at these familiar faces.","\"I curse you, Anal... Your soul will definitely go to hell.\" Ayiguli used her last bit of strength to complete the curse on her former friend, Anal.","The snow-white flashlight shone on Ayiguli. The glaring blood reflected in Ye Jian’s eyes."]},{"number":4499,"title":"Chapter 4499: Do It","paragraphs":["How painful was it? The beautiful Ayiguli must be in pain. Her skull was shattered. It had to be very painful. Silly girl, silly Ayiguli... Why did she do this? Why did she have to sacrifice her life for this bunch of damned things?","Ye Jian said that she would definitely escape with them. Why didn’t the silly Ayiguli remember?","Ye Jian’s eyes were red. She only had eyes for the fallen Ayiguli. The moment the gun butt smashed over, she glanced at the young boy coldly.","It was their ignorance that harmed a teenage girl! And the young boy in front of them was one of the executioners!","Ye Jian resisted. She grabbed the boy’s replica AK rifle with one hand and pulled it toward her.","The boy didn’t expect the hostages from China to resist. He didn’t realize that he had stepped into the door of death. He even shouted, \"Let go of your dirty hands. Let...\"","\"You deserve to die!\"","Ye Jian’s voice was as sharp as a knife. It stabbed into the other party’s heart, making this ignorant boy feel huge danger.","He subconsciously released his grip on the gun. He wanted to escape...","Ye Jian would never have the chance to escape or speak again. She attacked at lightning speed and hit his throat with her elbow.","Killing moves, they were all killing moves. At close range, they were all killing moves.","The last scream of the young boy, whose hands were stained with blood, was filled with pain and horror.","Plop...","He fell to the ground with his head raised. His eyes, which were equally beautiful but filled with ignorance and viciousness, were wide open. He never expected his life to end like this. He was completely unprepared.","The event location got even more chaotic. No one expected the hostages to resist so violently. They were caught off guard.","They didn’t even realize that the fallen Karaigi didn’t trip but died with grievances.","The battlefield changed instantly. It was impossible to go according to plan. Before Ayiguli killed herself, Ye Jian had a plan for her escape.","If she was taken away alone like the girl who was sent out by her brother, she would make a move along the way.","If she was brought out by these people and they planned to execute her, she would do it at the midpoint.","If Captain Xia and the rest came over, she would cooperate from the inside and clean up all the criminals.","She had many plans, and every one of them had a good escape plan.","However... the battlefield was ever-changing. No matter how good the plan was, it couldn’t catch up with the sudden changes.","Ye Jian took the replica of the AK rifle. Before she left, she glanced coldly at the girl who once spoke to Ayiguli. Under the flickering flashlight, Ye Jian remembered her face.","She would remember her! She would definitely make this girl repay this debt!","The Gistan girls who were hugging Ayiguli cried sorrowfully. They kept shouting and talking. Some girls kept wiping the blood that kept flowing out...","Ye Jian ran away. She snatched a rifle and ran away like a sandstorm at night.","\"She ran away. She ran away. She tripped Karaigi and snatched his gun!\"","\"Hurry up and chase her! Don’t let her escape!\"","\"Take the gun back from her! Hurry!\"","The extremists didn’t realize that the fallen Karaigi had already stopped breathing. Ye Jian’s speed of escape was too fast. They didn’t have the time to pull the fallen Karaigi up. They all chased after Ye Jian."]},{"number":4500,"title":"Chapter 4500: Killing Intent","paragraphs":["The extremist who was running at the back turned his head and shouted at the dark corner, \"Anal, lock them up! Hurry! Lock them up. Don’t let them escape!\"","The girl who had teased Ayiguli walked out from the corner again. She aimed the gun in her hand at the girls and fired a shot at the ground.","\"All of you, go in. Don’t make me kill you!\"","Her conscience had long been destroyed. She had already lost her pure kindness. She had become cold and heartless. She had long become a killing machine.","The girls from Gistan glared at Anal. The seeds of hatred had already germinated. They were just waiting to take root.","She didn’t care. She was a warrior. Even if she died, she would go to heaven. She would never go to hell!","The iron door was locked again. Ana looked down at the blood flowing outside the iron door. It was Ayiguli’s blood.","Bah!","She spat on the dark red blood and walked toward Karaigi, who had tripped and hadn’t gotten up. Soon, the girls who were locked up in the house again heard screams from outside.","They ignored it and only hugged Ayiguli in sorrow and pain...","Outside, Anal realized that Karaigi was dead. Karaigi, whose face was pale, had his eyes wide open in horror.","She wasn’t screaming because of Karaigi’s death. What made her scream was... Ye Jian, who had clearly escaped, was standing in front of her again.","Ye Jian didn’t keep running forward. She wasn’t at a disadvantage in terms of speed. In addition, the village had many twists and turns. After turning a corner, she jumped onto the wall and laid down. She didn’t appear again until her pursuers ran forward with their flashlights.","There were a total of six figures, without the Gistan girl who humiliated Ayiguli.","Ye Jian didn’t look for her comrades immediately. She took her gun and returned to her original spot. She saw a figure moving around with a flashlight under the faint starlight.","She walked closer and said, \"Hello.\" Anal turned around. The glaring light of the flashlight swept past her eyes. For a moment, she was afraid and screamed. She wanted to call out loudly, but Ye Jian didn’t give her a chance.","Her scream and Ye Jian’s gunshot sounded almost at the same time.","Bang!","The bullet shot into her body at the closest distance.","The gunshot sounded outside the house. The girls in the house hugged Ayiguli, who was still warm. They were not afraid of the gunshots.","The girls of Gistan weren’t afraid now. Their spirits were completely broken.","There was another extremist’s corpse outside the house. Ye Jian, who had a cold expression on her face, stood beside Anal, who was still breathing. She took out the key to lock the iron door and the imitation AK rifle.","The closed iron door opened again. The Gistan girls in the house didn’t turn their heads. Even if they were to die now, they had nothing to be afraid of.","Ye Jian rushed in and whispered to the girls, \"Hurry up and leave!\"","Anal was shot in the heart. Her fingers moved slightly. Losing her focus, she kept blinking. She saw someone running past her. It seemed to be... It seemed to be... She closed her eyes and stopped breathing.","In the pitch-black night, there were countless killing intents and dirt hidden. Countless sins were born. Before dawn arrived, the killing intent, dirt, and sins here would erupt until they were all cleaned up."]}]);
